window.MARKET_VIEW_DATA=[{"date":"2026-08-17","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"月度（7月）调度会","title":"2026年上半年，可再生能源发电装机达到24.55亿千瓦，占全国电力总装机的60.7%，其中风电光伏发电装机（约19.5亿千瓦）占比接近一半，太阳能发电装机与燃煤发电装机基本持平","summary":"2026年上半年，我国新能源和可再生能源发展总体保持平稳态势，可再生能源发电装机达到24.55亿千瓦，占全国电力总装机的60.7%，其中风电光伏发电装机（约19.5亿千瓦）占比接近一半，太阳能发电装机与燃煤发电装机基本持平。2026年1—6月，可再生能源新增装机1.17亿千瓦，占全部新增装机的73.9%；发电量1.96万亿千瓦时，占全国总发电量的41.2%。其中，风电光伏发电量合计1.25万亿千瓦时，占全社会用电量比重达到24.6%。可再生能源保供应、促转型的作用日益明显。","sourceUrl":"https://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/nytt/202608/t20260817_1908934.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-17|中国|2026年上半年，可再生能源发电装机达到24.55亿千瓦，占全国电力总装机的60.7%，其中风电光伏发电装机（约19.5亿千瓦）占比接近一半，太阳能发电装机与燃煤发电装机基本持平"},{"date":"2026-08-14","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"DPPA","title":"泰国内阁于 8 月 5 日批准了一项总理府条例草案，拟成立数据中心业务政策委员会，并由一名副总理担任主席","summary":"Thailand’s cabinet on Aug. 5 approved a draft Prime Minister’s Office Regulation that would establish a Data Center Business Policy Committee chaired by a deputy prime minister. The committee would be responsible for setting rules governing data centers’ electricity and water use, as well as reviewing and issuing relevant licences. ERC proposes a 4.5 million baht (about USD 135,800) per MW guarantee to curb \"phantom loads\". New projects must reach commercial operation within 5 to 7 years under a dedicated Category 9 tariff. Rules are expected to take effect in Q4 2026, possibly applied retroactively to all operators.","sourceUrl":"https://www.reccessary.com/en/news/thailand-weighs-financial-guarantees-for-data-centre-developers","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-14|泰国|泰国内阁于 8 月 5 日批准了一项总理府条例草案，拟成立数据中心业务政策委员会，并由一名副总理担任主席"},{"date":"2026-08-12","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"放缓VRE","title":"肯尼亚电力公司呼吁放缓光伏和风电等可变可再生能源（VRE）的新增并网速度，以应对电网稳定性、电能质量以及电价上涨等方面的担忧","summary":"Kenya Power has called for strategic moderation in the addition of variable renewable energy (VRE) sources such as solar and wind, citing concerns over grid stability, power quality, and rising electricity costs.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/08/12/kenya-power-calls-for-moderation-in-solar-and-wind-integration-to-strengthen-grid-stability/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-12|肯尼亚|肯尼亚电力公司呼吁放缓光伏和风电等可变可再生能源（VRE）的新增并网速度，以应对电网稳定性、电能质量以及电价上涨等方面的担忧"},{"date":"2026-08-11","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"微电网","title":"肯尼亚农村电气化和可再生能源公司（REREC）计划于2026年9月底前投运120个光伏微电网，覆盖14个长期能源服务不足的边远郡县","summary":"Kenya’s Rural Electrification and Renewable Energy Corporation (REREC) is preparing to commission 120 newly constructed solar mini-grids in remote communities by the end of September 2026. The rollout is being implemented under the $150 million Kenya Off-Grid Solar Access Project (KOSAP), supported by the World Bank, and is aimed at improving access to clean electricity and water in 14 historically underserved frontier counties.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/08/11/kenya-to-commission-120-solar-mini-grids-under-150-million-kosap-project/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-11|肯尼亚|肯尼亚农村电气化和可再生能源公司（REREC）计划于2026年9月底前投运120个光伏微电网，覆盖14个长期能源服务不足的边远郡县"},{"date":"2026-08-10","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"AIDC","company":"晶科","title":"晶科推出面向 AI 数据中心的 Sunny 365 智慧光储系统，融合高效组件（680W）、长时储能、智能运维、构网、黑启动、并离网切换等能力，适配 800V 高压直流（HVDC） 数据中心，以解决 AIDC 供电可靠性、能源成本和并网容量三大核心痛点","summary":"JinkoSolar, the global leading PV and ESS supplier, today officially unveiled the “Sunny 365” Smart Solar-Storage System—an integrated solar-storage system solution for artificial intelligence data centers (AIDC). This solution deeply integrates high-efficiency photovoltaics, long-duration energy storage, and intelligent operations and maintenance to build a comprehensive energy system for AI data centers. The newly launched AIDC solution precisely addresses the three core pain points faced by AI data centers during 24/7 continuous operation: power supply reliability, energy costs, and grid connection capacity.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/08/10/jinkosolar-unveils-the-sunny-365-smart-solar-storage-system-an-integrated-solar-storage-aidc-model/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-08-10|中国|晶科推出面向 AI 数据中心的 Sunny 365 智慧光储系统，融合高效组件（680W）、长时储能、智能运维、构网、黑启动、并离网切换等能力，适配 800V 高压直流（HVDC） 数据中心，以解决 AIDC 供电可靠性、能源成本和并网容量三大核心痛点"},{"date":"2026-08-10","country":"新疆","geo":"中国","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"联通云数据中心","title":"新疆信息产业园项目由新疆联通与昌吉州国资体系合作实施","summary":"新疆信息产业园项目由新疆联通与昌吉州国资体系合作实施。负荷侧为新疆联通云数据中心，算力 8192P、总负荷4.72万kW；电源侧建设 100MW光伏+25MW/100MWh储能，通过110kV专线点对点直连，预计年底前投运，绿电直供比例约36%。","sourceUrl":"https://sfj.xinjiang.gov.cn/xjszfzj/bmxw/202608/5c191aff48bf47be826968c56bc257af.shtml","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-10|新疆|新疆信息产业园项目由新疆联通与昌吉州国资体系合作实施"},{"date":"2026-08-06","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"AIDC","company":"远景","title":"远景宣布位于内蒙古乌兰察布的远景银河园区正式投运","summary":"Envision, a global leader in green technology, today announced the commissioning of the Envision Galaxy Campus in Ulanqab, Inner Mongolia, a next-generation AI infrastructure campus designed to accelerate the deployment of large-scale artificial intelligence. Powered directly by renewable energy and designed to scale to over 2GW of capacity, the campus in Ulanqab introduces a new approach to meeting the growing energy and infrastructure demands of AI.","sourceUrl":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/envision-commissions-galaxy-campus-in-ulanqab-establishing-a-new-model-for-gigawatt-scale-ai-infrastructure-302844834.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-08-06|中国|远景宣布位于内蒙古乌兰察布的远景银河园区正式投运"},{"date":"2026-08-05","country":"日本","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"东京燃气","title":"东京燃气与 Hexa Energy Services 就福岛一个 49.7MW/202.1MWh 的电网侧储能项目签署了为期 20 年的长期电力承购协议（offtake agreement），该项目计划于 2029 年商业投运","summary":"Japanese utility Tokyo Gas has entered into a long-term offtake agreement for a 49.7MW/202.1MWh battery storage project in Fukushima Prefecture. Announced last week (28 July) by offtake partner Hexa Energy Services, Tokyo Gas will acquire operating rights and play the asset’s stored energy into electricity markets over the 20-year term of the agreement. Hexa Energy Services will develop, own and maintain the facility, which is scheduled to go into commercial operation in 2029.","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/japan-tokyo-gas-enters-offtake-for-200mwh-fukushima-bess-eku-energy-nears-completion-of-first-project/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-05|日本|东京燃气与 Hexa Energy Services 就福岛一个 49.7MW/202.1MWh 的电网侧储能项目签署了为期 20 年的长期电力承购协议（offtake agreement），该项目计划于 2029 年商业投运"},{"date":"2026-08-05","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"安装商及设备登记","title":"泰国正式登记符合资质的光伏安装商及设备，登记申请开放至 9 月 30 日","summary":"Thailand is formally registering qualified solar installers and equipment ahead of launching a government-backed program that will aim to deploy rooftop solar on 500,000 households. The registration process is open until September 30. She also shared that all operators, engineers, installers and equipment registered by the government must prove they can deliver a high-quality, safe, efficient solar system with a lifespan of at least 20 years.","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/05/thailand-registers-solar-installers-equipment-ahead-of-rooftop-pv-expansion/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-05|泰国|泰国正式登记符合资质的光伏安装商及设备，登记申请开放至 9 月 30 日"},{"date":"2026-08-05","country":"澳大利亚","geo":"大洋洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"发电来源要求","title":"堪培拉近期提出政策规定，数据中心必须新建可再生能源发电设施，而不能从电网取电","summary":"Recent proposed policy from Canberra has mandated data centres ​must build new renewable sources of power rather than pulling electricity from the ⁠grid. Both Queensland and the Northern Territory have backed gas-fired power for data centres. The Northern ​Territory last month awarded 185 hectares (457 acres) of land near the capital Darwin to Beetaloo Digital ​to develop a 2-gigawatt data centre, which its parent company Beetaloo Energy (BTL.AX), opens new tab plans to support with power from shale gas resources it ‌is ⁠developing in the Beetaloo sub-Basin. It estimated generating 1 gigawatt of power would require 200 terajoules of gas per day.","sourceUrl":"https://www.reuters.com/business/energy/australias-new-data-centres-must-be-majority-renewable-powered-says-minister-2026-08-05/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-05|澳大利亚|堪培拉近期提出政策规定，数据中心必须新建可再生能源发电设施，而不能从电网取电"},{"date":"2026-08-04","country":"南非","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"德业","title":"家庭能源管理公司Plentify 将 2.7GWh（160,000 套） 的德业户储系统聚合为虚拟电厂","summary":"Home energy management company Plentify aggregates 2.7GWh of Deye home battery systems into virtual power plant. Deye has already deployed more than 160,000 residential battery storage systems in South Africa. Totalling 2.7GWh, their charging and dispatch will be coordinated through Plentify’s VPP platform. Through the partnership, Deye will also market Plentify’s intelligent geyser controller, HotBot, which will give customers additional opportunities to make savings while contributing to grid flexibility.","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/south-africa-plentify-aggregates-2-7gwh-of-deye-home-battery-systems-into-virtual-power-plant/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-08-04|南非|家庭能源管理公司Plentify 将 2.7GWh（160,000 套） 的德业户储系统聚合为虚拟电厂"},{"date":"2026-08-01","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"产品","company":"EV","title":"泰国目前正在研究商议国家级电动汽车漫游枢纽，EPPO、EGAT、MEA、PEA以及 PTT其下OR正致力于改善全国充电基础设施之间的连接","summary":"Thailand is now studying a proposed national EV Roaming Hub, with EPPO, EGAT, MEA, PEA, and PTT Oil and Retail Business working toward better connections across the national charging infrastructure. The plan isn’t operating as a universal system yet, so confirmed proposals must be separated from future expectations.","sourceUrl":"https://www.chiangraitimes.com/auto/thailands-ev-roaming-hub/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-08-01|泰国|泰国目前正在研究商议国家级电动汽车漫游枢纽，EPPO、EGAT、MEA、PEA以及 PTT其下OR正致力于改善全国充电基础设施之间的连接"},{"date":"2026-07-31","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"SunKing/d.light","title":"d.light 和 Sun King 都采用“先用后付”（PAYGo）模式，向缺电的家庭销售家用光伏系统和电器","summary":"Both d.light and Sun King sell solar home systems and appliances to households that lack electricity using a pay-as-you-go (PAYGo) model. Customers pay in small instalments, often through mobile apps, instead of putting up the full price upfront. A $50 million green bond issued by affordable energy company D.light in June, and $286 million in securitized debt by rival Sun King mid-2025 are testing whether institutional investors will back a pay-as-you-go business model on a commercial scale.","sourceUrl":"https://apnews.com/article/grid-solar-renewable-energy-finance-king-3c32d55f597a397261f2fb56435cb085","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-31|肯尼亚|d.light 和 Sun King 都采用“先用后付”（PAYGo）模式，向缺电的家庭销售家用光伏系统和电器"},{"date":"2026-07-30","country":"英国","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"阳台光伏标准","title":"根据英国能源安全与净零部（DESNZ）的临时产品规范，家用插电式光伏须满足标准包括微逆变器在任何时候都不得向家庭输出超过 800 VA，约等于 800W","summary":"Under the Department for Energy Security and Net Zero's (DESNZ) interim product specification, compliant solar power consumer kits must meet very strict criteria. This includes a microinverter (which converts direct current electricity into alternating current electricity) which can’t feed more than 800 VA (Volt-Amperes), roughly 800W, into the home at any one time. Systems must connect via a standard BS 1363 three-pin UK socket using a manufacturer-supplied, non-rewireable moulded plug with a fuse rated at no more than 5A. Typically, most kits will comprise two 400W panels, each measuring around 1.7m x 1m in size and weighing around 20Kg. However, the regulations allow up to four panels wit","sourceUrl":"https://www.techradar.com/home/smart-home/three-to-five-years-is-a-realistic-payback-period-plug-in-solar-panels-will-be-legal-next-month-but-what-do-they-cost-who-can-fit-them-and-is-your-home-even-suitable-we-asked-the-experts","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-30|英国|根据英国能源安全与净零部（DESNZ）的临时产品规范，家用插电式光伏须满足标准包括微逆变器在任何时候都不得向家庭输出超过 800 VA，约等于 800W"},{"date":"2026-07-27","country":"台湾","geo":"中国","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"新建建筑安装光伏","title":"自 2026 年 8 月 1 日起，台湾将根据内政部（MOI）与经济部（MOEA）联合推出的新建筑标准，要求某些新建、扩建和翻修建筑安装太阳能光伏系统","summary":"Starting August 1, 2026, Taiwan will require certain new, expanded and renovated buildings to install solar PV systems under new building standards jointly introduced by the Ministry of the Interior (MOI) and the Ministry of Economic Affairs (MOEA). The Standards for Installing Photovoltaic Power Generation Equipment in Buildings apply to buildings with a floor area of 1,000 m² or more. Under the rules, developers must install 1 kW of solar PV capacity for every 20 m² of floor area.","sourceUrl":"https://taiyangnews.info/markets/taiwan-august-1-2026-deadline-for-mandatory-rooftop-solar","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-27|台湾|自 2026 年 8 月 1 日起，台湾将根据内政部（MOI）与经济部（MOEA）联合推出的新建筑标准，要求某些新建、扩建和翻修建筑安装太阳能光伏系统"},{"date":"2026-07-23","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"天合","title":"天合“源网荷储一体化虚拟电厂AI智慧运营平台应用”成功入选工业和信息化部印发“2025年人工智能应用典型案例名单”，该平台构建了“新能源发电功率+算力负荷+电网电价”三位一体的智能预测体系","summary":"天合“源网荷储一体化虚拟电厂AI智慧运营平台应用”成功入选工业和信息化部印发“2025年人工智能应用典型案例名单”，该平台构建了“新能源发电功率+算力负荷+电网电价”三位一体的智能预测体系。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3zXv2QkG0757du5s9PmxCA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-23|中国|天合“源网荷储一体化虚拟电厂AI智慧运营平台应用”成功入选工业和信息化部印发“2025年人工智能应用典型案例名单”，该平台构建了“新能源发电功率+算力负荷+电网电价”三位一体的智能预测体系"},{"date":"2026-07-23","country":"英国","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"正泰","title":"正泰和 Octopus Energy 署了两项战略合作协议，正式建立双线合作","summary":"正泰与 Octopus Energy 签署了两项战略合作协议，重点覆盖新能源设备、工程服务、数字能源技术，以及可再生能源基础设施和虚拟电厂（VPP）合作。第一项协议：正泰新能、正泰电源、正泰新能源将与 Octopus Energy 在可再生能源项目开发方面展开合作，正泰提供光伏组件、逆变器、储能、变压器、智能电表、电缆、充电方案等设备，并可配套 EPC 服务。第二项协议：正泰安能与 Octopus Energy 将在中国大陆市场推进 VPP 合作，围绕分布式能源聚合、需求侧响应和智慧能源管理展开。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4BG2NnG7OzooDBZXJONjlw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-23|英国|正泰和 Octopus Energy 署了两项战略合作协议，正式建立双线合作"},{"date":"2026-07-23","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"正泰","title":"正泰获得了Angeles电力公司 的 PALDO CT 62.462 MWp（49.920MW）光伏发电项目 EPC 总承包合同","summary":"CHINT has been awarded the turnkey Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) contract by Angeles Power Inc. (API) for the 62.462 MWdc / 49.920 MWac PALDO CT Solar Photovoltaic Power Plant, including a 69kV substation and associated facilities. Located in Concepcion, Tarlac, Philippines, the project marks another significant milestone in CHINT's contribution to the country's renewable energy development.","sourceUrl":"https://www.chintglobal.com/ph/en/about-us/news-center/news/chint-secures-turnkey-epc-contract-for-62-462-mwdc-solar---49-92.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-23|菲律宾|正泰获得了Angeles电力公司 的 PALDO CT 62.462 MWp（49.920MW）光伏发电项目 EPC 总承包合同"},{"date":"2026-07-23","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"BOI","title":"2026 年上半年（1–6 月），泰国投资促进委员会（BOI）共收到 1,299 个投资申请项目，合计投资额 1.473 万亿泰铢（2946 亿元），同比增加 37%","summary":"Thailand's Board of Investment (BOI) received investment applications totaling 1.473 trillion baht in the first half of 2026, a 37% increase year-on-year.The digital industry was the primary driver, accounting for 1.115 trillion baht of the total, with major projects in data centers, data hosting, and cloud services. Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) applications made up 1.368 trillion baht of the total, with Singapore being the largest contributor at 1.121 trillion baht, mostly in the digital sector.","sourceUrl":"https://www.nationthailand.com/business/economy/40068948","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-23|泰国|2026 年上半年（1–6 月），泰国投资促进委员会（BOI）共收到 1,299 个投资申请项目，合计投资额 1.473 万亿泰铢（2946 亿元），同比增加 37%"},{"date":"2026-07-21","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Constant Energy","title":"Constant Energy 与越南大型工业矿物加工公司 Phenikaa Hue 在越南 Phong Dien工业区的 Phenikaa Hue 制造工厂 928.75 KWp屋顶太阳能项目投运产，PE2T承接EPC","summary":"Constant Energy, a leading renewable energy developer in Southeast Asia, and Phenikaa Hue, a major industrial mineral processing company in Vietnam, today celebrated the inauguration of a 928.75 kWp rooftop solar project at Phenikaa Hue’s manufacturing facility in the Phong Dien Industrial Zone, Hue City, Vietnam. Everything progressed smoothly thanks to the strong support from Phenikaa’s management team and our EPC partner, PE2T.","sourceUrl":"https://constantenergy.net/press-releases/constant-energy-and-phenikaa-hue-928-75-kwp-rooftop-solar-project-in-central-vietnam/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-21|越南|Constant Energy 与越南大型工业矿物加工公司 Phenikaa Hue 在越南 Phong Dien工业区的 Phenikaa Hue 制造工厂 928.75 KWp屋顶太阳能项目投运产，PE2T承接EPC"},{"date":"2026-07-20","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"天合","title":"天合正式加入全国首个省级固态变压器（SST）产业联盟，并当选副理事长单位","summary":"天合正式加入全国首个省级固态变压器（SST）产业联盟，并当选副理事长单位。行业预测称，SST 市场未来增长大，2030 年全球全场景规模有望突破 1.2 万亿元，仅 AI 数据中心赛道远期空间近 2000 亿元。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SKqs03hut-K0ZtD2mF5QwQ","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-20|中国|天合正式加入全国首个省级固态变压器（SST）产业联盟，并当选副理事长单位"},{"date":"2026-07-20","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"DHD","title":"亚洲开发银行（ADB）向DHD公司放款3700万美元（2.51亿元），支持越南首个47.5MWp大型漂浮光伏项目建设，该项目与现有175 MW水电结合","summary":"The Asian Development Bank (ADB) has signed a loan agreement worth $37 million to support Viet Nam’s first large-scale floating solar power project. The financing has been provided to the Da Nhim–Ham Thuan–Da Mi Hydro Power Joint Stock Company (DHD), marking a significant milestone in the country’s renewable energy transition. The project will involve the construction of a 47.5 MWp floating solar photovoltaic (PV) plant on the reservoir of DHD’s existing 175 MW Da Mi hydropower plant. Once operational, it is expected to become the largest floating solar installation in Southeast Asia. The financing package includes a $17.6 million loan from ADB’s ordinary capital resources. It is complemente","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/07/20/adb-signs-37-million-loan-for-vietnams-first-large-scale-floating-solar-project/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-20|越南|亚洲开发银行（ADB）向DHD公司放款3700万美元（2.51亿元），支持越南首个47.5MWp大型漂浮光伏项目建设，该项目与现有175 MW水电结合"},{"date":"2026-07-20","country":"德国","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"补贴","company":"屋顶光伏补贴","title":"德国政府提交提案，拟削减电网拥堵区域新建太阳能和风能项目的补贴，并降低大型可再生能源项目被迫限电时的补偿","summary":"From 2027 onwards, small rooftop solar installations will continue to receive a feed-in tariff for their first three years, albeit at a lower rate than current support.","sourceUrl":"https://www.cleanenergywire.org/news/germany-limit-new-renewable-support-bid-ease-grid-pressure-lower-costs","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-20|德国|德国政府提交提案，拟削减电网拥堵区域新建太阳能和风能项目的补贴，并降低大型可再生能源项目被迫限电时的补偿"},{"date":"2026-07-16","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"合作","company":"AdventEnergy","title":"AdventEnergy 与中国银行合作，将向 153 家银行网点（30%的分行）供应约 2MW 可再生能源电力","summary":"AdventEnergy has partnered with China Banking Corporation to supply renewable electricity to 153 branches under the Philippines' ERC Retail Aggregation Program. This initiative will provide approximately 2 MW of energy to over 30% of Chinabank's network and supports its sustainability goals while enhancing cost stability and reducing carbon emissions.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/south-east-asia/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-16|菲律宾|AdventEnergy 与中国银行合作，将向 153 家银行网点（30%的分行）供应约 2MW 可再生能源电力"},{"date":"2026-07-15","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"隆基","title":"隆基举办“2026光储创新技术发布会”","summary":"7月14日，上海交通大学，隆基举办了“2026光储创新技术发布会”。技术森林涵盖ACM技术（纳米合金矩阵式接触技术）、一体化导电背板技术、叠片技术、隐藏汇流条技术、控温合金互联技术、智能组件技术、全向防积灰组件技术和隆基One OS八大底层技术，重构光伏组件材料、结构与系统逻辑。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8LkZxMlQvJ1WjyTJL76krg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-15|中国|隆基举办“2026光储创新技术发布会”"},{"date":"2026-07-15","country":"海外","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"晶科","title":"晶科科技境外子公司晶科电力（香港）有限公司已完成一笔3年期1亿美元（6.8亿元）高级无抵押固息绿色债券的发行定价，","summary":"晶科科技境外子公司晶科电力（香港）有限公司已完成一笔3年期1亿美元（6.8亿元）高级无抵押固息绿色债券的发行定价，。该债券预计在交割完毕后于香港联合交易所上市及交易。","sourceUrl":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202607153807525062.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-15|海外|晶科科技境外子公司晶科电力（香港）有限公司已完成一笔3年期1亿美元（6.8亿元）高级无抵押固息绿色债券的发行定价，"},{"date":"2026-07-15","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"DPPA\\PPA","title":"泰国国家能源政策委员会周三批准了若干措施，将设立一项 1.5GW的社区太阳能计划，每个开发商的上限为 30 MW","summary":"Thailand's National Energy Policy Council on Wednesday approved measures to open its clean-electricity market ​to greater competition, expand access to clean energy, ‌and reduce household electricity costs, the energy minister said. The country will expand direct renewable-power purchase agreements beyond data ​centres so that businesses can purchase clean electricity ​from producers via third-party grid access, Energy ⁠Minister Akanat Promphan said in a statement. There will be a 1,500-megawatt community solar ​programme, with a cap of 30 megawatts per developer.","sourceUrl":"https://www.reuters.com/business/energy/thailand-approves-measures-bolster-clean-energy-markets-2026-07-15","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-15|泰国|泰国国家能源政策委员会周三批准了若干措施，将设立一项 1.5GW的社区太阳能计划，每个开发商的上限为 30 MW"},{"date":"2026-07-14","country":"印度","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Shell","title":"Shell已同意将其印度 5GW 可再生能源项目出售给 Aditya Birla Renewables，交易金额为 18 亿美元（约122亿元），预计在年底前完成交易","summary":"Shell Overseas Investment, a wholly owned subsidiary of oil and gas giant Shell, has signed an agreement to sell 100% of Solenergi Power Private to renewables platform Aditya Birla Renewables (ABRen). Sold for US$1.8 billion, the sale agreement includes the Sprng Energy group of companies, including its physical assets and commercial assets. Sprng Energy’s portfolio consists of 5GWp solar PV and wind assets across India, of which 3.3GWp is operational and 1.7GWp is contracted.","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/shell-sells-5gw-indian-renewables-portfolio-to-aditya-birla-renewables/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-14|印度|Shell已同意将其印度 5GW 可再生能源项目出售给 Aditya Birla Renewables，交易金额为 18 亿美元（约122亿元），预计在年底前完成交易"},{"date":"2026-07-13","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Gentari","title":"Gentari 在吉隆坡第二国际机场（KLIA2）投运 3.1MWp光伏发电系统，推动马来西亚清洁能源转型","summary":"Gentari Commissions 3.1 MWp Solar PV System At KLIA2 To Advance Malaysia’s Clean Energy Transition. Gentari 在吉隆坡第二国际机场（KLIA2）启用 3.1 兆瓦峰值光伏太阳能系统，支持该国的国家能源转型路线图（NETR）及长期脱碳目标，推动马来西亚清洁能源转型。该系统通过购电协议供电给 KLIA2 内的零售与生活方式综合体 gateway@klia2。项目规模约为 5,212 块太阳能板，铺设在约 10,500 平方米的屋顶和停车区。预计满负荷后每年可发电约 4,277 MWh，并减少约 3,310 吨二氧化碳当量排放。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/07/13/gentari-commissions-3-1-mwp-solar-pv-system-at-klia2-to-advance-malaysias-clean-energy-transition/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-13|马来西亚|Gentari 在吉隆坡第二国际机场（KLIA2）投运 3.1MWp光伏发电系统，推动马来西亚清洁能源转型"},{"date":"2026-07-13","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"SCG","title":"SCG Cleanergy 宣布其在Nakhon Ratchasima府的 Seagate Technology (Thailand) Limited 制造工厂的 20.96 兆瓦屋顶光伏发电项目已成功达到商业运营日（COD）","summary":"SCG Cleanergy Co., Ltd. today announced the successful Commercial Operation Date (COD) of its 20.96-megawatt Solar Rooftop power generation project at the manufacturing facility of Seagate Technology (Thailand) Limited in Nakhon Ratchasima Province.","sourceUrl":"https://www.scgnewschannel.com/en/scg-news/scg-cleanergy-announces-successful-commercial-operation-date-cod-of-the-largest-solar-rooftop-project-in-the-northeast-cutting-carbon-emissions-by-14500-tonnes-per-year/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-13|泰国|SCG Cleanergy 宣布其在Nakhon Ratchasima府的 Seagate Technology (Thailand) Limited 制造工厂的 20.96 兆瓦屋顶光伏发电项目已成功达到商业运营日（COD）"},{"date":"2026-07-10","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"Singapore","title":"新加坡计划从印尼进口最高 3.4 GW 清洁电力，是其到 2035 年争取从周边国家进口 6 GW 低碳电力战略的一部分，预计可覆盖未来用电需求的约三分之一","summary":"Singapore plans to import up to 3.4 GW of clean electricity from Indonesia as part of its strategy to secure 6 GW of low-carbon electricity imports from neighboring countries by 2035. These imports are expected to supply around one-third of Singapore’s future electricity needs. Most of the exported power will come from large solar photovoltaic projects that are planned across Indonesia, making the country an important renewable energy supplier for the region.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/07/10/indonesia-singapore-renewable-power-deal-awaits-final-electricity-pricing-agreement/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-10|印尼|新加坡计划从印尼进口最高 3.4 GW 清洁电力，是其到 2035 年争取从周边国家进口 6 GW 低碳电力战略的一部分，预计可覆盖未来用电需求的约三分之一"},{"date":"2026-07-08","country":"德国","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"补贴","company":"heat pumps","title":"德国计划削减热泵补贴","summary":"Germany plans to reduce subsidies for heat pumps. Eligible costs would be reduced from €30,000 ($34,231) to €28,000 when the program is relaunched. The cap would then fall by a further €750 every six months, reaching €22,000 in the second half of 2030. The proposals would also introduce a stronger income-based differentiation of subsidies. For households with a taxable income of up to €30,000, the bonus would increase from the current 30% to 40%. The subsidy rate would remain at 30% for incomes of up to €40,000 and fall to 10% for households earning €50,001 or more. Each minor child in a household would reduce the relevant income threshold by €10,000. Funding for the subsidy program would co","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/08/germany-plans-to-reduce-subsidies-for-heat-pumps/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-08|德国|德国计划削减热泵补贴"},{"date":"2026-07-07","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"阳光","title":"Berde Renewables 与 阳光电源及其区域分销商 Solar Hive 建立战略合作，签订主框架协议，计划在菲律宾和泰国部署 200 MW 太阳能逆变器和 500 MWh 电池储能系统，合作期限为三年","summary":"Berde Renewables 与 Sungrow Power 及其区域分销商 Solar Hive 建立战略合作，签订Master Framework Agreement 主框架协议(MFA)，计划在菲律宾和泰国部署 200 MW 太阳能逆变器和 500 MWh 电池储能系统，合作期限为三年。Sungrow 将提供太阳能逆变器、储能系统、EV 充电和智能能源技术；Solar Hive 负责菲律宾和泰国的物流、技术支持、备件和售后服务。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/07/07/berde-renewables-partners-with-sungrow-and-solar-hive-to-deploy-200-mw-solar-and-500-mwh-battery-storage-in-southeast-asia/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-07|泰国|Berde Renewables 与 阳光电源及其区域分销商 Solar Hive 建立战略合作，签订主框架协议，计划在菲律宾和泰国部署 200 MW 太阳能逆变器和 500 MWh 电池储能系统，合作期限为三年"},{"date":"2026-07-06","country":"澳大利亚","geo":"大洋洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"Amazon","title":"Amazon 与 European Energy 签署购电协议（PPA），将采购澳大利亚维多利亚东北部 220MWh Winton North 项目电力","summary":"Tech giant Amazon has signed a new power purchase agreement (PPA) to procure energy from IPP European Energy’s 220MWh Winton North solar-plus-storage project in northeast Victoria, Australia. The debt financing was provided by Commerzbank AG’s Singapore branch and Société Générale. The financing supports the construction of the 130MW solar PV plant and a 100MW/220MWh battery energy storage system (BESS) across a 256-hectare site. 科技巨头亚马逊签署了一项新的购电协议（PPA），将从独立发电商 European Energy 位于澳大利亚维多利亚东北部的 220MWh Winton North 太阳能加储能项目采购能源。贷款由德国商业银行（Commerzbank AG）新加坡分行和法国兴业银行（Société Générale）提供。该笔融资将支持在占地 256 公顷的场址上建设 130MW 太阳能光伏电站和一座 100MW/220MWh 的电池储能系统（BESS）。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/amazon-pens-battery-storage-ppa-for-220mwh-solar-plus-storage-site-in-australia","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-06|澳大利亚|Amazon 与 European Energy 签署购电协议（PPA），将采购澳大利亚维多利亚东北部 220MWh Winton North 项目电力"},{"date":"2026-07-06","country":"德国","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Enertrag","title":"Enertrag在德国Brandenburg开发的 44.5 MW 光伏电站配套 5 MW/10 MWh 储能系统项目，已与EDF Trading签署七年购电协议（PPA），与灵活性交易商 e2m 签署七年储能托管协议，实现储能运营和市场交易优化","summary":"Enertrag has signed long-term commercial agreements for a hybrid project combining a 44.5 MW solar plant with a 5 MW/10 MWh battery energy storage system (BESS) in Brandenburg, Germany.Energy trader EDF Trading will purchase and market the solar output under a seven-year power purchase agreement (PPA), while German flexibility trader e2m will manage the battery under a seven-year tolling agreement. The battery will initially operate as a green electricity co-location asset for five years before switching to a gray electricity co-location model for the remaining two years.","sourceUrl":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/07/06/hybrid-solar-plus-storage-project-secures-ppa-and-battery-tolling-agreements-in-germany","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-06|德国|Enertrag在德国Brandenburg开发的 44.5 MW 光伏电站配套 5 MW/10 MWh 储能系统项目，已与EDF Trading签署七年购电协议（PPA），与灵活性交易商 e2m 签署七年储能托管协议，实现储能运营和市场交易优化"},{"date":"2026-07-06","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"三星","title":"TotalEnergies与ENEOS合作的28MWp屋顶光伏项目在三星电子胡志明市CE综合体正式投运","summary":"TotalEnergies ENEOS successfully commissions a nearly 28 MWp rooftop solar photovoltaic (PV) system at the Samsung Electronics HCMC CE Complex (SEHC) in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. Under this 20-year PPA, TotalEnergies ENEOS financed, installed, and now operates and maintains the system for Samsung Electronics' second largest global manufacturing site. Comprising close to 45,000 solar PV modules, the system generates over 40,000 MWh of renewable electricity annually, covering approximately 26% of the site's electricity consumption and avoiding more than 500,000 tons of CO₂ emissions over the contract period.","sourceUrl":"https://en.antaranews.com/amp/news/421680/vietnam-totalenergies-eneos-commissions-28-mwp-rooftop-solar-project-at-samsung-electronics-hcmc-ce-complex","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-06|越南|TotalEnergies与ENEOS合作的28MWp屋顶光伏项目在三星电子胡志明市CE综合体正式投运"},{"date":"2026-07-04","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"户用线上申请","title":"泰国以 2.20 泰铢/kWh（0.44元/kWh）的价格收购户用光伏多余电力，收购期限为 10 年","summary":"ครงการจะรับซื้อไฟฟ้าส่วนเกินในอัตรา 2.20 บาทต่อหน่วย เป็นเวลา 10 ปี โดยสามารถเสนอขายไฟฟ้าได้ไม่เกิน 5 กิโลวัตต์ต่อมิเตอร์ ภายในระบบสมัครมีรายละเอียดคุณสมบัติผู้สมัคร เอกสารที่ต้องใช้ และเงื่อนไขการเข้าร่วมโครงการอย่างครบถ้วน การเข้าร่วมโครงการมีขั้นตอนที่ชัดเจน ได้แก่ ยื่นคำขอผ่านระบบออนไลน์ ตรวจสอบคุณสมบัติ ประกาศผล ทำสัญญาซื้อขายไฟฟ้า และตรวจสอบระบบก่อนเริ่มจ่ายไฟเข้าระบบ เพื่อให้การเชื่อมต่อเป็นไปตามมาตรฐานและมีความปลอดภัย","sourceUrl":"https://www.thaigov.go.th/th/news/165974","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-04|泰国|泰国以 2.20 泰铢/kWh（0.44元/kWh）的价格收购户用光伏多余电力，收购期限为 10 年"},{"date":"2026-07-03","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"正泰","title":"正泰与阿里云签署全面战略合作协议，核心是围绕 AI 大模型、云与数据中心基础设施，以及全球市场协同展开合作","summary":"正泰与阿里云于 2026 年 6 月签署的全面战略合作协议，核心是围绕 AI 大模型、云与数据中心基础设施，以及全球市场协同展开合作。正泰将为阿里云国内外数据中心提供配电、光伏、储能及清洁能源支持，并探索“算电协同”绿色电力交易方案；阿里云则将依托云基础设施、Qwen 大模型和全球合规经验，支持正泰建设行业大模型、AI Agent，提升电气产品研发、供应链优化、光伏电站运维及海外业务拓展能力。","sourceUrl":"https://www.chintglobal.com/global/en/about-us/news-center/news/chint-and-alibaba-cloud-forge-strategic-partnership-driving-dual-empowerment-in-the-ai-computing-era-and-co-expanding-global-markets.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-03|中国|正泰与阿里云签署全面战略合作协议，核心是围绕 AI 大模型、云与数据中心基础设施，以及全球市场协同展开合作"},{"date":"2026-07-03","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"正泰","title":"正泰电气联合重庆大学、双江能源，成功自主研发超一级能效大容量高阻抗500kV天然酯绝缘油变压器","summary":"正泰电气联合重庆大学、双江能源，成功自主研发超一级能效大容量高阻抗500kV天然酯绝缘油变压器。2026年非洲能源论坛（Africa Energy Forum），正泰展出1000kV变压器、24kV环保环网柜两大核心产品。正泰天然酯绝缘油变压器可生物降解率超95%、闪点超300℃、全生命周期碳排放降幅达98%，安全环保、高效节能。目前，正泰智能电网设备已广泛应用于阿尔及利亚、尼日利亚、肯尼亚、纳米比亚等非洲国家，有效推动当地电网数字化升级，提升电网运行稳定性与韧性。","sourceUrl":"https://www.chintglobal.com/global/en/about-us/news-center/news/chint-highlighted-smart%2Custainable-and-affordable-energy-solutions-at-africa-energy-forum-2026.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-07-03|中国|正泰电气联合重庆大学、双江能源，成功自主研发超一级能效大容量高阻抗500kV天然酯绝缘油变压器"},{"date":"2026-07-03","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"PEA户用","title":"泰国省电力局（PEA）在 2026 年推出的家庭屋顶太阳能售电计划，允许居民将屋顶光伏剩余电力卖给电网，收购价是2.20 泰铢/kWh（0.44元/kWh）","summary":"The Provincial Electricity Authority has opened applications for its 2026 household solar rooftop power purchase scheme, allowing homeowners to sell surplus electricity back to the grid at 2.20 baht per kWh. Power purchase rate: 2.20 baht per unit, or kWh；Contract period: 10 years from the scheduled commercial operation date, or SCOD；Electricity sale quota: No more than 5kW AC per meter/applicant；Total project target: No more than 500MW AC, jointly managed by PEA and MEA","sourceUrl":"https://www.nationthailand.com/sustainability/40068182","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-07-03|泰国|泰国省电力局（PEA）在 2026 年推出的家庭屋顶太阳能售电计划，允许居民将屋顶光伏剩余电力卖给电网，收购价是2.20 泰铢/kWh（0.44元/kWh）"},{"date":"2026-06-29","country":"南非","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"远景","title":"远景与南非本地开发商 SOLA Group 及EPC方 WBHO 签署了一份 660MWh 电池储能系统（BESS）供应协议，用于南非自由邦省的 Naos‑1 项目，该项目规模为300MW 光伏电站加 660MWh储能","summary":"远景能源（Envision Energy）与南非本地开发商 SOLA Group 及施工方 WBHO 签署了一份 660MWh 电池储能系统（BESS）供应协议，用于南非自由邦省的 Naos‑1 项目，该项目规模为300MW 光伏电站加 660MWh储能。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/envision-to-supply-660mwh-of-battery-storage-for-south-africas-largest-private-hybrid-power-project","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-29|南非|远景与南非本地开发商 SOLA Group 及EPC方 WBHO 签署了一份 660MWh 电池储能系统（BESS）供应协议，用于南非自由邦省的 Naos‑1 项目，该项目规模为300MW 光伏电站加 660MWh储能"},{"date":"2026-06-29","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"CrossBoundary","title":"国际金融公司（IFC）向CrossBoundary Access投资1000万美元，以支持其在撒哈拉以南非洲扩展分布式可再生能源和电力接入项目，目标是将可靠清洁用电覆盖到约一百万人口","summary":"IFC has invested US$10 million in CrossBoundary Access to support the expansion of distributed renewable energy projects across Sub Saharan Africa. The funding will help scale mini grids, battery as a service solutions and other energy technologies, bringing the company closer to its goal of providing reliable electricity to one million people.","sourceUrl":"https://www.greenbuildingafrica.co.za/ifc-invests-us10-million-in-crossboundary-access-to-distributed-renewable-energy-projects-across-sub-saharan-africa","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-29|非洲|国际金融公司（IFC）向CrossBoundary Access投资1000万美元，以支持其在撒哈拉以南非洲扩展分布式可再生能源和电力接入项目，目标是将可靠清洁用电覆盖到约一百万人口"},{"date":"2026-06-29","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"绿色债券","title":"GuarantCo 支持 Verdant Energy 发行的越南首支商业与工业太阳能绿色债券，总额达 7,920 亿越南盾（2.04亿元）","summary":"GuarantCo backs Vietnam’s first C&I solar green bond by Verdant Energy. The tenor of the bonds and guarantee is 15 years, the longest in the market for such facilities. The green bonds will be issued in two phases by the end of 2026, with the first bond phase fully subscribed by local institutional investors, mainly insurance companies. 1 越南盾 = 0.00026 人民币","sourceUrl":"https://pidg.org/guarantco-backs-vietnams-first-ci-solar-green-bond-by-verdant-energy","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-29|越南|GuarantCo 支持 Verdant Energy 发行的越南首支商业与工业太阳能绿色债券，总额达 7,920 亿越南盾（2.04亿元）"},{"date":"2026-06-26","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"DPPA","title":"2026 年 6 月 26 日，越南政府颁布并立即生效了第 243/2026/ND-CP 号法令（第 243 号法令）","summary":"On 26 June 2026, the Government of Vietnam promulgated Decree 243/2026/ND-CP (Decree 243) with immediate effect. It amends and supplements certain provisions of Decree No. 57/2025/ND-CP (Decree 57), which had come into effect in March 2025 and set out regulations on the mechanism for direct electricity purchase and sale between renewable energy power generation units and large electricity users in Vietnam. Decree 243 addresses this by bringing electricity retailers within the regulatory framework for DPPAs and enables an “aggregation model” under which a renewable energy developer may sell power to a single licensed industrial-park electricity retailer, which in turn can distribute the elect","sourceUrl":"https://powerphilippines.com/ib-vogt-apac-secures-php-4-5-b-rcbc-financing-for-99-mwp-iloilo-solar-plus-storage-project/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-26|越南|2026 年 6 月 26 日，越南政府颁布并立即生效了第 243/2026/ND-CP 号法令（第 243 号法令）"},{"date":"2026-06-25","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"服务","company":"天合","title":"富家智维中标越秀新能源全生命周期运维项目","summary":"富家智维中标越秀新能源全生命周期运维项目。总规模320MW，覆盖9930户 横跨湖北、江西、湖南、陕西四省。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Y22S2907E8XjjecZ1tozjw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-25|中国|富家智维中标越秀新能源全生命周期运维项目"},{"date":"2026-06-24","country":"埃及","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"爱旭","title":"爱旭独家中标埃及Nefer Menya 1.2GW集中式光伏项目，项目配套600MW的电池储能系统","summary":"爱旭宣布独家中标埃及Nefer Menya 1.2GW集中式光伏项目，项目配套600MW的电池储能系统，建成后预计为约1.4万户家庭供电，每年减少约1.6万吨二氧化碳排放。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0pgMIbGQyTpEigLumBZxxg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-24|埃及|爱旭独家中标埃及Nefer Menya 1.2GW集中式光伏项目，项目配套600MW的电池储能系统"},{"date":"2026-06-18","country":"欧洲","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"阳光","title":"Sungrow与全球基础设施投资管理公司Nuveen Infrastructure签订框架协议，为其旗下包括Verdian在内的可再生能源项目部署1.32GWh储能系统，供应302套PowerTitan 2.0储能系统及77套中压站（MVS），合同还涵盖长期服务协议（LTSA）","summary":"On June 16, Sungrow announced that it had signed a framework agreement with global infrastructure investment management firm Nuveen Infrastructure to deploy 1.32 GWh of energy storage systems across renewable energy projects developed by Nuveen’s portfolio companies including Verdian. Under the agreement, Sungrow will supply 302 sets of PowerTitan 2.0 energy storage systems alongside 77 integrated medium-voltage stations (MVS). Beyond hardware supply, the contract also covers a comprehensive Long-Term Service Agreement (LTSA). 6 月 16 日，阳光电源宣布已与全球基建投资管理公司 Nuveen Infrastructure 签署框架协议，将在 Nuveen 旗下包括 Verdian 在内的投资组合公司开发的可再生能源项目中部署 1.32GWh 的储能系统。根据协议，阳光电源将提供 302 套 PowerTitan 2.0 储能系统以及 77 座集成中压站","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260618-51621.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-18|欧洲|Sungrow与全球基础设施投资管理公司Nuveen Infrastructure签订框架协议，为其旗下包括Verdian在内的可再生能源项目部署1.32GWh储能系统，供应302套PowerTitan 2.0储能系统及77套中压站（MVS），合同还涵盖长期服务协议（LTSA）"},{"date":"2026-06-18","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"晶科","title":"晶科能源宣布其在马来西亚的工商业储能项目已并网","summary":"On June 17, JA Solar announced that its commercial and industrial energy storage project in Malaysia had recently been connected to the grid. Located at a local paint manufacturing plant, the facility is equipped with two sets of 125 kW / 261 kWh C&I energy storage systems, delivering a total capacity of 250 kW / 522 kWh. The system enhances flexibility and stability of power consumption within the factory compound. 6 月 17 日，晶科能源宣布其在马来西亚的商用与工商业储能项目近期已并网。该设施位于一家当地涂料制造厂，配备两套 125 kW / 261 kWh 的工商业储能系统，总计容量为 250 kW / 522 kWh。该系统提升了厂区内用电的灵活性和稳定性。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260618-51621.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-18|马来西亚|晶科能源宣布其在马来西亚的工商业储能项目已并网"},{"date":"2026-06-18","country":"德国","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"远景","title":"远景与德国能源技术公司 WLF Energy 近日签署战略合作协议","summary":"On June 17, Farasis Energy announced a strategic cooperation agreement recently inked with German energy technology firm WLF Energy. Per the agreement, the two parties will jointly develop next-generation battery technologies and energy storage products for utility-scale, commercial & industrial, and distributed energy storage markets. The collaboration covers cells, battery systems, energy management software, artificial intelligence, and the deployment of large-scale energy storage solutions. Both sides will also explore application scenarios such as virtual power plants, smart energy infrastructure, renewable energy grid integration and grid stabilization, while co-formulating a long-term","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260618-51621.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-18|德国|远景与德国能源技术公司 WLF Energy 近日签署战略合作协议"},{"date":"2026-06-16","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Mission 300","title":"Mission 300项目（2030 年覆盖 3 亿人的倡议）取得重大里程碑，已在非洲 40 个国家使超过 5000 万人获得电力接入 ","summary":"Mission 300项目（2030 年覆盖 3 亿人的倡议）取得重大里程碑，已在非洲 40 个国家使超过 5000 万人获得电力接入 。迄今为止，非洲开发银行集团和世界银行集团已为与“300 任务”相关的项目承诺了近 150 亿美元的融资。 Rockefeller基金会与全球能源联盟已为 Mission 300 承诺出资超 1 亿美元。","sourceUrl":"https://www.rockefellerfoundation.org/news/under-mission-300-new-way-business-connects-over-50m-people-electricity-africa","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-16|非洲|Mission 300项目（2030 年覆盖 3 亿人的倡议）取得重大里程碑，已在非洲 40 个国家使超过 5000 万人获得电力接入 "},{"date":"2026-06-16","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"OATI","title":"OATI 用微电网控制技术帮助Nomlaki的Paskenta印第安人部落增强供电稳定性和长期能源独立性","summary":"OATI today announced a strategic partnership with The Paskenta Band of Nomlaki Indians to strengthen tribal energy resilience and independence by integrating OATI's microgrid and distributed energy resource controller, GridMind®, to manage the tribal community's major two-part solar and battery microgrid system. OATI 今日宣布与帕斯肯塔·诺姆拉基印第安人部落（The Paskenta Band of Nomlaki Indians）建立战略合作伙伴关系，旨在通过整合 OATI 的微电网与分布式能源资源控制器 GridMind ® ，来加强部落的能源韧性与独立性，以管理该部落社区的两部分太阳能与电池微电网系统。项目规模包括 4.5 MW 太阳能板和 21 MWh 电池储能系统，重点应对野火、热浪和高峰负荷等风险。","sourceUrl":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/paskenta-band-of-nomlaki-indians-and-oati-partner-to-bring-energy-sovereignty-and-stability-to-tribal-lands-in-northern-california-302801762.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-16|美国|OATI 用微电网控制技术帮助Nomlaki的Paskenta印第安人部落增强供电稳定性和长期能源独立性"},{"date":"2026-06-16","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"微电网","title":"欧盟、法国开发署（AFD）与肯尼亚政府已在Turkana县正式启用绿色微电网（GMG）项目第二阶段","summary":"The European Union, Agence Française de Développement (AFD) and the Government of Kenya have officially commissioned the Phase 2 of the Green Mini-Grid (GMG) Programme in Turkana County, marking a significant milestone in Kenya's journey toward universal energy access. To date, it has established 80 mini-grids in the counties of Turkana, Siaya, Homabay, Nyamira, Kisii, Busia, Kaijado and Kericho, delivering 2 megawatts of new clean energy capacity, 20,000 new connections, and electricity access to 100,000 Kenyans.Funded through a EUR 15 million grant from the EU and the UK's Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO), and implemented by AFD. The recepients for these funds were four ","sourceUrl":"https://www.eeas.europa.eu/delegations/kenya/afd-eu-and-kenya-commission-green-mini-grid-programme-expanding-access-clean-energy-100000-kenyans_en","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-16|肯尼亚|欧盟、法国开发署（AFD）与肯尼亚政府已在Turkana县正式启用绿色微电网（GMG）项目第二阶段"},{"date":"2026-06-16","country":"英国","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"产品","company":"阳台光伏 Plug-in solar panels","title":"Currys、B&Q 和 Amazon 等零售商品牌高管与能源消费者事务部长会面，讨论向英国公众销售“阳台光伏”的指南","summary":"Executives from brands including Currys, B&Q and Amazon met Martin McCluskey, the minister for energy consumers, on Tuesday to discuss guidelines for selling “balcony solar panels” to the British public. The meeting to discuss how to help people living in flats or rented homes without rooftop access to benefit from the government’s solar power strategy and cut their energy bills. Plug-in solar panels can be placed on a balcony, terrace, shed roof or any other outdoor space to generate electricity that flows directly into the electrical circuit of a house when plugged in through a standard three-prong plug. Plug-in systems usually have a capacity of 800 watts, or one-fifth of the size of a ty","sourceUrl":"https://www.theguardian.com/money/2026/jun/16/retail-giants-join-uk-government-drive-to-boost-plug-in-balcony-solar-panels","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-16|英国|Currys、B&Q 和 Amazon 等零售商品牌高管与能源消费者事务部长会面，讨论向英国公众销售“阳台光伏”的指南"},{"date":"2026-06-12","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"可再生能源支持计划","title":"欧盟委员会批准了价值 230 亿欧元的意大利可再生能源支持计划","summary":"European Commission approves €23 billion Italian renewable energy support scheme. The Scheme is expected to support the addition of approximately 37.15 GW (Gigawatt) of new renewable electricity capacity in Italy, equivalent to approximately 48% of the country's current installed renewable capacity. Support will be provided through two-way Contracts for Difference (\"CfDs\") with a duration of 20 years, providing producers with long-term revenue visibility based on a defined strike price for each kWh of electricity produced and fed into the grid. 欧盟委员会批准了价值 230 亿欧元的意大利可再生能源支持计划。该计划预计将在意大利支持新增约 37.15 吉瓦（Gigawatt）的可再生电力装机容量，相当于该国当前可再生装机容量的大约 48%。资助将通过为期 20 年的双向差价合约（“CfDs”）提供，为发电商提供基于每千瓦时电力的既定行权价","sourceUrl":"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/european-commission-approves-a-23-billion-italian-renewable-energy-support-scheme-ce7f5cd8d18ff724","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-12|意大利|欧盟委员会批准了价值 230 亿欧元的意大利可再生能源支持计划"},{"date":"2026-06-11","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"合作","company":"富士康","title":"富士康（Foxconn）和Brookfield将在越南合作开发最高 1 GW 的风电、光伏和电池储能项目，在DPPA框架下支撑富士康在当地的运营和供应链","summary":"Taiwan’s Foxconn and global investment firm Brookfield will jointly develop up to 1 GW of utility-scale wind, solar, and battery capacity in Vietnam, underpinned by long-term power purchase agreements, to support Foxconn’s operations and supply chain in the country. The partnership can progress in line with Vietnam’s evolving direct power purchase agreement (DPPA) framework.","sourceUrl":"https://technode.global/2026/06/11/taiwans-foxconn-us-brookfield-to-jointly-develop-1-gw-of-renewable-energy-in-vietnam/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-11|越南|富士康（Foxconn）和Brookfield将在越南合作开发最高 1 GW 的风电、光伏和电池储能项目，在DPPA框架下支撑富士康在当地的运营和供应链"},{"date":"2026-06-10","country":"英国","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"创维","title":"创维与京东国际签署战略合作协议，在京东跨境电商平台 JOYBUY 上线，助力创维太阳能通过电商渠道触达海外客户群体","summary":"SKYWORTH Solar also signed a strategic cooperation agreement with JD International - JOYBUY, marking an important step in the company's global channel development. Following the signing, SKYWORTH Solar's balcony PV products are expected to be launched on JOYBUY, JD.com's cross-border e-commerce platform, around June 10, 2026. This collaboration will help SKYWORTH Solar reach a broader base of overseas customers through digital commerce channels, while enhancing the accessibility of its PV products and smart energy solutions in global markets. 创维太阳能还与京东国际—JOYBUY 签署了战略合作协议，标志着公司全球渠道拓展的重要一步。签约后，创维太阳能的阳台光伏产品预计将于 2026 年 6 月 10 日左右在京东跨境电商平台 JOYBUY 上线。此次合作将帮助创维太阳能通过数字商务渠道触达更广泛的海外客户群体，同时提升其光伏产品和智能能源","sourceUrl":"https://www.newswit.com/en/ierxptfl8ad77v0hhbc2dg4tpgeqaxbk","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-10|英国|创维与京东国际签署战略合作协议，在京东跨境电商平台 JOYBUY 上线，助力创维太阳能通过电商渠道触达海外客户群体"},{"date":"2026-06-10","country":"东南亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"天合","title":"天合 与 Ecohope Solar 签署了一份 MoU，计划在未来三年采购和分销 600 MW 的 Vertex N G3 和 Vertex S+ G3 太阳能组件，覆盖东南亚、中东和非洲市场","summary":"Trinasolar 与 Ecohope Solar 签署了一份 MoU，计划在未来三年采购和分销 600 MW 的 Vertex N G3 和 Vertex S+ G3 太阳能组件，覆盖东南亚、中东和非洲市场。","sourceUrl":"https://energetica-india.net/news/trinasolar-ecohope-solar-sign-mou-for-600-mw-module-supply-at-snec-pv-power-expo-2026","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-10|东南亚|天合 与 Ecohope Solar 签署了一份 MoU，计划在未来三年采购和分销 600 MW 的 Vertex N G3 和 Vertex S+ G3 太阳能组件，覆盖东南亚、中东和非洲市场"},{"date":"2026-06-09","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"U Power&江苏国富氢","title":"U Power（新能源汽车换电业务） 与国富氢能（氢能装备全产业链整体解决方案）和清云数链（数字资产服务）签署合资协议，成立了由 U Power（51%） 控制的合资公司，用于提供面向数据中心的 AI 驱动能源管理方案，最初落地泰国，并计划未来全球扩展","summary":"U Power Limited 提交给 SEC 的 6-K 报告，包括公司进入了两项与数据中心能源解决方案相关的重大协议。 U Power 与江苏国富氢能装备有限公司和 Cloud Digital Chain Limited 签署合资协议，成立了由 U Power 控制的合资公司，用于提供面向数据中心的 AI 驱动能源管理方案，最初落地泰国，并计划未来全球扩展。合资公司名为 Hydro Data Limited，并于2026年5月20日在香港成立。项目将先从 2026年底前启动的 3MW 试点开始，用来验证技术和经济性，再逐步扩展到 100MW。","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1939780/000121390026066520/ea0294005-6k_upower.htm","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-09|泰国|U Power（新能源汽车换电业务） 与国富氢能（氢能装备全产业链整体解决方案）和清云数链（数字资产服务）签署合资协议，成立了由 U Power（51%） 控制的合资公司，用于提供面向数据中心的 AI 驱动能源管理方案，最初落地泰国，并计划未来全球扩展"},{"date":"2026-06-09","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"U Power&江苏国富氢","title":"Hydro Data Limited 与 CEWA 集团及国富氢能签订协议，共同开发位于泰国罗勇的一个 100MW 智能数据中心项目的一体化能源解决方案","summary":"Hydro Data Limited entered into an agreement with CEWA Group (“CEWA”) and Guofu Hydrogen Energy, for the development of an integrated energy solution for a 100MW intelligence data center (“IDC”) project in Rayong, Thailand (the “IDC Agreement”). Hydro Data Limited 与 CEWA 集团及国富氢能签订协议，共同开发位于泰国罗勇的一个 100MW 智能数据中心（“IDC”）项目的一体化能源解决方案（“IDC 协议”）。项目位于罗勇府普拉克登区 WHA 东部海岸工业园 4 区，设计 IT 负载容量为 100 兆瓦，预计年用电量约为 8.7 亿千瓦时。","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1939780/000121390026066520/ea029400501ex10-2.htm","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-09|泰国|Hydro Data Limited 与 CEWA 集团及国富氢能签订协议，共同开发位于泰国罗勇的一个 100MW 智能数据中心项目的一体化能源解决方案"},{"date":"2026-06-08","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"Day One","title":"总部位于新加坡的数据中心开发商 DayOne 通过马来西亚 CRESS 机制，与马来西亚国家能源公司 TNB 签署了大规模电力采购协议，包括 1.5GW 光伏 与 2.2GWh 储能系统","summary":"Singapore-headquartered DayOne has agreed to buy energy from TNB Renewables and TNB Power Generation, two subsidiaries of Malaysian utility major Tenaga Nasional Berhad (TNB).It covers energy output from 1.5GW of solar PV generation capacity and 2.2GWh of battery energy storage systems (BESS). DayOne said the BESS facilities will be hybrids, paired with ground-mount solar or hybrid hydro floating solar (HHFS). DayOne has two hyperscale campuses in Malaysia and claimed that its cumulative investments in Malaysia will total RM28 billion (US$6.87 billion) by the end of 2026. 总部位于新加坡的数据中心开发商 DayOne 通过马来西亚 CRESS 机制，与 TNB Renewables 和 TNB Power Generation 签署了大规模电力采购协议，包括 1.5GW 光伏 与 2.2GWh 储能系统。相关储","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/data-centre-developer-dayone-signs-solar-and-bess-ppas-in-malaysia-with-tnb-subsidiaries/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-08|马来西亚|总部位于新加坡的数据中心开发商 DayOne 通过马来西亚 CRESS 机制，与马来西亚国家能源公司 TNB 签署了大规模电力采购协议，包括 1.5GW 光伏 与 2.2GWh 储能系统"},{"date":"2026-06-06","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"创维","title":"创维在曼谷帝国大厦（Empire Tower）开设新办公室，并与本地伙伴 CapSolar 签署谅解备忘录，计划开发一个 100 MW 的工商业光伏项目","summary":"SKYWORTH Solar has announced a major expansion in Thailand as part of its broader global growth strategy. The company recently opened a new office at Empire Tower in Bangkok and signed a memorandum of understanding (MoU) with local partner CapSolar to develop a 100 MW commercial and industrial solar project. T 创维在曼谷帝国大厦（Empire Tower）开设新办公室，并与本地伙伴 CapSolar 签署谅解备忘录，计划开发一个 100 MW 的工商业光伏项目。泰国办公室将提供项目咨询、实施支持、供应链协调和售后服务。公司已从泰国工商银行（ ICBC Thai）获取 5 亿美元投资基金的支持。位于春武里府的乌美钢铁厂（UMC Steel Plant） 3 MW 屋顶光伏项目，预计首年发电约 440 万千瓦时。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/06/06/skyworth-solar-expands-thailand-presence-with-new-bangkok-office-and-100-mw-solar-project/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-06|泰国|创维在曼谷帝国大厦（Empire Tower）开设新办公室，并与本地伙伴 CapSolar 签署谅解备忘录，计划开发一个 100 MW 的工商业光伏项目"},{"date":"2026-06-05","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"AIDC","company":"谷歌","title":"谷歌与美国能源开发商 Intersect 第二次合作在德克萨斯开发Meitner数据中心和能源综合体","summary":"Tech giant Google and US renewable energy developer Intersect have partnered to develop a new data centre and energy complex in Texas. The Meitner Energy Centre, located across the Gray and Roberts Counties, will combine a Google data centre with more than 1GW of co-located wind, solar and storage capacity. The facility is under construction. The facility is the second major co-located energy and data centre project announced by Google and Intersect. Their first collaboration, centred on Intersect’s Quantum Clean Energy Project in Haskell County, combines 640MW of solar capacity and 1.3GWh of battery storage with a data centre campus. In a bid to power its data centre expansions in the US, G","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/google-intersect-launch-1gw-plus-clean-energy-backed-data-centre-project-in-texas/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-05|美国|谷歌与美国能源开发商 Intersect 第二次合作在德克萨斯开发Meitner数据中心和能源综合体"},{"date":"2026-06-04","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"ib vogt APAC","title":"德国开发商ib vogt APAC 获得 Rizal商业银行（RCBC） 提供的 45.25 亿菲律宾比索（4.98亿元）融资，用于在Iloilo建设一个 99 MWp 的光储项目","summary":"German renewable energy developer ib vogt APAC has secured PHP 4.525 billion in financing from Rizal Commercial Banking Corp. (RCBC) for its 99MWp(80MW) solar-plus-storage project in Iloilo, advancing one of the renewable energy developments awarded under the government’s Green Energy Auction (GEA) program. 德国开发商ib vogt APAC 获得 Rizal商业银行（RCBC） 提供的 45.25 亿菲律宾比索（4.98亿元）融资，用于在Iloilo建设一个 99 MWp 的光储项目。项目位于Iloilo Ajuy 的 Barangay Luca，为政府绿色能源拍卖（GEA）计划下获批的可再生能源开发项目之一，接入菲律宾国家电网公司（NGCP）的 138 千伏Barotac Viejo变电站。预计 2027 年第二季度投运，投产后每年可发电超过 1.6 亿千瓦时，减少逾 7 万吨二氧化碳排放，并增强维萨亚斯地区电网稳定性。（1 菲律宾比索 = 0.11 人民币）","sourceUrl":"https://powerphilippines.com/ib-vogt-apac-secures-php-4-5-b-rcbc-financing-for-99-mwp-iloilo-solar-plus-storage-project/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-04|菲律宾|德国开发商ib vogt APAC 获得 Rizal商业银行（RCBC） 提供的 45.25 亿菲律宾比索（4.98亿元）融资，用于在Iloilo建设一个 99 MWp 的光储项目"},{"date":"2026-06-02","country":"缅甸","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源缅甸 110 MW光伏发电+ 20 MW/40 MWh的储能系统顺利投运","summary":"hina's Sungrow Power Supply Co Ltd (SHE:300274) said on Monday it has brought into commercial operation 110 MW of solar photovoltaic capacity paired with 20 MW/40 MWh of battery energy storage systems (BESS) in Myanmar, following a seven-day commissioning process. Touted as Myanmar’s largest solar-plus-storage power based, the project involved three more companies besides the Chinese solar inverter and storage provider -- Hanzar Solar, Leader Power Energy and Power Way International Limited, all operating in unspecified roles. The project uses Sungrow’s 1+X modular inverter system, PowerTitan 2.0 storage technology and a plant-level energy management platform. It also includes grid-forming a","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/sungrow-fires-up-110-mw-of-solar-40-mwh-of-bess-in-myanmar-1295757/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-06-02|缅甸|阳光电源缅甸 110 MW光伏发电+ 20 MW/40 MWh的储能系统顺利投运"},{"date":"2026-06-01","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"三星","title":"越南首个并网直接购电协议（DPPA）现已生效","summary":"Vietnam’s first grid-connected direct power purchase agreement (DPPA) is now live.Samsung Electronics Vietnam Thai Nguyen (SEVT) and TTC Duc Hue 2 Solar Power Plant have become the first entities to operate under Vietnam's direct power purchase agreement (DPPA) mechanism through the national grid from June 1. SEVT and TTC Duc Hue 2 have completed all technical and legal procedures required to officially participate in the DPPA scheme, according to the National System and Market Operator (NSMO). The deal marks the first practical implementation of Vietnam's DPPA mechanism since the governmental Decree 57/2025, which governs direct power transactions between renewable energy generators and lar","sourceUrl":"https://theinvestor.vn/samsung-thai-nguyen-ttc-solar-plant-become-first-participants-in-vietnams-direct-power-purchase-mechanism-d19220.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-06-01|越南|越南首个并网直接购电协议（DPPA）现已生效"},{"date":"2026-05-28","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"补贴","company":"户用补贴","title":"马来西亚能源转型与水资源管理部（PETRA）推出SuRIA Home计划，拨款1.5亿令吉（2.49亿元）为家庭屋顶光伏提供补贴","summary":"Malaysia launched the SuRIA Home program with MYR 150 million in rooftop solar rebates for households. Eligible homeowners can receive up to MYR 3,000 in rebates for residential solar systems. The program aims to support up to 50,000 homes and add around 250 MW of rooftop solar capacity by 2026. 1 马来西亚林令吉 =1.66 人民币","sourceUrl":"https://taiyangnews.info/markets/malaysia-back-250-mw-residential-rooftop-solar-2026","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-28|马来西亚|马来西亚能源转型与水资源管理部（PETRA）推出SuRIA Home计划，拨款1.5亿令吉（2.49亿元）为家庭屋顶光伏提供补贴"},{"date":"2026-05-25","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"协鑫","title":"协鑫已与泰国PTT 集团下的的 Getz Energy签署谅解备忘录（MoU），涵盖未来三年内泰国至少 1 GW的光伏组件以及储能供货","summary":"Chinese solar manufacturer GCL Technology Holdings Ltd (HKG:3800) has signed a memorandum of understanding (MoU) with Thailand-based Getz Energy Company Limited covering the supply of up to 1 GW of solar modules over the next three years for projects in Thailand. 协鑫已与泰国PTT 集团下的的 Getz Energy签署谅解备忘录（MoU），涵盖未来三年内为泰国供应多达 1 GW的光伏组件以及储能。","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/gcl-si-to-supply-1-gw-of-pv-modules-to-thailands-getz-1295243/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-25|泰国|协鑫已与泰国PTT 集团下的的 Getz Energy签署谅解备忘录（MoU），涵盖未来三年内泰国至少 1 GW的光伏组件以及储能供货"},{"date":"2026-05-25","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"收购","company":"AASS","title":"圣马力诺国有公共服务公司AASS已发起征求意向，购买在圣马力诺或意大利持有光伏资产的SPV","summary":"Azienda Autonoma di Stato per i Servizi Pubblici (AASS), the country’s public utility, has launched a call for expressions of interest to purchase companies holding PV assets in San Marino or Italy. Projects may be operating, under construction, or ready to build, provided they are commissioned by Dec. 31, 2026. The maximum value per project is €15 million.","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/05/25/san-marino-launches-solar-acquisition-program/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-25|意大利|圣马力诺国有公共服务公司AASS已发起征求意向，购买在圣马力诺或意大利持有光伏资产的SPV"},{"date":"2026-05-22","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"晶科","title":"晶科能源在气候组织《RE100 中国指南》中被作为行业标杆报道","summary":"JinkoSolar Featured in Climate Group’s \"RE100 China Guidebook\" as an Industry Benchmark2019: Became the world’s first solar company to join both the RE100 and EP100 initiatives.2023: Became the first Chinese PV company to have its near-term, long-term, and net-zero targets validated by the Science Based Targets initiative (SBTi). 2025: Fulfilled its EP100 commitment by achieving 100% ISO 50001 energy management system certification across its operations. 晶科能源在气候组织《RE100 中国指南》中被作为行业标杆报道。2019：成为全球首家同时加入 RE100 和 EP100 倡议的光伏企业。2023：成为首家通过科学减排目标倡议（SBTi）验证其近期目标、长期目标和净零目标的中国光伏企业。2025 年：通过在其运营中实现 100% ISO 50001 能源管理体系认证，履行了其 EP100 承诺。","sourceUrl":"https://taiyangnews.info/pressreleases/jinkosolar-featured-in-climate-groups-re100-china-guidebook-as-an-industry-benchmark","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-22|中国|晶科能源在气候组织《RE100 中国指南》中被作为行业标杆报道"},{"date":"2026-05-22","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"南发集团","title":"Constant Energy 与南发集团（Nam Phat Group）在越南共同为 2.7 MWp 屋顶光伏项目举行落成仪式","summary":"Constant Energy and Nam Phat Group Inaugurate 2.7 MWp Rooftop Solar Project in Vietnam Constant Energy 与南发集团在越南共同为 2.7 兆瓦峰值屋顶光伏项目举行落成仪式。Constant Energy 是亚洲领先的大型太阳能、风能和电池储能项目的开发商、业主和运营商。南发集团（Nam Phat Group）是越南在钢材贸易与生产、造船和海运领域的领先企业之一。","sourceUrl":"https://constantenergy.net/press-releases/constant-energy-and-nam-phat-group-inaugurate-2-7-mwp-rooftop-solar-project-in-vietnam/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-22|越南|Constant Energy 与南发集团（Nam Phat Group）在越南共同为 2.7 MWp 屋顶光伏项目举行落成仪式"},{"date":"2026-05-20","country":"阿联酋","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源与 Masdar 签署阿布扎比 RTC 项目 7.5GWh 储能系统供货协议","summary":"阳光电源与 Masdar 签署阿布扎比 RTC 项目 7.5GWh 储能系统供货协议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.sungrowpower.com/en/sungrow-and-masdar-sign-7-5-gwh-energy-storage-system-for-abu-dhabi-s-world-first-rtc-project","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-20|阿联酋|阳光电源与 Masdar 签署阿布扎比 RTC 项目 7.5GWh 储能系统供货协议"},{"date":"2026-05-19","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"故障","title":"泰国消费者保护委员会（OCPB）正在对安装不达标的光伏系统展开调查，其故障主要包括融断和烧焦，缺陷问题包括逆变器安装间距不足，且未安装在隔离的仓库内，使用铝线而非铜线，户用从三相改为单相等","summary":"Thailand’s Office of the Consumer Protection Board (OCPB) is opening an investigation into substandard solar system installations, including signs of melting and burning. An update published by OCPB confirms Thailand’s Consumer Protection Board (CPB) is currently assisting 17 homeowners who have been impacted by subpar or dangerous solar installations. They are located in the Khon Kaen province, Saraburi province and the Tha Phra area of ​​Thonburi district within Bangkok. 泰国消费者保护委员会（OCPB）正在对不达标的太阳能系统安装展开调查，故障包括融化和烧焦的迹象。OCPB 发布的一则更新证实，泰国消费者保护委员会（CPB）目前正在协助 17 名受到质量低劣或存在安全隐患的太阳能安装影响的屋主。他们分布在孔敬府、沙拉武里府以及曼谷吞武里区的他帕拉地区。缺陷问题包括逆变器安装间距不足，且未安装在隔离的仓库内，使用铝线而非铜线，户用从三相改为单相等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/05/19/thailand-opens-investigation-into-faulty-solar-installations/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-19|泰国|泰国消费者保护委员会（OCPB）正在对安装不达标的光伏系统展开调查，其故障主要包括融断和烧焦，缺陷问题包括逆变器安装间距不足，且未安装在隔离的仓库内，使用铝线而非铜线，户用从三相改为单相等"},{"date":"2026-05-19","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"数据中心","title":"随着数据中心投资的快速增长，未来可能要求数据中心运营商支付更高电价，或强制分摊智能电网升级费用","summary":"泰国能源部长提出，数据中心投资快速增长，未来可能要求数据中心运营商支付更高电价，或强制分摊智能电网升级费用。泰国拟将家庭屋顶光伏审批时间缩短至最快 7 天。","sourceUrl":"https://www.reccessary.com/en/news/thailand-data-center-power-surcharge-grid-oil-reserve","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-19|泰国|随着数据中心投资的快速增长，未来可能要求数据中心运营商支付更高电价，或强制分摊智能电网升级费用"},{"date":"2026-05-18","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"EVN","title":"越南电力公司（EVN）子公司 EVNGENCO1 计划投资 4.4 万亿越南盾（11.37 亿元）用于近270MW（3个）水面漂浮光伏项目，利用水库扩大可再生能源发电","summary":"Vietnam Electricity (EVN) subsidiary EVNGENCO1 is planning to invest VND 4.4 trillion (USD 167 million) into three floating solar projects, expanding the use of hydropower reservoirs for renewable energy generation. The projects would add nearly 270 MW of floating solar capacity. 越南电力公司（EVN）子公司 EVNGENCO1 计划投资 4.4 万亿越南盾（1.67 亿美元）用于三个水面漂浮光伏项目，扩大利用水电水库进行可再生能源发电。这些项目将在该国有公用事业集团已在运营的水库上新增近 270 兆瓦的浮动太阳能装机容量。","sourceUrl":"https://www.reccessary.com/en/news/vietnam-floating-solar-evngeco1","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-18|越南|越南电力公司（EVN）子公司 EVNGENCO1 计划投资 4.4 万亿越南盾（11.37 亿元）用于近270MW（3个）水面漂浮光伏项目，利用水库扩大可再生能源发电"},{"date":"2026-05-09","country":"乌干达","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Renewvia","title":"Renewvia Energy 计划非洲扩展 7.5 亿美元业务，目标在乌干达、卢旺达、埃塞俄比亚和刚果（金）四国推进离网太阳能微网项目，新增 210 万户连接，为扩大欠供电地区的电力接入","summary":"Renewvia Energy Corp. is planning a $750 million expansion of its African operations, targeting off-grid solar projects in Uganda, Rwanda, Ethiopia and the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Renewvia Energy 计划非洲扩展 7.5 亿美元业务，目标在乌干达、卢旺达、埃塞俄比亚和刚果（金）四国推进离网太阳能微网项目，新增 210 万户连接，为扩大欠供电地区的电力接入。","sourceUrl":"https://africaenergypulse.com/renewvia-targets-750m-solar-expansion-across-four-african-countries","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-09|乌干达|Renewvia Energy 计划非洲扩展 7.5 亿美元业务，目标在乌干达、卢旺达、埃塞俄比亚和刚果（金）四国推进离网太阳能微网项目，新增 210 万户连接，为扩大欠供电地区的电力接入"},{"date":"2026-05-08","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产能","company":"晶科","title":"晶科拟出售其晶科美国工厂75.1%股权至FH JKV Holdings Limited","summary":"晶科拟出售其全资子公司JinkoSolar(U.S.)IndustriesInc.（以下简称“晶科美国工厂”或“目标公司”）75.1%股权至FH JKV Holdings Limited。FHCapital是一家专注于成长型清洁能源投资的私募股权基金。董事张唯为施正荣配偶。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bZG7KTn4znEXurtCkB3tbg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-08|美国|晶科拟出售其晶科美国工厂75.1%股权至FH JKV Holdings Limited"},{"date":"2026-05-07","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"正泰","title":"正泰面向海外分布式光伏市场推出 PVSTAR Design 智能设计平台，进一步强化其在户用及工商业分布式场景中的数字化设计能力","summary":"正泰为海外分布式市场打造的PVSTAR Design智能设计平台于近日上线。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/39fdkn1K0H_8siFlZDW7Vg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-07|中国|正泰面向海外分布式光伏市场推出 PVSTAR Design 智能设计平台，进一步强化其在户用及工商业分布式场景中的数字化设计能力"},{"date":"2026-05-06","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"工商业","title":"越南南方电力公司透露，屋顶光伏法令草案正在由政府和工贸部征求意见","summary":"Mr. Bui Quoc Hoan, Deputy CEO of Southern Power Corporation, revealed that a draft decree on rooftop solar is being circulated for feedback by the government and the Ministry of Industry and Trade. Significantly, the self-consumption mechanism is being revised to increase the compensation rate for surplus electricity fed back into the grid from 20 percent to 50 percent, based on market prices. As Vietnam transitions toward a competitive power market, the average electricity price in 2025 is projected to reach around VND1,100 per kWh, up from roughly VND 800 per kWh at present. 越南南方电力公司副总裁裴国欢（Bui Quoc Hoan）透露，一项关于屋顶光伏的法令草案正在政府和工业与贸易部征求意见。自发自用机制正在修订，将并入电网的剩余电力补偿率按市场价格从 20%提高到 50%。随着越南向竞争性电力市场过","sourceUrl":"https://en.sggp.org.vn/vast-potential-for-rooftop-solar-development-in-hcmc-post126028.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-06|越南|越南南方电力公司透露，屋顶光伏法令草案正在由政府和工贸部征求意见"},{"date":"2026-05-05","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"PLN招标","title":"印尼国有电力公司 PLN 已启 1,225 MW的光伏项目开启招标","summary":"Indonesian state-owned electric utility company PLN has opened a tender for a solar project with a total capacity of 1,225 MW. The Mentari Nusantara I solar power project will be developed across multiple regions of Indonesia, with 35 MW planned in Sumatra, 340 MW in Kalimantan, 600 MW in Java, 50 MW in Sulawesi, 80 MW in West Nusa Tenggara and 120 MW in Maluku and Papua. 印度尼西亚国有电力公司 PLN 已为一项总装机容量为 1,225 兆瓦的太阳能项目开启招标。Mentari Nusantara I 太阳能发电项目将在印度尼西亚多个地区开发：在苏门答腊规划 35 兆瓦，加里曼丹 340 兆瓦，爪哇 600 兆瓦，苏拉威西 50 兆瓦，西努沙登加拉 80 兆瓦，以及马鲁古和巴布亚 120 兆瓦。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/05/05/indonesia-tenders-1-2-gw-of-solar","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-05|印尼|印尼国有电力公司 PLN 已启 1,225 MW的光伏项目开启招标"},{"date":"2026-05-04","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"隆基","title":"隆基储能最重要的目标市场是中国、欧洲、澳洲和美国","summary":"隆基绿能通过收购股权等形式取得苏州精控能源科技股份有限公司约61.9998%的表决权，后者主要从事锂离子电池储能系统业务。钟宝申在业绩会上称，公司储能产品已获得多个国内外客户订单，“目前最重要的市场是中国、欧洲、澳洲和美国。在美国市场，我们已通过精控设立子公司，正在推进股权结构调整以符合美国FEOC要求，相关方案已制定完成，正在有序推进。","sourceUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-04/doc-inhwtzzv3489187.shtml","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-05-04|中国|隆基储能最重要的目标市场是中国、欧洲、澳洲和美国"},{"date":"2026-05-02","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Atlas Tower Kenya","title":"美国企业 Atlas Tower Kenya 宣布投资 5,250 万美元，新建 300 座太阳能通信塔，为 Safaricom、Airtel 和 Telkom Kenya 等主要运营商提供服务","summary":"Diesel, which powers the majority of Africa’s roughly 500,000 telecommunications towers. Rising diesel prices linked to the Iran war are adding urgency to a shift already underway across Africa to move cellphone towers off fossil fuels and onto solar power. American-owned Atlas Tower Kenya said it was investing $52.5 million to construct 300 new, solar-powered telecommunication towers to serve major operators, including Safaricom, Airtel and Telkom Kenya. The firm currently has 82% of its 500 towers solar powered. 柴油为非洲约 50 万座电信基站中的绝大多数提供动力，受伊朗局势影响，柴油价格持续上涨，这使得非洲各地正在推进的、将手机基站从化石燃料转向太阳能的转型进程变得更加紧迫。美国企业 Atlas Tower Kenya 宣布将投资 5250 万美元，新建 300 座太阳能通信塔，为 Safaricom、Airtel 和 Telkom Kenya 等主要运营商提供服","sourceUrl":"https://apnews.com/article/solar-towers-africa-energy-diesel-5ab1f050d9b0ba90d21a5d53f153ba2d","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-05-02|肯尼亚|美国企业 Atlas Tower Kenya 宣布投资 5,250 万美元，新建 300 座太阳能通信塔，为 Safaricom、Airtel 和 Telkom Kenya 等主要运营商提供服务"},{"date":"2026-04-30","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"服务","company":"正泰","title":"正泰安能携手中国代理商，在以肯尼亚为代表的东非市场落地户用离网光伏业务，并取得阶段性突破","summary":"正泰安能携手中国代理商在肯尼亚为代表的东非市场落地户用离网光伏业务，并取得阶段性突破。中国代理商在肯尼亚完成本土化运营体系、本地经销网络和终端市场开拓，实现从方案到订单交付、销售额稳步增长的闭环。多个中国代理商团队已在肯尼亚完成店铺租赁、执照办理、门店装修，提供产品体验、方案咨询和售后服务，门店网络覆盖Migori、Kisumu、Kakamega、Siaya、Kilifi等核心地区，重点服务农村离网用电刚需。依托肯尼亚全资子公司，正泰安能搭建本地销售、技术、安装售后和客服团队，提供7×24小时英语和斯瓦希里语双语服务热线，解决代理商“出海水土不服”的难题。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UsvbaDV2xCZTQJuDE8herA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-30|肯尼亚|正泰安能携手中国代理商，在以肯尼亚为代表的东非市场落地户用离网光伏业务，并取得阶段性突破"},{"date":"2026-04-30","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"节电","title":"Sao Nam公司CEO表示对于每月电费在 240 万至 400 万越南盾（620-1,034元）的家庭，混合屋顶光伏系统（并网且带储能）投资成本在 5000 万至 1 亿越南盾（12,925-25,850元）之间，电费可降低 50%到近 100%","summary":"Sao Nam公司CEO表示对于每月电费在 240 万至 400 万越南盾（620-1,034元）的家庭，混合屋顶光伏系统（并网且带储能）投资成本在 5000 万至 1 亿越南盾（12,925-25,850元）之间，电费可降低 50%到近 100%。回收期在 3.5 年以内。（1 越南盾 = 0.000285 人民币）","sourceUrl":"https://vietnamnet.vn/en/rooftop-solar-helps-business-households-save-up-to-vnd20-million-monthly-2511065.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-30|越南|Sao Nam公司CEO表示对于每月电费在 240 万至 400 万越南盾（620-1,034元）的家庭，混合屋顶光伏系统（并网且带储能）投资成本在 5000 万至 1 亿越南盾（12,925-25,850元）之间，电费可降低 50%到近 100%"},{"date":"2026-04-29","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"NEPC/ERC","title":"泰国国家能源政策委员会（NEPC）在 4 月 29 日会议上通过了两项重要决议：一是批准居民用电实施阶梯电价","summary":"泰国国家能源政策委员会（NEPC）在 4 月 29 日会议上通过了两项重要决议：一是批准居民用电实施阶梯电价。MEA和PEA须于 2026 年 6 月前完成定价结构调整，并将 369,568,004.06 泰铢（8130万元）的绕行天然气基金（Bypass Gas Fund），作为 2026 年 5 - 8 月期间每月用电量不超过 200 度用户的燃料调整费（Ft）折扣补贴；二是推动“公民屋顶光伏（Citizen Solar）”计划。批准以“净计费（Net Billing）”方式，向安装屋顶光伏的居民收购多余电力，全国总收购规模不超过 500 兆瓦，每个电表最多可并网出售 5 千瓦装机。配电机构将以 2.20 泰铢/度（0.484元/度）的价格收购，合同期 10 年；ERC 须于 2026 年 6 月前出台并公布具体收购规则。","sourceUrl":"https://www.kaohooninternational.com/politics/581786","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-29|泰国|泰国国家能源政策委员会（NEPC）在 4 月 29 日会议上通过了两项重要决议：一是批准居民用电实施阶梯电价"},{"date":"2026-04-29","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Mulia Industrindo","title":"印尼最大屋顶光伏项目在西爪哇 Cikarang 的 Mulia Industrindo 工业综合体投产","summary":"印尼最大屋顶光伏项目在Cikarang的Mulia工业园区投产运营，该项目装机规模为 22.5 MWp，采用610W组件，覆盖面积达 122,783 ㎡，由Mulia工业园区和印尼Xurya Daya合作开发。该系统每天平均可发电 68,500 kWh，以满足全天候的生产需求。","sourceUrl":"https://jakartaglobe.id/business/indonesias-largest-rooftop-solar-plant-begins-operations-at-cikarang-factory","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-29|印尼|印尼最大屋顶光伏项目在西爪哇 Cikarang 的 Mulia Industrindo 工业综合体投产"},{"date":"2026-04-28","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"正泰","title":"正泰与中能建就深化新能源、零碳园区、算电协同、海外业务等领域合作进行深入交流，并达成广泛共识","summary":"4月28日，正泰集团董事长南存辉一行到访中国能建总部，与中国能建党委书记、董事长倪真举行会谈。双方就深化新能源、零碳园区、算电协同、海外业务等领域合作进行深入交流，并达成广泛共识。双方高管及业务负责人参与交流。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-09wX0ioaxLchNHXtE8LJw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-28|中国|正泰与中能建就深化新能源、零碳园区、算电协同、海外业务等领域合作进行深入交流，并达成广泛共识"},{"date":"2026-04-27","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"电费","title":"肯尼亚4月电费上涨","summary":"肯尼亚4月电费上涨。EPRA 宣布，2026 年 4 月的电价将被调整，加入外汇波动调整 1.2341肯尼亚先令/度（0.0649元/度）、水资源征费 0.0154 肯尼亚先令/度（0.0008元/度）和燃料能源成本附加费（FECC） 3.47 肯尼亚先令/度（0.1825元/度），总计上涨上限约 4.72 先令/度（0.2483元/度）（未含增值税和固定费）。新的附加费用影响在全国范围内不会均匀分布。水费征收主要适用于水电站发电。（ 1 KES = 0.0526 CNY）","sourceUrl":"https://www.pvknowhow.com/news/kenya-electricity-bills-unexpected-surge-in-2026-spurs-solar/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-27|肯尼亚|肯尼亚4月电费上涨"},{"date":"2026-04-26","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"隆基","title":"隆基意大利蒙塔尔托 13.75MW/50.16MWh 电池储能系统（BESS）项目已成功并网并开始运营","summary":"隆基宣布其 13.75MW/50.16MWh 的蒙塔尔托电池储能系统（BESS）项目已成功并网并开始运营。该系统与现有的 35MWp 光伏电站共址运行。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/industry-updates/longi-achieves-grid-connection-of-bess-project-in-italy/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-26|意大利|隆基意大利蒙塔尔托 13.75MW/50.16MWh 电池储能系统（BESS）项目已成功并网并开始运营"},{"date":"2026-04-24","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源股份有限公司再次向港交所提交上市申请书","summary":"据港交所文件显示，阳光电源股份有限公司向港交所提交上市申请书。此前，2025年10月5日，阳光电源向香港交易所正式提交上市申请书，拟在香港主板进行二次上市，独家保荐人为中金公司。截至2025年6月30日，储能系统累计出货量达70GWh。公司A股报告显示，2025年，阳光电源实现营业收入891.84亿元，同比增加14.55%；毛利率31.83%，同比增加1.89%；归属上市公司股东的净利润134.6亿元，同比增长21.97%；归属于上市公司股东的扣非净利润128.29亿元，同比增加19.98%。其中，储能系统营收372.87亿元，同比增长49.39%，毛利率36.49%，同比微降0.2个百分点；新能源投资开发营业收入165,59亿元，同比下降21.16%，毛利率14.5%，同比下降4.9个百分点；光伏逆变器等电力电子转换设备营收311.36亿元，同比增长6.9%，毛利率34.66%，同比增长3.76个百分点。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qT-0JWkdH4PeNTQWZHYaXw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-24|中国|阳光电源股份有限公司再次向港交所提交上市申请书"},{"date":"2026-04-24","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源在第三届全球可再生能源峰会（GRES） 2026发布多场景解决方案，涵盖光伏储能一体化、矿山微电网、电动汽车充电以及光储氢一体化等方向；重点产品包括：PowerMatrix强调光伏、储能、电网、负荷一体化及源端构网能力，PowerTitan 3.0主打高盈利性、安全性及构网能力，其模块化设计可实现 1 GWh 项目仅需 12 天完成部署","summary":"阳光电源在第三届全球可再生能源峰会（GRES） 2026发布多场景方案，覆盖光伏储能一体化、矿山微电网、电动汽车充电以及光伏-储能-氢能应用等；PowerMatrix强调光伏、储能、电网、负荷一体化与源端构网能力，PowerTitan 3.0强调高盈利、安全和构网能力，模块化设计使得 1 GWh 项目仅需 12 天即可部署完成。","sourceUrl":"https://www.sungrowpower.com/en/sungrow-hosts-gres-2026-showcasing-value-driven-innovation-across-full-energy-scenarios","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-24|中国|阳光电源在第三届全球可再生能源峰会（GRES） 2026发布多场景解决方案，涵盖光伏储能一体化、矿山微电网、电动汽车充电以及光储氢一体化等方向；重点产品包括：PowerMatrix强调光伏、储能、电网、负荷一体化及源端构网能力，PowerTitan 3.0主打高盈利性、安全性及构网能力，其模块化设计可实现 1 GWh 项目仅需 12 天完成部署"},{"date":"2026-04-23","country":"西班牙","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"服务","company":"隆基","title":"隆基位于西班牙马德里的卓越中心（CoE）正式启用，该中心作为一站式服务中心提供本地化支持","summary":"隆基宣布其位于西班牙马德里的卓越中心（CoE）正式启用，这标志着公司在加强南欧地区太阳能+储能解决方案的本地服务能力方面迈出了重要一步，同时也彰显了其致力于在可再生能源项目全生命周期内为客户提供支持的承诺。马德里卓越中心（CoE）作为一站式服务中心，在项目开发、运营、技术培训及合作伙伴发展等方面提供本地化支持。该中心业务涵盖项目咨询、设计、安装、调试、运营与维护（O&M）、资产优化、技术培训及备件管理，致力于为该地区的客户和合作伙伴提供更高效、响应更迅速且更便捷的服务体验。","sourceUrl":"https://www.longi.com/en/news/madrid-coe/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-23|西班牙|隆基位于西班牙马德里的卓越中心（CoE）正式启用，该中心作为一站式服务中心提供本地化支持"},{"date":"2026-04-21","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"阿特斯","title":"上交所已正式受理阿特斯甘肃酒泉200MW/800MWh独立储能电站的有型不动产资产支持专项计划（ABS），拟发行规模4.51亿元","summary":"上交所已正式受理阿特斯甘肃酒泉200MW/800MWh独立储能电站的有型不动产资产支持专项计划（ABS），拟发行规模4.51亿元。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/P_q2VK_OxtexRf5H6-unIw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-21|中国|上交所已正式受理阿特斯甘肃酒泉200MW/800MWh独立储能电站的有型不动产资产支持专项计划（ABS），拟发行规模4.51亿元"},{"date":"2026-04-20","country":"约旦","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"隆基","title":"隆基学院通过其 LONGi Academy 平台，与能源工程师协会合作，在安曼应用科学私立大学成功举办了能源行业转型挑战论坛","summary":"LONGi Academy Hosts Successful Energy Transformation Forum in Amman, Jordan [18 April 2026], through its LONGi Academy platform, successfully concluded the Energy Sector Transformation Challenge Forum, held at Applied Science Private University in Amman, in collaboration with Association of Energy Engineers. This initiative reflects LONGi Academy’s ongoing commitment to empowering the next generation of energy leaders by equipping them with cutting-edge knowledge and practical insights. 隆基学院于 2026 年 4 月 18 日通过其 LONGi Academy 平台，与能源工程师协会合作，在安曼应用科学私立大学成功举办了能源行业转型挑战论坛。这一举措体现了隆基学院持续致力于通过传授前沿知识和实践见解来赋能下一代能源领袖。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/20/longi-academy-hosts-successful-energy-transformation-forum-in-amman/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-20|约旦|隆基学院通过其 LONGi Academy 平台，与能源工程师协会合作，在安曼应用科学私立大学成功举办了能源行业转型挑战论坛"},{"date":"2026-04-20","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"晶科","title":"晶科发布2025年全年财报","summary":"晶科推出轻量化屋顶组件，重量约 7 kg/m²，输出 560W，效率 24.94%，定位就是屋顶场景。晶科发布2025年全年财报：组件出货86GW蝉联第一，累计交付超390GW。储能业务仍保持高速增长，2025年储能出货量达5.2GWh。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/04/20/jinkosolar-debuts-rooftop-pv-module-weighing-7-kg-m2/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-20|中国|晶科发布2025年全年财报"},{"date":"2026-04-20","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Levanta","title":"Levanta Renewables 与泰国开泰银行（Kasikornbank）和三井住友银行（Sumitomo Mitsui Banking Corporation）签署融资协议，为其在泰国运营的 93 MWp 光伏组合“Daisy Solar Portfolio”融资","summary":"Levanta Renewables has signed project finance agreements with Kasikornbank and Sumitomo Mitsui Banking Corporation for the debt refinancing of its 93 MWp operational solar portfolio in Thailand, known as the Daisy Solar Portfolio. Levanta Renewables 已与泰国开泰银行（Kasikornbank）和三井住友银行（Sumitomo Mitsui Banking Corporation）签署项目融资协议，对其在泰国运营的 93 MWp 光伏组合“Daisy Solar Portfolio”进行债务再融资。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/20/levanta-secures-financing-for-93-mwp-daisy-solar-portfolio-in-thailand/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-20|泰国|Levanta Renewables 与泰国开泰银行（Kasikornbank）和三井住友银行（Sumitomo Mitsui Banking Corporation）签署融资协议，为其在泰国运营的 93 MWp 光伏组合“Daisy Solar Portfolio”融资"},{"date":"2026-04-20","country":"印度","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"农业水泵","title":"Crompton Greaves Consumer Electricals 中标Maharashtra国家电力公司合同，总价值 7,175 万卢比（516.6万元），为Maharashtra部署 3,540 套离网直流光伏农业抽水系统","summary":"In a significant development for India’s decentralized renewable energy ecosystem, Crompton Greaves Consumer Electricals has been awarded a ₹71.75 crore contract by Maharashtra State Electricity Distribution Co. Ltd to deploy 3,540 off-grid DC solar photovoltaic (PV) water pumping systems across Maharashtra. This component is strategically designed to reduce grid dependency in rural irrigation while mitigating subsidy burdens associated with conventional electricity supply. From a technical and execution standpoint, the contract encompasses the complete lifecycle delivery of the systems, including design engineering, manufacturing, supply chain coordination, installation, testing, and commis","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/20/crompton-greaves-wins-%E2%82%B971-75-cr-msedcl-order-for-3540-off-grid-solar-pumps-in-maharashtra/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-20|印度|Crompton Greaves Consumer Electricals 中标Maharashtra国家电力公司合同，总价值 7,175 万卢比（516.6万元），为Maharashtra部署 3,540 套离网直流光伏农业抽水系统"},{"date":"2026-04-19","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"融资","company":"Levanta","title":"越南投资与发展银行（BIDV）已批准了Levanta Renewables位于越南Dong Nai省的一个 13.3 MW屋顶光伏项目的融资协议","summary":"Financing for rooftop project in Vietnam: Actis-backed Levanta Renewables has secured financing for the ‘largest’ centralized operational rooftop solar project. The Bank for Investment and Development of Vietnam (BIDV) has approved the financing agreement for a 13.3 MW rooftop PV project in Vietnam’s Dong Nai province. Levanta calls it the company’s 1st successfully executed project financing in the country. 越南屋顶光伏项目获得融资：由 Actis 支持的 Levanta Renewables 已为“最大”的集中式运营屋顶光伏项目争取到融资。越南投资与发展银行（BIDV）已批准了位于越南同奈省的一个 13.3 兆瓦屋顶光伏项目的融资协议。Levanta 称这是该公司在越南成功执行的首个项目融资。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/04/20/jinkosolar-debuts-rooftop-pv-module-weighing-7-kg-m2/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-19|越南|越南投资与发展银行（BIDV）已批准了Levanta Renewables位于越南Dong Nai省的一个 13.3 MW屋顶光伏项目的融资协议"},{"date":"2026-04-17","country":"巴基斯坦","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"系统","company":"正泰","title":"正泰电源在巴基斯坦国际太阳能展展示方案包括","summary":"正泰电源在巴基斯坦国际太阳能展展示方案包括。地面电站光储柴并网方案：9.6MW/20MWh大型光储柴方案、中型800V低压光储耦合方案、小型低压光储耦合方案（1.6MW/3.34MWh交直流一体机）；工商业光储并网方案（125kW/261kWh）；户用储能并网方案，支持并网/离网无缝切换。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cJ4ItFe0w3Ffap1dYLUGFA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-17|巴基斯坦|正泰电源在巴基斯坦国际太阳能展展示方案包括"},{"date":"2026-04-17","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"户用订阅","title":"Terra Energy 向屋主提供为期初始 36 个月的太阳能订阅，力图通过更好的服务来长期留住这些客户","summary":"Florida-based Terra Energy offers solar subscriptions to homeowners on an initial 36-month agreement and seeks to retain those customers for the long-term by proving it can offer something better than the alternative. 总部位于佛罗里达的 Terra Energy 向屋主提供为期初始 36 个月的太阳能订阅，并力图通过证明其能提供比替代方案更好的服务来长期留住这些客户。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/04/17/u-s-startup-aims-to-make-signing-up-for-solar-as-easy-as-signing-up-for-cell-phone-service/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-17|美国|Terra Energy 向屋主提供为期初始 36 个月的太阳能订阅，力图通过更好的服务来长期留住这些客户"},{"date":"2026-04-16","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"AIDC","company":"晶科","title":"晶科科技与中卫市人民政府签署《投资协议》，就宁夏中卫1GW算力中心项目达成合作意向","summary":"4月16日，晶科科技发布公告称，公司与中卫市人民政府签署《投资协议》，就宁夏中卫1GW算力中心项目达成合作意向。该项目计划总投资约245亿元，占地约800亩，计划部署机柜约5万架，分三期建设。一期：计划投资约100亿元，IT功率400MW; 二期：计划投资约60亿元，IT功率300MW; 三期：计划投资约85亿元，IT功率300MW。中卫市政府将本项目纳入中卫市重点招商引资项目及中卫数据中心集群重点建设项目，争取落实光伏项目指标、电力接入资源，加快办理土地、备案、林草等前期手续；协助乙方申报国家“东数西算”相关示范项目，支持乙方参与零碳园区、算电协同等创新领域试点；协调争取乙方在本合同约定运营期内，宁夏电网供电部分的综合到户电价与中卫数据中心集群内其他企业享受同等电价政策。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LZ52j-hZgXepQnDVV4DDsA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-16|中国|晶科科技与中卫市人民政府签署《投资协议》，就宁夏中卫1GW算力中心项目达成合作意向"},{"date":"2026-04-16","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"正泰","title":"正泰电器披露2025年年报及2026年一季报","summary":"正泰电器披露2025年年报及2026年一季报。2025年，正泰电器实现营业收入591.45亿元，同比下降8.33%；实现归属于上市公司股东的净利润45.01亿元，同比增长16.19%。正泰电器的“泰无界”数智互联平台构建起智慧配电、智慧工商业微电网、智慧户用微电网、智慧电力运维四大软硬件一体化解决方案。随着新加坡日光集成配电工厂数智化改造升级、捷克低压元件适配点敏捷响应，公司本土化交付夯基固本筑能，盈利能力逐步提升。绿色能源业务方面，公司旗下正泰安能以户用光伏电站建设与运营服务为发展基石，2025年实现营业收入287.28亿元，实现净利润30.40亿元，新增装机容量超14GW，电站交易规模超7GW，报告期末持有电站装机容量约27GW。公司电站业务结构持续优化升级，目前新能源项目投资开发、建设运维已遍布五大洲。截至3月31日，公司持有光伏电站装机容量27834.96兆瓦，其中户用光伏电站装机容量24955.96兆瓦。","sourceUrl":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202604163706443827.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-16|中国|正泰电器披露2025年年报及2026年一季报"},{"date":"2026-04-16","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"并网规模","title":"截至 3 月 31 日，意大利共 3,670 份光伏并网申请，总计 144 GW，自 2025 年 8 月以来略微持续下降，根据意大利电网运营商 Terna 的最新更新，准建（RtB）太阳能申请继续增加，达到 210 个项目，总计 9.34 GW，且容量仍集中在西西里、普利亚和撒丁岛","summary":"Italy recorded 3,670 PV connection applications totaling 144 GW amid a slight ongoing decline since August 2025, while ready-to-build projects rose to 210 or 9.34 GW, with capacity remaining concentrated in Sicily, Puglia and Sardinia. 意大利记录了 3,670 份光伏并网申请，总计 144 吉瓦，自 2025 年 8 月以来略微持续下降，同时可建项目增加至 210 个，容量为 9.34 吉瓦，且容量仍集中在西西里、普利亚和撒丁岛。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/04/16/italy-has-now-a-9-34-gw-pipeline-of-ready-to-build-pv-projects/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-16|意大利|截至 3 月 31 日，意大利共 3,670 份光伏并网申请，总计 144 GW，自 2025 年 8 月以来略微持续下降，根据意大利电网运营商 Terna 的最新更新，准建（RtB）太阳能申请继续增加，达到 210 个项目，总计 9.34 GW，且容量仍集中在西西里、普利亚和撒丁岛"},{"date":"2026-04-15","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Enfinity","title":"Enfinity Global 已在意大利锁定 1.8 TWh的电力供应协议，通过面向高耗能行业的 Energy Release 2.0 政策机制，这些场外购电协议将支持在意大利开发约 120 MW的新光伏电站","summary":"US-based renewables firm Enfinity Global has secured agreements for 1.8 TWh of electricity supply in Italy under the country’s Energy Release 2.0 mechanism dedicated to helping high-consumption industries stabilise their energy costs. The company said on Wednesday it had signed the agreements with companies including steelmaker Feralpi, oil refiner ISAB, electrical equipment maker De Angeli and power and gas supplier Magis Energia. These off-take arrangements will enable Enfinity to develop around 120 MW of new solar photovoltaic capacity across Italy. 总部位于美国的可再生能源公司 Enfinity Global 已在意大利通过该国旨在帮助高耗能行业稳定能源成本的“能源释放 2.0”机制，获得了 1.8 太瓦时电力供应协议。该公司周三表示，已与包括钢铁制造商 Feralpi、炼油厂 ISAB、电气设备制造商 De Angeli 以","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/enfinity-lands-industrial-off-takers-for-120-mw-of-new-italian-solar-1293122","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-15|意大利|Enfinity Global 已在意大利锁定 1.8 TWh的电力供应协议，通过面向高耗能行业的 Energy Release 2.0 政策机制，这些场外购电协议将支持在意大利开发约 120 MW的新光伏电站"},{"date":"2026-04-15","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Iberdrola","title":"西班牙电力公司 Iberdrola 收购奥地利能源公司 CCE在意大利拉齐奥地区的一座42 MW）光伏电站","summary":"西班牙电力公司 Iberdrola 收购奥地利能源公司 CCE在意大利拉齐奥地区的一座42 MW）光伏电站。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/15/iberdrola-strengthens-italy-presence-with-42-mw-lazio-solar-acquisition-boosting-etruria-complex-capacity-to-174-mw/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-15|意大利|西班牙电力公司 Iberdrola 收购奥地利能源公司 CCE在意大利拉齐奥地区的一座42 MW）光伏电站"},{"date":"2026-04-13","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Minebea","title":"Minebea Super Solar Power在泰国罗勇府的项目启动，项目包括 48MW 光伏及104 MW/129 MWh项目","summary":"Minebea Super Solar Power Launches 48 MW Solar + BESS Project in Thailand. The development forms part of a broader photovoltaic (PV) and battery energy storage system (BESS) portfolio, which also includes a 104 MW / 129 MWh project in Bang Pa-in. Selected under Japan’s Fiscal Year 2025 Joint Crediting Mechanism (JCM), the project is positioned as a model for cross-border decarbonization efforts. Minebea Super Solar Power在泰国罗勇府的项目启动，项目包括 48MW 光伏及104 MW/129 MWh项目。该项目被选入日本 2025 财政年度的联合归因机制（Joint Crediting Mechanism, JCM），被定位为跨境脱碳努力的示范。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/13/minebea-super-solar-power-launches-48-mw-solar-bess-project-in-thailand/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-13|泰国|Minebea Super Solar Power在泰国罗勇府的项目启动，项目包括 48MW 光伏及104 MW/129 MWh项目"},{"date":"2026-04-11","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"储能","title":"越南颁布第 10 号指令（Directive No.10/CT-TTg）以及《电力发展规划第八版》（PDP8），为分布式光伏和电池储能系统（BESS）部署提出了加快推进方向，以缓解高峰时段供电压力","summary":"Deputy Minister of Industry and Trade Nguyen Hoang Long has said the ministry will support local firms in developing products for battery energy storage systems to help promote renewable energy. Directive No.10/CT-TTg issued on March 30, along with Power Development Plan VIII (PDP8), has set out an urgent roadmap for developing distributed energy sources and installing BESS systems to reduce peak-hour load pressure. According to the revised PDP8, Vietnam is expected to require approximately 10-16GW of BESS in the coming period. 工业和贸易部副部长阮黄龙表示，部委将支持本地企业开发电池储能系统（BESS）相关产品，以助推动可再生能源的发展。2026 年 3 月 30 日颁布的第 10 号指令（Directive No.10/CT-TTg）以及《电力发展规划第八版》（PDP8）为开发分布式能源和安装电池储能系统（BESS）以缓解峰时负荷压力制定了紧急路线图。","sourceUrl":"https://vir.com.vn/ministry-backs-local-bess-production-to-boost-renewable-energy-use-150470.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-11|越南|越南颁布第 10 号指令（Directive No.10/CT-TTg）以及《电力发展规划第八版》（PDP8），为分布式光伏和电池储能系统（BESS）部署提出了加快推进方向，以缓解高峰时段供电压力"},{"date":"2026-04-11","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"产能","company":"储能","title":"GG Power 工厂初始投资为 3000 亿越南盾（8130 万元），占地 1.2 公顷，规划建设一座现代化两层生产车间及研发中心","summary":"With an initial investment of VND300 billion ($12 million), the GG Power plant covers a total area of ​​1.2 hectares, including a modern two-story production workshop and a research and development (R&D) centre with a designed capacity of 5 GWh per cent year. The plant provides comprehensive energy storage systems for all segments, including residential, commercial, and industrial solutions, and utility-scale projects. Regarding its technological foundation, GG Power received technology licensing from Goldwind Group to master its R&D process. At the launching ceremony, GG Industries signed strategic cooperation agreements with eight supporting technology partners, international customers, an","sourceUrl":"https://vir.com.vn/ministry-backs-local-bess-production-to-boost-renewable-energy-use-150470.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-11|越南|GG Power 工厂初始投资为 3000 亿越南盾（8130 万元），占地 1.2 公顷，规划建设一座现代化两层生产车间及研发中心"},{"date":"2026-04-10","country":"澳大利亚","geo":"大洋洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"矿场离网","title":"澳大利亚 Bellevue Gold 位于西澳大利亚州的矿场 3 月实现 90% 可再生能源离网供电","summary":"Australia’s Bellevue Gold achieves 90% renewable energy at off-grid mine in March. Diesel purchases accounted for approximately 1.3% of total project costs during the financial year to 28 February 2026, with the company confirming it remains unaffected by diesel supply issues affecting other mining operations. The renewable energy system supporting Bellevue’s operations combines 27MW of solar PV and 24MW of wind generation with a 15MW/30MWh battery energy storage system. 澳大利亚 Bellevue Gold 位于西澳大利亚州的矿场 3 月实现 90% 可再生能源离网供电。在截至 2026 年 2 月 28 日的财政年度中，柴油采购约占项目总成本的 1.3%，该公司证实其未受到影响其他矿业运营的柴油供应问题的影响。支持 Bellevue 运营的可再生能源系统结合了 27MW 的光伏发电、24MW 的风力发电以及一套 15MW/30MWh 的电池储能系统。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/australias-bellevue-gold-achieves-90-renewable-energy-at-off-grid-mine-in-march/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-10|澳大利亚|澳大利亚 Bellevue Gold 位于西澳大利亚州的矿场 3 月实现 90% 可再生能源离网供电"},{"date":"2026-04-10","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Levanta","title":"Levanta Renewables 与中能建签署 EPC 合同，由中能建为菲律宾维萨亚斯地区的 Barotac 166MWp 光伏发电及 80MWh 储能系统（BESS）提供设计、采购与施工","summary":"Levanta Renewables, a Southeast Asia-focused renewable energy platform backed by Actis, has awarded and signed an Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) contract with China Energy Engineering Group for the Barotac Solar Power and Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) project in the Visayas region of the Philippines. The contract encompasses the full EPC scope for a 166 MWp solar photovoltaic (PV) facility integrated with an 80 MWh battery energy storage system, aimed at enhancing grid stability and ensuring reliable power supply in the region. 专注于东南亚的可再生能源平台 Levanta Renewables（由 Actis 支持）已与中国能源建设集团有限公司（CEEC）签署并授予设计、采购与施工（EPC）合同，用于菲律宾维萨亚斯地区的 Barotac 太阳能发电及电池储能系统（BESS）项目。该合同涵盖一座 166 兆瓦","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/10/levanta-renewables-awards-epc-contract-to-ceec-for-166-mwp-solar-and-bess-project-in-philippines/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-10|菲律宾|Levanta Renewables 与中能建签署 EPC 合同，由中能建为菲律宾维萨亚斯地区的 Barotac 166MWp 光伏发电及 80MWh 储能系统（BESS）提供设计、采购与施工"},{"date":"2026-04-09","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"隆基","title":"隆基绿能与华为数字能源近日签署战略合作协议，双方将在储能系统集成、智能组串式PCS及清洁能源大基地解决方案等领域展开深度合作","summary":"隆基绿能与华为数字能源近日签署战略合作协议，双方将在储能系统集成、智能组串式PCS及清洁能源大基地解决方案等领域展开深度合作。充分发挥各自在资源、技术及市场上的核心优势，在各类项目中实现联合拓展与业务协同，锚定全球核心区域市场，深化储能项目业务协同，推动储能业务规模化落地。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SxmwIGDTtDDkuS1wdiLS3w","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-09|中国|隆基绿能与华为数字能源近日签署战略合作协议，双方将在储能系统集成、智能组串式PCS及清洁能源大基地解决方案等领域展开深度合作"},{"date":"2026-04-08","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Peridot Solar","title":"法国兴业银行与欧洲投资银行（EIB）为意大利 137MW 光伏项目提供1.53 亿欧元(12.2亿元)融资","summary":"Societe Generale, EIB finance 137MW solar PV project in Italy. The Sand Solar project will be built on the island of Sicily in southern Italy by Peridot Solar, an independent power producer (IPP) with headquarters in Italy and the UK. Peridot expects to begin construction at the project this month, which will benefit from a new 30kW connection line to a 30/220kV substation, which is currently under development. The IPP expects to begin commercial operation at the project in the middle of 2027. 法国兴业银行与欧洲投资银行（EIB）为意大利 137MW 光伏项目提供1.53 亿欧元融资。Sand Solar 项目将由总部位于意大利和英国的独立发电运营商（IPP）Peridot Solar 在意大利南部的西西里岛建设。Peridot 预计将于本月开始该项目的施工，该项目将受益于一条正在开发的、连接至 30/220kV 变电站的新 30kW 连接线。该 IPP 预计该项目将于 2027 年中期开","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/societe-generale-eib-finance-137mw-solar-pv-project-in-italy/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-08|意大利|法国兴业银行与欧洲投资银行（EIB）为意大利 137MW 光伏项目提供1.53 亿欧元(12.2亿元)融资"},{"date":"2026-04-07","country":"日本","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"通威","title":"通威与日本 GBP Co., Ltd","summary":"通威宣布与日本 GBP Co., Ltd. 签署合作框架协议，围绕日本市场推进高效光伏产品应用。披露内容特别强调，住宅、工厂、仓库及城市零散土地等“有限面积场景”，需要组件在有限屋顶内持续稳定地实现更高发电量；同时还需应对台风、强风和降雪等极端运行条件。通威也借此突出高功率组件在系统级 BOS 降本与长期稳定性方面的价值。系统层面，TNC 3.0 组件功率的提升减少了整个系统对支架、电缆等配套部件的需求，使整体投资成本降低了约 1.74%，基于日本东京 1MW 彩色钢瓦屋顶项目测算。","sourceUrl":"https://www.tongwei.com/news/detail/170563.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-07|日本|通威与日本 GBP Co., Ltd"},{"date":"2026-04-02","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"天合","title":"天合储能联合科华数能隆重举办AIDC全域融合解决方案专场发布会，以“源储构网为基，配荷高效为核”，打造能源生产、储存、配送到消费的端到端全链路体系","summary":"在第十四届储能国际展览会（ESIE2026）现场，天合储能联合科华数能隆重举办AIDC全域融合解决方案专场发布会。此次发布的AIDC全域融合解决方案，以“源储构网为基，配荷高效为核”，打造能源生产、储存、配送到消费的端到端全链路体系。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GiIQFWETKs53W8NMcPAuiA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-02|/|天合储能联合科华数能隆重举办AIDC全域融合解决方案专场发布会，以“源储构网为基，配荷高效为核”，打造能源生产、储存、配送到消费的端到端全链路体系"},{"date":"2026-04-02","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"通威","title":"中共中央政治局常委、国务院总理李强3月30日至4月1日在四川调研","summary":"中共中央政治局常委、国务院总理李强3月30日至4月1日在四川调研。在通威全球创新研发中心，李强听取光伏技术攻关介绍，进入车间察看电池组件研制情况。他指出要大力支持企业探索创新，加大研发投入、努力突破关键技术瓶颈，打通各类应用场景，加快新技术规模化应用。","sourceUrl":"https://www.tongwei.com/index.php/news/detail/170541.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-02|中国|中共中央政治局常委、国务院总理李强3月30日至4月1日在四川调研"},{"date":"2026-04-02","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"隆基","title":"隆基绿能发布光储融合战略","summary":"LONGi launches integrated solar-plus-storage strategy. The strategy is built around three core principles of ‘one system, one platform and one responsibility,’ aimed at improving project delivery and operational performance. 隆基绿能发布光储融合战略。该战略围绕“一个系统、一个平台、一份责任”三大核心原则构建，通过全栈集成解决问题，提升项目交付和运营绩效。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/longi-launches-integrated-solar-plus-storage-strategy/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-04-02|中国|隆基绿能发布光储融合战略"},{"date":"2026-04-02","country":"塞内加尔","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Axian Group","title":"Axian Group 宣布NEA Kolda 项目已从新兴非洲与亚洲基础设施基金（EAAIF）、荷兰开发性金融机构（FMO）以及德国投资与开发公司（DEG）获得了 7200 万欧元（约合 5.75亿元）的融资","summary":"Axian Group 宣布，位于塞内加尔卡萨芒斯（Casamance）地区的NEA Kolda 项目已从新兴非洲与亚洲基础设施基金（EAAIF）、荷兰开发性金融机构（FMO）以及德国投资与开发公司（DEG）获得了 7200 万欧元（约合 5.75亿元）的融资。项目规模为60 MWp 光伏及72 MWh 储能系统。（1 欧元 =7.98 人民币）","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/axian-reaches-fin-close-for-top-solar-plus-storage-project-in-senegal-1292503/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-02|塞内加尔|Axian Group 宣布NEA Kolda 项目已从新兴非洲与亚洲基础设施基金（EAAIF）、荷兰开发性金融机构（FMO）以及德国投资与开发公司（DEG）获得了 7200 万欧元（约合 5.75亿元）的融资"},{"date":"2026-04-02","country":"赞比亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"CFIP","title":"赞比亚政府与挪威合作启动Carbon Feed-In Premium（CFIP）计划以支持300MW光伏配储并网项目，申请截止日期为2026年5月31日","summary":"赞比亚政府与挪威合作启动碳上网电价补贴（CFIP）计划，征集 300 MW光伏配储并网项目。开发商需在 2026 年 5 月 31 日前提交申请。该计划允许赞比亚开展减排活动，并授权产生国际转让减排成果（ITMOS）以转让给挪威。该计划为 ITMOS 提供至少 10 年的固定碳价支付，以补充购电协议（PPA）的收入，从而使那些原本可能无法完成融资闭环的项目得以实施。第一阶段重点关注连接到国家电网、容量在 30 MW 至 100 MW 之间的太阳能项目，赞比亚电力供应公司 (ZESCO) 或其子公司将作为主要承购方。","sourceUrl":"https://www.greenbuildingafrica.co.za/zambia-opens-carbon-feed-in-premium-programme-to-accelerate-solar-investment/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-02|赞比亚|赞比亚政府与挪威合作启动Carbon Feed-In Premium（CFIP）计划以支持300MW光伏配储并网项目，申请截止日期为2026年5月31日"},{"date":"2026-04-01","country":"澳大利亚","geo":"大洋洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"南澳大利亚州","title":"绿色钢铁、数据中心和氢能推动南澳州电力需求到 2040 年趋近 50 太瓦时（TWh）","summary":"Green steel, data centres and hydrogen push South Australia’s electricity demand toward 50TWh by 2040. The state already generates approximately 75% of its electricity from renewable energy sources and is targeting 100% net renewable energy by 2027, supported by 3,400MW of grid-scale wind and solar capacity plus 3,000MW of rooftop solar across 439,664 installations. 绿色钢铁、数据中心和氢能推动南澳州电力需求到 2040 年趋近 50 太瓦时（TWh）。该州目前约 75% 的电力来自可再生能源，并目标到 2027 年实现 100% 净可再生能源发电。这一目标得到了 3,400 兆瓦电网级风能和太阳能装机容量，以及分布在 439,664 个安装点、共计 3,000 兆瓦屋顶太阳能的支持。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/green-steel-data-centres-and-hydrogen-push-south-australias-electricity-demand-toward-50twh-by-2040/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-01|澳大利亚|绿色钢铁、数据中心和氢能推动南澳州电力需求到 2040 年趋近 50 太瓦时（TWh）"},{"date":"2026-04-01","country":"欧洲","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"PPA价格上涨","title":"中东冲突可能导致欧洲太阳能购电协议（PPA）价格上涨高达 35%","summary":"The conflict in the Middle East could drive European solar power purchase agreement (PPA) prices up by as much as 35% as the conflict shifts towards attacks on energy infrastructure, which pose a risk to global gas supplies. 中东冲突可能导致欧洲太阳能购电协议（PPA）价格上涨高达 35%，因为冲突正转向对能源基础设施的攻击，这对全球天然气供应构成了风险。瑞士分析机构Pexapark指出天然气价格对整体电价具有强大影响——在德国，天然气价格在 45-55% 的时间内决定着边际价格；在英国，这一比例为 35-50%——以及天然气预测价格的上涨将如何推动 PPA 价格的上升。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/pexapark-middle-east-conflict-could-increase-european-solar-ppa-prices-35/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-01|欧洲|中东冲突可能导致欧洲太阳能购电协议（PPA）价格上涨高达 35%"},{"date":"2026-04-01","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"自备电源","title":"肯尼亚自备电源装机容量在过去三年中增长了一倍多，从 250 MW增至 630 MW以上，目前已占该国总装机容量的 16%","summary":"Kenya’s captive power installations have more than doubled over the past three years, growing from 250 megawatts to more than 630 megawatts, now accounting for 16 per cent of the country’s total installed generation capacity. 肯尼亚的自备电源装机容量在过去三年中增长了一倍多，从 250 兆瓦增至 630 兆瓦以上，目前已占该国总装机容量的 16%。","sourceUrl":"https://www.the-star.co.ke/news/2026-04-01-private-power-projects-surge-now-fueling-16-of-kenyas-electricity","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-01|肯尼亚|肯尼亚自备电源装机容量在过去三年中增长了一倍多，从 250 MW增至 630 MW以上，目前已占该国总装机容量的 16%"},{"date":"2026-04-01","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"合作","company":"August Mega Energy","title":"August Energy 与 Mega Energy 成立合资企业 August Mega Energy，并获得了高达 1 亿美元的机构资本承诺（通过股权和债务结合），计划在未来三年内部署超过 200 MWp 的清洁能源装机容量","summary":"In a significant move to accelerate clean energy deployment in Southeast Asia, August Energy and Mega Energy have announced the formation of a new joint venture, August Mega Energy, aimed at serving Vietnam’s commercial and industrial (C&I) energy sector. The partnership, backed by institutional capital commitments of up to USD 100 million through a mix of equity and debt financing, plans to deploy over 200 MWp of clean energy capacity over the next three years. The portfolio will include onsite solar installations, utility-scale solar farms, and battery energy storage systems (BESS), targeting factories, industrial parks, and large commercial establishments across Vietnam. 为了加速东南亚清洁能源的部署，Au","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/04/01/august-energy-mega-energy-establish-august-mega-energy-to-drive-vietnams-industrial-clean-energy-growth","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-04-01|越南|August Energy 与 Mega Energy 成立合资企业 August Mega Energy，并获得了高达 1 亿美元的机构资本承诺（通过股权和债务结合），计划在未来三年内部署超过 200 MWp 的清洁能源装机容量"},{"date":"2026-03-31","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产能","company":"晶科","title":"晶科能源已于 3 月 11 日已正式终止其在越南的 4 GW Hai Ha太阳能电池项目，理由是美国的反倾销税削弱了其出口经济效益","summary":"JinkoSolar has formally terminated its 4 GW Hai Ha solar cell project in Vietnam, citing US antidumping duties that undermined its export economics. The investor requested to halt development and the Quang Ninh Provincial Economic Zone Management Board approved the request under Vietnam’s Investment Law. The authority also revoked the project’s investment certificate, No. 3282186668. 晶科能源已于 3 月 11 日已正式终止其在越南的 4 GW Hai Ha太阳能电池项目，理由是美国的反倾销税削弱了其出口经济效益。广宁省经济区管理局根据越南《投资法》批准了该请求。该机构同时撤销了编号为 3282186668 的项目投资证书。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/03/31/jinkosolar-abandons-plans-to-build-solar-manufacturing-complex-in-vietnam/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-31|越南|晶科能源已于 3 月 11 日已正式终止其在越南的 4 GW Hai Ha太阳能电池项目，理由是美国的反倾销税削弱了其出口经济效益"},{"date":"2026-03-31","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"隆基","title":"隆基绿能亮相非洲太阳能及储能展，展示光伏创新成果并签署 1.3 GW 合作谅解备忘录","summary":"隆基绿能亮相非洲太阳能及储能展，展示光伏创新成果并签署 1.3 GW 合作谅解备忘录。","sourceUrl":"https://www.miningreview.com/news/longi-showcases-solar-innovations-signs-1-3-gw-mous-in-africa/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-31|非洲|隆基绿能亮相非洲太阳能及储能展，展示光伏创新成果并签署 1.3 GW 合作谅解备忘录"},{"date":"2026-03-31","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"节电要求","title":"越南总理范明政签署并颁布了 2026 年 3 月 30 日第 10/CT-TTg 号指令，旨在加强节约用电的实施以及屋顶太阳能的发展","summary":"Viet Nam is striving to save at least 3 percent of the total national electricity consumption in 2026, Prime Minister Pham Minh Chinh has requested. The Directive sets the target that during the peak hot months from April to July, at least 10 percent of total electricity consumption will be saved. During 2026-2030, approximately 10 percent of government offices and 10 percent of households nationwide will install and use self-produced and self-consumed rooftop solar power each year. 越南总理范明政要求，越南力争在 2026 年实现全国总用电量至少节省 3%的目标。该指令设定的目标是，在 4 月至 7 月的用电高峰月份，至少节省总用电量的 10%。在 2026-2030 年期间，全国每年将有约 10% 的政府办公楼和 10% 的家庭安装并使用“自产自销”式屋顶太阳能。","sourceUrl":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/viet-nam-targets-to-save-at-least-3-of-nations-electricity-consumption-this-year-111260331105216278.htm","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-31|越南|越南总理范明政签署并颁布了 2026 年 3 月 30 日第 10/CT-TTg 号指令，旨在加强节约用电的实施以及屋顶太阳能的发展"},{"date":"2026-03-31","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"装机","title":"2026年一季度非洲新增光伏装机约998MW，其中南非贡献928MW，占93%","summary":"According to the Africa Solar Industry Association, a total of 998 megawatts of solar power was installed between January and March. The country alone contributed about 928 megawatts, accounting for 93% of the total installations during the quarter. 2026年一季度非洲新增光伏装机约998MW，其中南非贡献928MW，占93%。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/31/africa-adds-nearly-1-gw-solar-capacity-in-q1-2024-led-by-south-africa-surge/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-31|非洲|2026年一季度非洲新增光伏装机约998MW，其中南非贡献928MW，占93%"},{"date":"2026-03-30","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"菲律宾","title":"菲律宾针对伊朗战争对化石燃料价格的持续影响，加速推进 1.4GW （22个）可再生能源项目，以确保这些项目在下个月内投入运营","summary":"Philippines fast-tracks 1.4GW of renewables amid Iran energy price shock. The Department of Energy (DOE) announced today that it will accelerate the grid integration of 22 renewable energy projects with a combined 1,471MW of generation capacity, to bring them online within the next month. Most of these (12) are solar PV projects with a cumulative 1.28GW of generation capacity, along with six hydroelectric projects, two biomass, one wind project and one integrated renewable energy storage system. 菲律宾在伊朗能源价格冲击下加速推进 1.4GW 可再生能源项目。能源部（DOE）今日宣布，将加速 22 个可再生能源项目的并网工作，总装机容量达 1,471MW，以确保这些项目在下个月内投入运营。其中大部分（12 个）为太阳能光伏项目，累计发电容量为 1.28GW，此外还包括六个水电项目、两个生物质能项目、一个风电项目以及一个综合可再生能源储能系统。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/philippines-fast-tracks-1-4gw-of-renewables-amid-iran-energy-price-shock/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-30|菲律宾|菲律宾针对伊朗战争对化石燃料价格的持续影响，加速推进 1.4GW （22个）可再生能源项目，以确保这些项目在下个月内投入运营"},{"date":"2026-03-27","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"创维","title":"创维光伏与京东产发正式签署战略合作协议，双方将围绕仓储协同、园区光伏、海外拓展等方向推进合作","summary":"2026年3月26日，创维光伏与京东产发正式签署战略合作协议。基于在物流基础设施、智慧能源管理及产业生态协同等方面的优势资源，双方将围绕仓储协同、园区光伏、海外拓展等方向推进合作，进一步深化“供应链+新能源”融合应用场景，继续扩大国内协同范围，加快共拓海外合作布局。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/j0iY21CQxDNRPidqbwxkCw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-27|/|创维光伏与京东产发正式签署战略合作协议，双方将围绕仓储协同、园区光伏、海外拓展等方向推进合作"},{"date":"2026-03-27","country":"埃塞俄比亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"产品","company":"Sun King","title":"Sun King宣布计划在2030年前投入最高1.5亿美元进入埃塞俄比亚市场","summary":"Sun King宣布计划在2030年前投入最高1.5亿美元进入埃塞俄比亚市场。 埃塞是非洲人口第二大国，电气化缺口巨大，Sun King将复制其在肯尼亚和尼日利亚的PAYGo SHS模式。此前Sun King已在2025年底从Lightrock获得4000万美元股权融资，并在内罗毕建设年产70万台的非洲首座制造工厂。","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-03-27/biggest-off-grid-solar-firm-enters-ethiopia-in-150-million-pact","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-27|埃塞俄比亚|Sun King宣布计划在2030年前投入最高1.5亿美元进入埃塞俄比亚市场"},{"date":"2026-03-26","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"晶科","title":"晶科组件出货量突破 400GW","summary":"晶科组件出货量突破 400GW。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/26/jinko-solar-reaches-new-milestone-with-400gw-of-module-shipments/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-26|/|晶科组件出货量突破 400GW"},{"date":"2026-03-26","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"晶科","title":"晶科储能签署拉美 1GWh 储能项目，主要采用SunTera G3 6.25MWh 电池储能系统","summary":"Jinko Energy Storage Signs 1GWh Energy Storage Project in Latin America. 晶科储能签署拉美 1GWh 储能项目。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260327-51159.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-26|/|晶科储能签署拉美 1GWh 储能项目，主要采用SunTera G3 6.25MWh 电池储能系统"},{"date":"2026-03-26","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源在日本和南非签署超 1.2GWh 储能订单，南非为工商业（C&I）储能系统","summary":"Sungrow Power Secures Over 1.2GWh Energy Storage Orders in Japan and South Africa. 阳光电源在日本和南非签署超 1.2GWh 储能订单。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260327-51159.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-26|/|阳光电源在日本和南非签署超 1.2GWh 储能订单，南非为工商业（C&I）储能系统"},{"date":"2026-03-25","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"天合","title":"天合绿建携TEG光伏平瓦、TEG彩色双玻组件及TEG彩色光电玻璃三大核心产品亮相第十六届中国国际清洁能源博览会","summary":"天合绿建携TEG光伏平瓦、TEG彩色双玻组件及TEG彩色光电玻璃三大核心产品亮相，成为展会一大亮点。TEG光伏平瓦2.0在产品尺寸，重量及边框方面进行了升级。产品尺寸为1350*440mm，单块重量为7.65kg，约为传统瓦片的30%，强度为传统瓦片的3倍，可抵御15级台风，功率最大为110Wp。天合绿建向行业展示了光伏与建筑融合的多元可能。从屋顶到立面，从新建建筑到既有更新，天合绿建正以场景化的产品矩阵与一体化的解决方案，推动BIPV向安全、耐久、美学等多维价值演进。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vj4hyrSLt7j-tB6QyPuCQg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-25|/|天合绿建携TEG光伏平瓦、TEG彩色双玻组件及TEG彩色光电玻璃三大核心产品亮相第十六届中国国际清洁能源博览会"},{"date":"2026-03-25","country":"澳大利亚","geo":"大洋洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"天合","title":"天合光能为澳大利亚新南威尔士州Goulburn社区光储电站（Goulburn Community Solar Farm, GCSF）提供的光储一体化解决方案已成功并网投运","summary":"天合光能为澳大利亚新南威尔士州Goulburn社区光储电站（Goulburn Community Solar Farm, GCSF）提供的光储一体化解决方案已成功并网投运。项目集成了天合 Vertex N 组件、支架系统和 Elementa 2 电池储能系统（BESS），已于 2026 年 3 月 21 日开始向电网输电。该项目光伏装机 1.4 MW，储能4.07 MWh。","sourceUrl":"https://www.wedoany.com/shortnews/121697.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-25|澳大利亚|天合光能为澳大利亚新南威尔士州Goulburn社区光储电站（Goulburn Community Solar Farm, GCSF）提供的光储一体化解决方案已成功并网投运"},{"date":"2026-03-25","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"青山","title":"青山实业旗下永青集团所属 IWIP 慈善基金会向印尼两个偏远岛屿捐赠了 8MWh 的构网型储能系统（GFM ESS）解决方案，旨在为离网地区建立稳定可靠的电力基础设施","summary":"The IWIP Charity Foundation, part of the Yongqing Group owned by Tsingshan Industrial Holdings, has donated 8MWh of grid-forming energy storage system (GFM ESS) solutions to two remote islands in Indonesia, aiming to establish stable and reliable power infrastructure in off-grid regions. The project is being implemented by PT Dogo Teknologi Energi (DoGo), which is responsible for delivering the complete solution, including the energy storage system, power conversion system (PCS), and integrated communication and management platforms. The company also led system design, grid simulation, and consulting services to ensure the systems can autonomously create a stable electricity network in chall","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/25/grid-forming-energy-storage-deployment-strengthens-off-grid-power-infrastructure-on-remote-indonesian-islands","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-25|印尼|青山实业旗下永青集团所属 IWIP 慈善基金会向印尼两个偏远岛屿捐赠了 8MWh 的构网型储能系统（GFM ESS）解决方案，旨在为离网地区建立稳定可靠的电力基础设施"},{"date":"2026-03-25","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"132kV输电线路","title":"肯尼亚启动 132 kV Sondu–Homa Bay输电线路","summary":"Kenya has strengthened its power transmission network with the commissioning of the 132 kV Sondu–Homa Bay line, launched on March 23 by President William Ruto. The roughly 69-kilometer line, developed by the Kenya Electricity Transmission Company (KETRACO) in Homa Bay County, is designed to reinforce the national grid by creating a more direct link to the South Nyanza region. 肯尼亚加强了其输电网络，由总统威廉·鲁托（William Ruto）于 3 月 23 日启动了 132 kV 桑杜—霍马湾（Sondu–Homa Bay）线路。这条全长约 69 公里的线路由肯尼亚电力传输公司（KETRACO）在霍马湾郡开发，旨在通过建立与南尼扬扎地区更直接的连接来强化国家电网。","sourceUrl":"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-industry/2503-54089-kenya-expands-grid-capacity-with-new-transmission-line-in-homa-bay","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-25|肯尼亚|肯尼亚启动 132 kV Sondu–Homa Bay输电线路"},{"date":"2026-03-24","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"晶科","title":"晶科科技拟作为有限合伙人，以1.94亿元参与设立嘉兴泽科星槎创业投资合伙企业(有限合伙)，占基金认缴出资总额的97%","summary":"晶科科技（601778）公告，公司拟作为有限合伙人，以1.94亿元参与设立嘉兴泽科星槎创业投资合伙企业(有限合伙)，占基金认缴出资总额的97%。该基金总认缴出资额为2亿元，将主要投资于新一代信息技术领域的优质项目。","sourceUrl":"https://www.chnfund.com/article/AR17548b95-0885-2818-333f-3a2030101704","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-24|/|晶科科技拟作为有限合伙人，以1.94亿元参与设立嘉兴泽科星槎创业投资合伙企业(有限合伙)，占基金认缴出资总额的97%"},{"date":"2026-03-23","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"氢能","company":"阳光","title":"阳光氢能在意大利首个兆瓦级离网光伏制氢项目中，已开始交付一套 3MW 集装箱式 PEM 系统，该系统将在其强大的 HyBrain 氢能智慧管理系统下，与光伏逆变器和储能系统深度集成","summary":"Across Europe and South America, Sungrow Hydrogen is driving regional green transition through technological innovation with the same pace. In Italy's first MW-scale off-grid PV-to-hydrogen project, the company has been shipping a 3MW containerized PEM system, to integrate with PV inverters and battery storage under its powerful HyBrain intelligent hydrogen management system. This integrated \"PV-Storage-Hydrogen\" solution addresses the challenges of coupling variable renewable energy with electrolysis under off-grid situation, offering a replicable model for Europe's industrial decarbonization and clean mobility. Meanwhile, in Brazil, Sungrow Hydrogen has shipped a containerized flexible ele","sourceUrl":"https://www.prnewswire.com/apac/news-releases/sungrow-hydrogen-powers-global-green-transition-with-new-project-shipments-across-three-continents-302721879.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-23|意大利|阳光氢能在意大利首个兆瓦级离网光伏制氢项目中，已开始交付一套 3MW 集装箱式 PEM 系统，该系统将在其强大的 HyBrain 氢能智慧管理系统下，与光伏逆变器和储能系统深度集成"},{"date":"2026-03-23","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"晶科","title":"晶科能源推出AIDC组件，该产品依托成熟的飞虎3组件平台技术，深度聚焦数据中心高负荷、高财产安全、全天长时运行、极端耐候性、稳定可靠、低运维需求、大规模部署等特殊需求，以“高效率、高双面率、高低辐照响应、高防火等级、抗冰雹、高机械载荷”六大核心优势，主要应用场景包括，常规数据中心、AI数据中心、GPU集群、超算中心、边缘计算网络中心、芯片工厂、AI工厂、人工智能零碳园区等，为全球绿色数据中心“算电协同”，提供清洁能源最优解","summary":"JinkoSolar unveils high-efficiency AIDC solar modules designed for Al and data centres,offering enhanced performance, safety and reliability for continuous, large-scale cleanenergy needs. JinkoSolar, a PV and ESs supplier company, has globally launched its new AIDC modules for datacentres. Built on the proven Tiger Neo 3.0 TOPCon platform technology, this product is specificallydesigned for conventional data centres, AI data centres, GPU clusters, supercomputing plants, edgecomputing network centers, chip plants, Al factories and Al-powered carbon-neutral IDZ etc. 该产品依托成熟的飞虎3组件平台技术，深度聚焦数据中心高负荷、高财产安全、全天长时运行、极端耐候性、稳定可靠、低运维需求、大规模部署等特殊需求，以“高效率、高双面率、高低辐照响应、高防火等级、抗冰雹、高机械载荷”六大核心优势，主要应用场景包括，常规数据中心、A","sourceUrl":"https://www.energetica-india.net/news/jinkosolar-launches-aidc-modules-to-power-next-gen-data-centres","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-23|/|晶科能源推出AIDC组件，该产品依托成熟的飞虎3组件平台技术，深度聚焦数据中心高负荷、高财产安全、全天长时运行、极端耐候性、稳定可靠、低运维需求、大规模部署等特殊需求，以“高效率、高双面率、高低辐照响应、高防火等级、抗冰雹、高机械载荷”六大核心优势，主要应用场景包括，常规数据中心、AI数据中心、GPU集群、超算中心、边缘计算网络中心、芯片工厂、AI工厂、人工智能零碳园区等，为全球绿色数据中心“算电协同”，提供清洁能源最优解"},{"date":"2026-03-20","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"UGT2","title":"泰国启动公用事业绿色电价计划第二阶段(UGT2)","summary":"Thailand has taken another important step toward clean energy adoption by launching the second phase of its Utility Green Tariff program, known as UGT2. This new phase focuses on electricity generated from upcoming renewable projects that are expected to start operations between 2024 and 2030. These projects include solar, wind, and biogas energy. The pricing for UGT2 has been set at around 4.56 Thai Baht per kilowatt-hour. The program also provides a fixed contract period of 10 years.","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/20/thailand-launches-ugt2-program-to-boost-corporate-access-to-renewable-energy/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-20|泰国|泰国启动公用事业绿色电价计划第二阶段(UGT2)"},{"date":"2026-03-18","country":"阿曼","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"氢能","company":"阳光","title":"阳光160MW电解槽设备、PWM制氢电源和气液分离与纯化设备顺利发货，助力ACME阿曼绿氨项目","summary":"阳光160MW电解槽设备、PWM制氢电源和气液分离与纯化设备顺利发货，助力ACME阿曼绿氨项目。","sourceUrl":"https://cn.sungrowpower.com/news/1702.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-18|阿曼|阳光160MW电解槽设备、PWM制氢电源和气液分离与纯化设备顺利发货，助力ACME阿曼绿氨项目"},{"date":"2026-03-18","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"系统","company":"阳光","title":"阳光慧碳携手中车长客，依托iCarbon能碳平台，立足行业痛点，基于ILCD国际标准，打造国内首个轨道交通全生命周期碳足迹管理平台","summary":"阳光慧碳携手中车长客，依托iCarbon能碳平台，立足行业痛点，基于ILCD国际标准，打造国内首个轨道交通全生命周期碳足迹管理平台。目前该平台已服务光伏、新能源汽车、动力电池、电子电器等多个行业。","sourceUrl":"https://cn.sungrowpower.com/news/1699.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-18|/|阳光慧碳携手中车长客，依托iCarbon能碳平台，立足行业痛点，基于ILCD国际标准，打造国内首个轨道交通全生命周期碳足迹管理平台"},{"date":"2026-03-17","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"天合","title":"太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）（“天合机构间 REITs”）在上交所正式挂牌上市，是光伏行业首单户用分布式资产机构间REITs","summary":"3月17日，太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）（以下简称 “天合机构间 REITs”）在上海证券交易所正式挂牌上市！作为光伏行业首单户用分布式资产机构间REITs、首单集齐 “碳中和、绿色、乡村振兴”三大主题的机构间 REITs 项目，此次挂牌正式开启分布式光伏产融协同发展新征程。本次天合机构间REITs资产规模为30亿元，投向的底层资产为分布在全国10个省份的28000多个户用分布式光伏电站。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IylJrULEAmCa4Z2rhK9VFQ","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-17|/|太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）（“天合机构间 REITs”）在上交所正式挂牌上市，是光伏行业首单户用分布式资产机构间REITs"},{"date":"2026-03-17","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"展会","title":"肯尼亚清洁能源周第五届盛会将于 2026 年 4 月 16 日在肯尼亚内罗毕的 Emara Hotel Ole Sereni 举行","summary":"Positioned as a high level, industry driven platform, the conference will bring together 300 plus decision makers and more than 150 global companies representing developers, EPC companies, utilities, financial institutions, manufacturers and policymakers. The gathering will focus on the strategic priorities shaping Kenya’s energy transition, including solar deployment, storage integration, distributed energy expansion, financing frameworks, and enabling policy environments for renewable growth. 2026 年肯尼亚清洁能源周筹备工作的推进，第五届盛会将于 2026 年 4 月 16 日在肯尼亚内罗毕的 Emara Hotel Ole Sereni 举行。本次活动由 FirstView 主办，SolarQuarter 提供支持。参会代表包括开发商、EPC 公司、公用事业机构、金融机构、制造商和政策制定者。会议将重点讨论塑造肯尼亚能源转型的战略重点，包括太阳能部署、储能集成、分布式能源扩张、融","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/17/kenya-clean-energy-week-2026-to-convene-east-africas-leading-solar-storage-and-smart-energy-leaders-in-nairobi/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-17|肯尼亚|肯尼亚清洁能源周第五届盛会将于 2026 年 4 月 16 日在肯尼亚内罗毕的 Emara Hotel Ole Sereni 举行"},{"date":"2026-03-16","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"Thai Solar Energy","title":"Thai Solar Energy 计划投资建设 20 座新的太阳能电站，总拟建装机容量为 128.10 MW，以提升公司发电能力并向泰国电网供电","summary":"In a significant move for Thailand’s renewable energy sector, Thai Solar Energy Public Company Limited has announced a major investment in 20 new solar power plant projects. This development underscores the nation’s accelerating shift towards clean energy and solidifies the company’s position as a key player in the region’s green transition. On March 11, 2026, the company confirmed its commitment to developing 20 new solar power facilities, which will have a total proposed capacity of 128.10 MW. This substantial investment is set to dramatically increase the company’s energy generation capabilities and contribute significantly to Thailand’s national power grid.","sourceUrl":"https://www.pvknowhow.com/news/thai-solar-energy-impressive-128-mw-capacity-investment/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-16|泰国|Thai Solar Energy 计划投资建设 20 座新的太阳能电站，总拟建装机容量为 128.10 MW，以提升公司发电能力并向泰国电网供电"},{"date":"2026-03-16","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"PDP2026草案","title":"2026–2050 年电力发展计划草案提出，将扩大包括漂浮式光伏在内的可再生能源规模，并计划将清洁能源占比提升至 50% 以上，以加快实现泰国净零排放目标","summary":"The draft 2026–2050 Power Development Plan aims to expand renewables—including floating solar—boost the clean energy share above 50%, and accelerate Thailand’s net-zero pathway. 2026–2050 年电力发展计划草案旨在扩大可再生能源（包括漂浮式太阳能），将清洁能源份额提升至 50% 以上，并加速泰国的净零排放进程。","sourceUrl":"https://asianbusinessreview.com/news/thailand-eyes-50-clean-energy-in-2026-after-2025-feed-in-tariff-delays","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-16|泰国|2026–2050 年电力发展计划草案提出，将扩大包括漂浮式光伏在内的可再生能源规模，并计划将清洁能源占比提升至 50% 以上，以加快实现泰国净零排放目标"},{"date":"2026-03-11","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"系统","company":"正泰","title":"正泰安能虚拟电厂聚合交易平台正式上线","summary":"正泰安能虚拟电厂聚合交易平台正式上线。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7bCI9NesZKsdnTOjmM-5Pg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-11|/|正泰安能虚拟电厂聚合交易平台正式上线"},{"date":"2026-03-09","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"电池扩产","title":"印尼投资部宣布，已收到14亿美元（ 96亿元 ）外商投资，用于建设一座年产能高达 50 GW的光伏电池板生产厂","summary":"On March 5, 2026, Indonesia's Minister of Investment, Rosan Lesrini, officially announced in Jakartathat an unprecedented solar energy plan has received key impetus: $1.4 billion in foreign investmenthas been received to build a solar panel production plant with an annual capacity of up to 50gigawatts. This super factory, known as the \"heart of the sun\" by local media, is expected to becompleted by the end of 2026. It is not only a production line, but also the core engine for Indonesiato achieve its dream of \"electricity for every village and clean power supply\". 2026年3月5日，印度尼西亚投资部长罗桑·罗斯拉尼(Rosan Roeslani)在雅加达正式宣布，一项前所未有的太阳能计划获得了关键动力:已收到14亿美元外商投资，用于建设一座年产能高达50吉瓦(GW)的太阳能电池板生产厂。这座被当地媒体誉为“太阳之心”","sourceUrl":"https://www.seetaoe.com/details/260061.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-09|印尼|印尼投资部宣布，已收到14亿美元（ 96亿元 ）外商投资，用于建设一座年产能高达 50 GW的光伏电池板生产厂"},{"date":"2026-03-06","country":"厄立特里亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"微电网","title":"非洲开发银行批准约 5800 万美元（3.98亿元）融资，用于厄立特里亚太阳能34 MW光伏微电网项目，旨在为多个城镇及周边农村社区供电","summary":"The African Development Bank has approved a major grant to support the expansion of solar power and the modernization of the national electricity grid in Eritrea. The funding package, valued at approximately $58 million, is aimed at improving access to reliable and clean electricity in the southwestern Gash Barka Region, which is widely known as the country’s agricultural “breadbasket.”The investment will finance the development of a 34-megawatt solar-powered mini-grid system designed to supply electricity to several towns and surrounding rural communities. The project will specifically serve the towns of Tesseney, Kerkebet, and Barentu. By combining solar power with battery storage systems,","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/03/06/african-development-bank-approves-58-million-solar-mini-grid-project-to-expand-clean-energy-access-in-eritrea","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-06|厄立特里亚|非洲开发银行批准约 5800 万美元（3.98亿元）融资，用于厄立特里亚太阳能34 MW光伏微电网项目，旨在为多个城镇及周边农村社区供电"},{"date":"2026-03-05","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"中材节能","title":"中材节能与越南VICEM工业水泥集团旗下的Songtao水泥公司成功签署余热发电总承包合同","summary":"On March 3, 2026, Sinoma Energy Conservation successfully signed a general contract for wasteheat power generation with Songtao Cement Co., Ltd., a subsidiary of Vietnam VICEM IndustrialCement Group. Wang Yi, Assistant to the President and General Manager of the Engineering Branchof Sinoma Energy saving, and Ruan Guanghui, General Manager of Songtao Cement, signed acontract on behalf of both parties to jointly open a new chapter of green and low-carboncooperation. Sinoma Energy Conservation will take this cooperation as an opportunity to further expandcooperation with Vietnam VICEM Industrial Cement Group in new energy fields such asphotovoltaics and energy storage, achieving deep integratio","sourceUrl":"https://www.seetaoe.com/details/259914.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-05|越南|中材节能与越南VICEM工业水泥集团旗下的Songtao水泥公司成功签署余热发电总承包合同"},{"date":"2026-03-04","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"正泰","title":"正泰安能累计户用光伏装机量突破 200 万户","summary":"Chint Energy surpasses 2 million residential PV installations. The systems generate about 59.30 billion kWh annually, helping reduce an estimated 48.25 million tonnes of CO2. The company stated that the projects have delivered nearly RMB 8 billion in income to rural households and supported more than 300,000 rural jobs. Also launching a virtual power plant (VPP) aggregation trading platform, the company said it is making a strategic shift from distributed generation toward smart power system regulation and value aggregation. Another Chint Group subsidiary, Taizhou New Energy, recently announced plans to set up a residential PV fund through a limited partnership, targeting equity investments ","sourceUrl":"https://taiyangnews.info/markets/china-solar-pv-news-snippets-march-4-2026","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-04|/|正泰安能累计户用光伏装机量突破 200 万户"},{"date":"2026-03-04","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"单一电力市场（AfSEM ）","title":"东非电力联盟（EAPP）正在建立必要的监管和机构框架，以推动区域电网一体化","summary":"In its work on the Continental Power Systems Masterplan, the International Renewable Energy Agency (IRENA) notes that the initiative aims to coordinate the development of Africa’s power infrastructure and strengthen interconnections among the continent’s various power pools. The program, led by the African Union and the New Partnership for Africa’s Development (NEPAD), also envisions the gradual creation of a single African electricity market, known as the African Single Electricity Market (AfSEM), designed to expand cross-border power trade across the continent. 东非电力联盟（EAPP）正致力于建立必要的监管和机构框架，以实现该地区的电网整合。与此同时，多个基础设施项目正在推进，以深化东非的电网整合。其中最重大的项目之一是赞比亚-坦桑尼亚-肯尼亚（ZTK）互联工程，旨在连接南非和东非的电力系统。国际可再生能源署（IRE","sourceUrl":"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-industry/0403-53460-east-africa-prepares-regional-power-market-to-deepen-grid-integration","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-04|非洲|东非电力联盟（EAPP）正在建立必要的监管和机构框架，以推动区域电网一体化"},{"date":"2026-03-03","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"Solar Panda","title":"总部位于加拿大多伦多的 Solar Panda 提供租购式屋顶太阳能系统套件","summary":"总部位于加拿大多伦多的 Solar Panda 提供租购式屋顶太阳能系统套件。用户支付少量押金，通过当地移动支付应用每天支付低至 50 美分的费用即可使用，家庭需要支付一到三年的月供才能付清太阳能电池板的费用。该公司于 2017 年在肯尼亚成立，最近刚将业务扩展到三个新国家：赞比亚、贝宁和塞内加尔。由该公司 60 家门店中的数千名外勤代理负责销售，并通常由他们进行安装。该公司目前正为 40 万户家庭、共计 200 万人口提供电力。","sourceUrl":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/climate/distributed-solar-africa-canada-9.7111633","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-03|非洲|总部位于加拿大多伦多的 Solar Panda 提供租购式屋顶太阳能系统套件"},{"date":"2026-03-03","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"Jaza Energy","title":"总部位于加拿大哈利法克斯的 Jaza Energy 设计了一套太阳能电池更换系统","summary":"总部位于加拿大哈利法克斯的 Jaza Energy 设计了一套太阳能电池更换系统。设计初衷是低成本，同时又足够轻便耐用，方便儿童和成年人骑车携带，即使在雨天也不受影响。该公司通过由当地女性（品牌名为“Jaza Stars”）管理的太阳能充电枢纽出租电池。为当地女性带来了变革性的影响。四年前，该公司将业务从坦桑尼亚扩展到了尼日利亚。已培训1800名","sourceUrl":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/climate/distributed-solar-africa-canada-9.7111633","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-03|非洲|总部位于加拿大哈利法克斯的 Jaza Energy 设计了一套太阳能电池更换系统"},{"date":"2026-03-03","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"户用所得税减免","title":"泰国发布皇家法令第805号，个人购买并安装户用光伏系统最高可提供 20 万泰铢（4.4万元）的所得税减免，有效期至 2028 年 12 月 31 日","summary":"The Royal Gazette has published a royal decree introducing income tax relief of up to 200,000 baht for individuals who buy and install an on-grid rooftop solar power system for a home, with eligibility running until December 31, 2028. The system must be connected to the electricity grid of the Metropolitan Electricity Authority (MEA) or the Provincial Electricity Authority (PEA). The exemption is capped at a combined maximum of 200,000 baht. Eligibility applies only to the purchase and installation costs of one solar electricity generation system, paid from the date the decree takes effect until December 31, 2028. The exemption may be claimed once, in the tax year in which the grid connectio","sourceUrl":"https://www.nationthailand.com/news/policy/40063299","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-03-03|泰国|泰国发布皇家法令第805号，个人购买并安装户用光伏系统最高可提供 20 万泰铢（4.4万元）的所得税减免，有效期至 2028 年 12 月 31 日"},{"date":"2026-03-02","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产品","company":"正泰","title":"正泰已在越南完成首个能源管理系统（EMS）示范项目的交付，助力芽庄工艺学院（NTCT）实现智慧能源管理，主要包括升级实验楼的智能低压配电及全面的数字化能源管理系统","summary":"CHINT has completed its first Energy Management System (EMS) demonstration project in Vietnam, upgrading the experimental building of Nha Trang College of Technology (NTCT) with intelligent low-voltage distribution and a comprehensive digital energy management system. 正泰（CHINT）已在越南完成首个能源管理系统（EMS）示范项目，为芽庄工艺学院（NTCT）的实验楼升级了智能低压配电及全面的数字化能源管理系统。","sourceUrl":"https://www.chintglobal.com/global/en/about-us/news-center/news/smart-low-voltage-distribution-project-at-nha-trang-college-of-t.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-03-02|越南|正泰已在越南完成首个能源管理系统（EMS）示范项目的交付，助力芽庄工艺学院（NTCT）实现智慧能源管理，主要包括升级实验楼的智能低压配电及全面的数字化能源管理系统"},{"date":"2026-02-28","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"阳光","title":"阳光电源于2月28日在泰国举办阳光峰会，邀请泰国工程学会（EIT）和中国工商银行（ICBC）专家以及Greenergy 的 EPC 合作伙伴分享成功项目案例","summary":"阳光于2月28日在泰国举办阳光峰会，邀请泰国工程学会（EIT）和中国工商银行（ICBC）专家以及Greenergy 的 EPC 合作伙伴分享成功项目案例。在泰国，阳光电源逆变器的安装量达到了 3.3 GW，储能系统（BESS）达到 350 MWh。其 iSolarCloud 平台可实现一键调试、智能监控和无缝运维。ICBC租赁主要为工商业用户、学校、中小企业及工业园区提供灵活的融资结构、更低的前期投资门槛，以及稳定且透明的能源成本。","sourceUrl":"https://en.sungrowpower.com/blog-detail/6150/thailand-s-solar-energy-market-a-rising-opportunity?utm_source=chatgpt.com","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-28|泰国|阳光电源于2月28日在泰国举办阳光峰会，邀请泰国工程学会（EIT）和中国工商银行（ICBC）专家以及Greenergy 的 EPC 合作伙伴分享成功项目案例"},{"date":"2026-02-28","country":"全球","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"晶科","title":"Elsewedy Electric输配电公司完成并交付EI Saad 光伏电站，规模为 348.6 MW","summary":"Elsewedy Electric输配电公司宣布完成并交付EI Saad 光伏电站，其峰值发电容量为348.6 MW。该项目是与晶科电力(Jinko Power)和AIl Ghazala Energy公司合作开发的。所产生的太阳能将供应给沙特电力采购公司(Saudi PowerProcurement Company)。Elsewedy Electric 声称，该项目在16.5 个月内完工，远早于24个月的截止日期。","sourceUrl":"https://www.mercomindia.com/mena-weekly-round-up-egypt-plans-to-add-2-5-gw-of-renewables-to-the-grid","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-28|全球|Elsewedy Electric输配电公司完成并交付EI Saad 光伏电站，规模为 348.6 MW"},{"date":"2026-02-25","country":"欧洲","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"天合","title":"天合储能宣布正式与储能私募股权投资机构Gore Street Capital (GSC) 达成战略合作，共同参与欧盟储能基金（EU BESS Fund）","summary":"天合储能宣布，正式与全球领先的储能私募股权投资机构Gore Street Capital (GSC) 达成战略合作，共同参与一项新设立的专注于欧盟27国电池储能系统（ BESS）的专项私募基金——欧盟储能基金（EU BESS Fund）。天合储能已承诺投资该基金，与欧洲投资基金 （European Investment Fund）、爱尔兰战略投资基金 (Irish Strategic Investment Fund) 等世界级顶尖金融机构并肩，并将依托自身在系统集成、技术创新及项目交付方面的综合实力，全面支持基金在欧洲市场的储能项目开发与落地。Gore Street Capital预计到今年年底，该基金的总体规模及协同投资金额将上升至 10 亿欧元。基金80%以上的投资及运营布局将集中在欧盟区域，总交付规模目标超过12GWh。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Re_DkCZzRhh_fdqBVEJ3-w","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-25|欧洲|天合储能宣布正式与储能私募股权投资机构Gore Street Capital (GSC) 达成战略合作，共同参与欧盟储能基金（EU BESS Fund）"},{"date":"2026-02-23","country":"尼日利亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"合作","company":"REA","title":"尼日利亚农村电气化局（REA）与 西非国家经济共同体 (ECOWAS) 在区域离网电力普及项目 (ROGEAP) 框架下签署谅解备忘录 (MoU)，为15个公共卫生和教育设施供电","summary":"In a major step toward improving electricity access in public institutions, the Rural Electrification Agency (REA) has signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS) Commission under the Regional Off-Grid Electricity Access Project (ROGEAP). The agreement, signed on February 23, 2026, provides grant funding support from ECOWAS for the electrification of 15 public health and education facilities in Nigeria using solar photovoltaic (PV) systems. Under the agreement, ECOWAS will provide a grant of $700,000 to support the installation of solar PV systems in rural health centres and schools located in the FCT, Niger State, and Nasarawa State","sourceUrl":"https://rea.gov.ng/news/REA-X-ECOWAS/REA-X-ECOWAS.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-23|尼日利亚|尼日利亚农村电气化局（REA）与 西非国家经济共同体 (ECOWAS) 在区域离网电力普及项目 (ROGEAP) 框架下签署谅解备忘录 (MoU)，为15个公共卫生和教育设施供电"},{"date":"2026-02-12","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"天合","title":"由能源基金会支持、北京大学能源研究院牵头，天合富家数智能源研究院与山东环科电力科技有限公司共同参与的《分布式光伏入市交易机制与就地就近消纳模式研究》课题顺利通过结题评审","summary":"由能源基金会支持、北京大学能源研究院牵头，天合富家数智能源研究院与山东环科电力科技有限公司共同参与的《分布式光伏入市交易机制与就地就近消纳模式研究》课题顺利通过结题评审。该研究立足于分布式光伏发展的关键转型阶段，旨在破解行业在消纳模式、收益机制等方面面临的现实难题，为构建可持续发展的产业生态提供支撑。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mIONrWqd7oMIbSReIlu2Iw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-12|中国|由能源基金会支持、北京大学能源研究院牵头，天合富家数智能源研究院与山东环科电力科技有限公司共同参与的《分布式光伏入市交易机制与就地就近消纳模式研究》课题顺利通过结题评审"},{"date":"2026-02-11","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"中广核/中能建","title":"中广核（CGN）旗下子公司 EDRA 在马来西亚Batang Berjuntai的一座 300MW 水面漂浮光伏项目开工","summary":"Developer EDRA Global Energy, a subsidiary of China General Nuclear Power Corporation (CGN), has started construction on a 300MW floating PV (FPV) project in Batang Berjuntai, Malaysia. China Energy Engineering Group Jiangsu Institute is serving as the engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) general contractor of the FPV project, while the operations & maintenance of the project will be carried out by Powertek Sendirian Berhad, a subsidiary of EDRA Global Energy. The project is located in Bestari Jaya, Kuala Selangor District, Selangor, Malaysia, spanning three land parcels totalling approximately 437 hectares. The work scope includes full EPC delivery: design, procurement, construc","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-tech.org/malaysias-largest-standalone-floating-pv-project-begins-construction/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-11|马来西亚|中广核（CGN）旗下子公司 EDRA 在马来西亚Batang Berjuntai的一座 300MW 水面漂浮光伏项目开工"},{"date":"2026-02-11","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Gulf","title":"亚洲开发银行（ADB）已与 Gulf 子公司 GRE 达成合作，融资 3.5 亿美元在泰国建设三个可再生能源项目，其中包括光储项目共 126 MW/151MWh（2个），以及 光伏电站 68 MW（1个）","summary":"The Asian Development Bank (ADB) has partnered with Gulf Renewable Energy Company Limited (GRE), a subsidiary of Gulf Development Public Company Limited (GULF), to advance Thailand’s clean energy transition through a $350 million financing package. The loan will support the development of three renewable energy projects, including two solar-plus-battery energy storage systems (BESS) with a combined contracted capacity of 126 megawatts and 151 megawatt-hours of storage, along with a standalone 68-megawatt solar power plant. Together, these projects aim to expand renewable energy generation, strengthen grid stability, and accelerate the decarbonization of Thailand’s power sector. 亚洲开发银行（ADB）已与","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/02/10/adb-partners-with-gulfs-gre-for-350-million-to-build-three-thailand-renewable-projects-including-126-mw-solarbess-and-a-68-mw-solar-plant","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-11|泰国|亚洲开发银行（ADB）已与 Gulf 子公司 GRE 达成合作，融资 3.5 亿美元在泰国建设三个可再生能源项目，其中包括光储项目共 126 MW/151MWh（2个），以及 光伏电站 68 MW（1个）"},{"date":"2026-02-10","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"天合","title":"马比尼(Mabini)太阳能项目是天合光能在菲律宾投资开发的第一个绿地项目，总装机容量为60MW","summary":"The Mabini solar project is the first green space project invested and developed by Trina Solar inthe Philippines, with a total installed capacity of 60 megawatts. The project covers an area of 41.25hectares and adopts advanced ground mounted photovoltaic technology, with a total investment ofapproximately 1.9 billion Philippine pesos. The project is expected to enter commercial operation bythe end of the third quarter of 2026 and has signed a 20-year power purchase agreement with localpower company AdventEnergy, ensuring its long-term stable market consumption. According tocalculations, the first year of the project's power generation capacity can reach 110.84 gigawatthours, which is suffic","sourceUrl":"https://www.seetaoe.com/details/258726.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-10|菲律宾|马比尼(Mabini)太阳能项目是天合光能在菲律宾投资开发的第一个绿地项目，总装机容量为60MW"},{"date":"2026-02-10","country":"波兰","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"产能","company":"阳光","title":"Sungrow 将在波兰西南部瓦乌布日赫（Wałbrzych）投资约 2.3 亿欧元建设一座光伏逆变器和电池储能系统工厂，这是它在亚洲以外的首个制造基地","summary":"Sungrow 将在波兰西南部瓦乌布日赫（Wałbrzych）投资约 2.3 亿欧元建设一座光伏逆变器和电池储能系统工厂，这是它在亚洲以外的首个制造基地。工厂位于波兰下西里西亚地区，规划面积约 65,400 平方米。产能方面，逆变器年名义产能最高可达 20GW，储能系统可达 12.5GWh。该项目预计在未来 12 个月内投产，投资额约为 2.3 亿欧元，折合约 2.71 亿美元。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energy-storage.news/sungrow-to-invest-us270-million-in-inverter-and-bess-factory-in-poland-first-outside-asia/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-10|波兰|Sungrow 将在波兰西南部瓦乌布日赫（Wałbrzych）投资约 2.3 亿欧元建设一座光伏逆变器和电池储能系统工厂，这是它在亚洲以外的首个制造基地"},{"date":"2026-02-10","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"Gulf","title":"Gulf 已成功获得总计 600 亿泰铢（约 132 亿元）的贷款额度，用于支持泰国境内 27 个可再生能源发电项目的开发，总合同装机容量达 939 MW","summary":"Gulf Development Public Company Limited (GULF) has successfully secured loan facilities totaling THB 60,000 million (approximately USD 1.85 billion) to support the development of 27 renewable energy power projects across Thailand, with a combined contracted generation capacity of 939 MW.The financing was structured through a syndicate of leading domestic and international financial institutions, with the Asian Development Bank (ADB) serving as the Mandated Lead Arranger and Bookrunner. Other lenders include the Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank (AIIB), Deutsche Investitions- und Entwicklungsgesellschaft (DEG), Development Finance Institute Canada (FinDev Canada), Export Finance Australia ","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/02/10/gulf-secures-thb-60-billion-financing-for-939-mw-renewable-energy-portfolio-in-thailand","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-10|泰国|Gulf 已成功获得总计 600 亿泰铢（约 132 亿元）的贷款额度，用于支持泰国境内 27 个可再生能源发电项目的开发，总合同装机容量达 939 MW"},{"date":"2026-02-10","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"近铁集团","title":"近铁集团（Kintetsu World Express, Inc.）在其位于泰国巴真府的仓库安装了约0.2MW光伏发电系统，预计年发电量约为 30.7 万千瓦时，已签署场内PPA购电协议","summary":"Kintetsu World Express, Inc. has taken another step toward cleaner operations by installing a solar power generation system at its warehouse in Prachinburi Province, Thailand. The project has been carried out by its local subsidiary, KWE-Kintetsu World Express (Thailand) Co., Ltd., as part of the group’s wider push toward decarbonized and sustainable business practices. Under the project, an on-site Power Purchase Agreement model has been adopted. A total of 326 solar panels have been installed at the warehouse, with an expected annual power generation of around 307,000 kilowatt-hours. This clean electricity is expected to meet about 96 percent of the warehouse’s yearly power demand, signifi","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/02/10/kwe-installs-solar-power-system-at-thailand-warehouse-to-cut-emissions","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-10|泰国|近铁集团（Kintetsu World Express, Inc.）在其位于泰国巴真府的仓库安装了约0.2MW光伏发电系统，预计年发电量约为 30.7 万千瓦时，已签署场内PPA购电协议"},{"date":"2026-02-09","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"新增装机","title":"2025年，意大利新增光伏6.44GW，同比下降约5%，主要来自户用与工商业光伏需求减弱","summary":"Italy brought online 6,437 MW of new solar photovoltaic (PV) capacity in 2025, registering a 5% year-on-year decline due to a drop in residential and commercial and industrial (C&I) deployments. A total of 2.1 million solar plants with a combined capacity of 43.5 GW were connected to the national grid at end-2025, data by Italian electricity grid operator Terna show. 2025 年，意大利新增太阳能光伏（PV）装机容量为 6,437 兆瓦，由于住宅以及工商业（C&I）部署量的下降，同比减少了 5%。意大利电网运营商 Terna 的数据显示，截至 2025 年底，共有 210 万座太阳能电站连接到国家电网，总装机容量达到 43.5 GW。","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/italys-solar-pv-additions-decrease-to-6-4-gw-in-2025-1289369","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-09|意大利|2025年，意大利新增光伏6.44GW，同比下降约5%，主要来自户用与工商业光伏需求减弱"},{"date":"2026-02-09","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"道达尔/谷歌","title":"道达尔能源已与谷歌签署两份长期购电协议（PPA），向其位于德克萨斯州的数据中心提供 1 GW 的光伏","summary":"French multi-energy group TotalEnergies SE (EPA:TTE) said on Monday it has signed two long-term power purchase agreements (PPAs) to supply 1 GW of solar capacity to Google’s data centres in Texas.Under the terms, Google will procure electricity equivalent to 28 TWh over 15 years. That output will come from the 805-MWp Wichita and 195-MWp Mustang Creek solar farms in Texas, two TotalEnergies-owned projects currently under development. Construction of both plants is scheduled to begin in the second quarter of 2026, the company said. 法国多元能源集团道达尔能源（TotalEnergies SE，欧洲证券交易所代码：TTE）周一表示，已签署两份长期购电协议（PPA），向谷歌（Google）位于德克萨斯州的数据中心提供 1 GW 的太阳能装机容量。根据协议条款，谷歌将在 15 年内采购相当于 28 太瓦时（TWh）的电力。这些电力将来自位于德克萨斯州的 80","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/totalenergies-lands-1-gw-of-solar-ppas-for-googles-texas-data-centres-1289373/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-09|美国|道达尔能源已与谷歌签署两份长期购电协议（PPA），向其位于德克萨斯州的数据中心提供 1 GW 的光伏"},{"date":"2026-02-09","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"装机规模","title":"非洲在 2025 年新增了约 4.5 GW 的太阳能光伏装机容量，同比增长 54%","summary":"Solar Energy Use Rises In Africa But Financial Gaps Could Slow Growth. Data show Africa installed approximately 4.5 GW of new solar PV capacity in2025, representing a 54% year-on-year increase. In 2025, the top 10 solar markets accounted for around 90% of new solar capacity additions, led by South Africa (1.6 GW), Nigeria (803 MW), Egypt(500 MW) and Algeria (400 MW), reflecting continued strength in large, established markets; While utility-scale has accounted for 56% of the installed capacity in 2025; it is important to note that the distributed capacity (44%) is clearly underestimated, as it is harder to track. 非洲太阳能利用率上升，但资金缺口或将放缓增长。非洲在 2025 年新增了约 4.5 GW 的太阳能光伏装机容量，同比增长 54%。2025 年，前十大太阳能市","sourceUrl":"https://panafricanvisions.com/2026/02/solar-energy-use-rises-in-africa-but-financial-gaps-could-slow-growth-report/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-09|非洲|非洲在 2025 年新增了约 4.5 GW 的太阳能光伏装机容量，同比增长 54%"},{"date":"2026-02-05","country":"肯尼亚","geo":"非洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"系统","company":"正泰","title":"正泰安能于2026年1月18日至24日携国内核心代理商前往肯尼亚开展市场调研并签署合作意向协议的情况","summary":"正泰安能于2026年1月18日至24日携国内核心代理商前往肯尼亚开展市场调研并签署合作意向协议的情况。深入肯尼亚Kisumu、Migori、Kakamega等农村地区，走访村民和小微商业体。正泰安能PVSTAR在内罗毕与来访的近20家国内核心代理商正式签署合作意向协议。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T_D_FTDra9M5f_v1ufJEAg","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-05|肯尼亚|正泰安能于2026年1月18日至24日携国内核心代理商前往肯尼亚开展市场调研并签署合作意向协议的情况"},{"date":"2026-02-05","country":"智利","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"三文鱼养殖场","title":"Copec、Luxmeter Energy 和 Ventisqueros 在智利南部偏远地区奥尔诺皮伦（Hornopirén）的 Quintupeu 三文鱼养殖中心投运了一套光储系统，包含一座 48 kW 的光伏电站，配有 109 kWh 储能系统，该离网水产养殖基地能够减少对柴油发电机的依赖，光伏系统可满足三分之二用电需求","summary":"Copec, Luxmeter Energy, and Ventisqueros have commissioned a system at the Quintupeu salmon farming center in Hornopirén, a remote area of southern Chile. The installation features a 48 kW photovoltaic plant paired with a 109 kWh battery storage system, enabling the facility to reduce its reliance on diesel generators in this off-grid aquaculture operation. Copec、Luxmeter Energy 和 Ventisqueros 在智利南部偏远地区奥尔诺皮伦（Hornopirén）的 Quintupeu 三文鱼养殖中心投运了一套系统。该设施包含一座 48 kW 的光伏电站，并配有 109 kWh 的电池储能系统，使该离网水产养殖基地能够减少对柴油发电机的依赖。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/02/05/photovoltaics-for-salmon-farms/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-05|智利|Copec、Luxmeter Energy 和 Ventisqueros 在智利南部偏远地区奥尔诺皮伦（Hornopirén）的 Quintupeu 三文鱼养殖中心投运了一套光储系统，包含一座 48 kW 的光伏电站，配有 109 kWh 储能系统，该离网水产养殖基地能够减少对柴油发电机的依赖，光伏系统可满足三分之二用电需求"},{"date":"2026-02-04","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"晶科","title":"据报道，晶科能源证实Elon·Musk派出的团队对其进行了访问","summary":"JinkoSolar (JKS) +13.7% pre-market Wednesday after a state-backed media outlet reported the company confirmed it had been visited by a team sent by Elon Musk, days after he announced plans to build 100 GW of solar cell capacity in the U.S. during a Tesla earnings call. A team sent by Musk reportedly visited several photovoltaic companies in China, including those involved in equipment, silicon wafers, battery modules and perovskite technology. Jinko Solar (JKS) jumped by the daily limit of 20% in Shanghai trading, while Trina Solar gained as much as 12% and industry bellwether LONGi Green Energy Technology also rose. 晶科能源（JinkoSolar，JKS）周三盘前大涨 13.7%。此前据一家官方媒体报道，该公司证实埃隆·马斯克派出的团队对其进行了访问。就在几天前，","sourceUrl":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4546971-jinkosolar-surges-after-visit-from-elon-musk-team","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-04|/|据报道，晶科能源证实Elon·Musk派出的团队对其进行了访问"},{"date":"2026-02-04","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"碧澄","title":"英国章鱼能源与中国碧澄能源计划在华设立聚焦电力交易业务的合资公司碧桐能源，并为碧桐能源设定了2030年140太瓦时/年的可再生能源电力交易量，以及五年内估值超5亿英镑(约合47.58亿元人民币)的目标","summary":"英国章鱼能源与中国碧澄能源计划在华设立聚焦电力交易业务的合资公司碧桐能源，并为碧桐能源设定了2030年140太瓦时/年的可再生能源电力交易量，以及五年内估值超5亿英镑(约合47.58亿元人民币)的目标。章鱼有一套Kraken操作系统，通过天气预测、分析批发市场电价、电网负荷等动态数据，该平台能让用户获得更低的电费，让电网更稳定。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7UZqgai2f_hy288fTqEf-w","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-04|/|英国章鱼能源与中国碧澄能源计划在华设立聚焦电力交易业务的合资公司碧桐能源，并为碧桐能源设定了2030年140太瓦时/年的可再生能源电力交易量，以及五年内估值超5亿英镑(约合47.58亿元人民币)的目标"},{"date":"2026-02-04","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"数据","company":"天合","title":"天合富家首个综合智慧能源旗舰店落地贵阳","summary":"天合富家首个综合智慧能源旗舰店落地贵阳。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h4BW3gKh-FHoU6JE9g0GTQ","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-02-04|中国|天合富家首个综合智慧能源旗舰店落地贵阳"},{"date":"2026-02-04","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"装机","title":"印尼能矿部（MEMR）数据显示，截至 2025 年底，该国累计光伏装机容量已达到1.49 GW，新增装机规模为 546 MW，其中工商业屋顶光伏占据主导地位","summary":"Indonesia’s cumulative solar capacity stood at 1.49 GW by the end of 2025, according to figures from the country’s Ministry of Energy and Mineral Resources (MEMR). With an estimated 546 MW of added solar last year, led by deployments in the rooftop C&I segment. During January’s conference, MEMR announced that the share of renewable energy in Indonesia’s energy mix increased to 15.75% in 2025, a 1.1% increase on 2024. PLN’s Electricity Supply Business Plan (RUPTL) planned for an additional 777 MW of utility-scale solar in 2025 but commissioned plants last year were led by the 50 MW Nusantara and 25 MW East Bali solar projects, which Tumiwa said “indicates a large gap in PLN’s planning and exe","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/02/04/indonesias-solar-capacity-reaches-1-49-gw/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-04|印尼|印尼能矿部（MEMR）数据显示，截至 2025 年底，该国累计光伏装机容量已达到1.49 GW，新增装机规模为 546 MW，其中工商业屋顶光伏占据主导地位"},{"date":"2026-02-04","country":"非洲","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Ignite","title":"总部位于阿布扎比、专注于非洲市场的离网能源供应商 Ignite Energy Access 在欧盟支持的“电力与可再生能源生产（IAEREP）”项目下，已在赞比亚农村地区投运了 15 个新型太阳能微电网，主要应用场景为家庭、学校、医疗机构和小微企业","summary":"Ignite Energy Access, an Abu Dhabi-based, Africa-focused off-grid energy provider, has commissioned 15 new solar mini-grids in rural Zambia under EU-backed Electricity and Renewable Energy Production (IAEREP). These facilities are part of a broader pipeline of 60 minigrids being developed by the company, and are expected to provide electricity to thousands of homes, schools, health facilities, and small businesses. Ignite said these projects will help drive socio-economic growth across rural Zambia. It plans to add 30 additional minigrids by early 2026, eventually contributing to the country’s 1,000-minigrid program to increase electrification in rural communities. Ignis Power acquired ENGIE","sourceUrl":"https://taiyangnews.info/amp/story/markets/middle-east-solar-pv-news-snippets-february-4-2026","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-04|非洲|总部位于阿布扎比、专注于非洲市场的离网能源供应商 Ignite Energy Access 在欧盟支持的“电力与可再生能源生产（IAEREP）”项目下，已在赞比亚农村地区投运了 15 个新型太阳能微电网，主要应用场景为家庭、学校、医疗机构和小微企业"},{"date":"2026-02-03","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"产能","company":"电池扩产","title":"印尼电池工业公司（IBC）、PT Aneka Tambang Tbk","summary":"Indonesia has taken a major step toward strengthening its clean energy and electric vehicle supply chains with the signing of a framework agreement to develop an integrated battery industry, a project that will also support the country’s ambitious 100 GW solar power expansion programme. The agreement was signed in Jakarta on January 30 between PT Industri Baterai Indonesia (IBC), PT Aneka Tambang Tbk. (ANTAM), and the HYD Investment Limited (HYD) Consortium, with state-owned utility PT PLN (Persero) backing the initiative as a key shareholder in IBC. 印度尼西亚签署了一项开发综合电池产业的框架协议，在加强清洁能源和电动汽车供应链方面迈出了重要一步。该项目还将支持该国雄心勃勃的 100 GW 太阳能扩张计划。该协议于 1 月 30 日在雅加达签署，签署方包括印度尼西亚电池工业公司（IBC）、PT Aneka Tambang Tbk. ","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/02/03/indonesia-signs-6-billion-battery-project-to-support-ev-growth-and-100-gw-solar-power-expansion/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-02-03|印尼|印尼电池工业公司（IBC）、PT Aneka Tambang Tbk"},{"date":"2026-01-30","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"微软","title":"Enfinity Global 与微软在意大利签署的 366 MW购电协议（PPA）组合中的首个 33.8 MW项目已正式投入商业运营","summary":"2026 年 1 月 29 日， Enfinity Global 宣布，其与微软在意大利签署的 366 MW购电协议（PPA）组合中的首个 33.8 MW项目已正式投入商业运营。","sourceUrl":"https://now.solar/2026/01/30/enfinity-global-achieves-commercial-operation-of-first-project-under-its-366-mw-portfolio-of-ppas-with-microsoft-thailand-business-news/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-30|意大利|Enfinity Global 与微软在意大利签署的 366 MW购电协议（PPA）组合中的首个 33.8 MW项目已正式投入商业运营"},{"date":"2026-01-29","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"天合","title":"“太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）”在上海证券交易所成功发行，双方将以此首单Reits成功落地为契机，持续深化“富家2.0”战略实施","summary":"“太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）”在上海证券交易所成功发行，双方将以此首单Reits成功落地为契机，持续深化“富家2.0”战略实施。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fDAbm5n_ywsUQsVWjl2eYw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-29|/|“太保资产-天合富家新能源基础设施碳中和绿色持有型不动产资产支持专项计划（乡村振兴）”在上海证券交易所成功发行，双方将以此首单Reits成功落地为契机，持续深化“富家2.0”战略实施"},{"date":"2026-01-28","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"PLN配额","title":"印尼能源与矿产资源部已提出一项计划，拟在 2026 年国家屋顶光伏分配额度的基础上，额外增加 400 MW的容量","summary":"印度尼西亚正提议大幅提高屋顶太阳能配额，以加速向清洁能源转型。能源与矿产资源部已提出一项计划，拟在 2026 年国家屋顶太阳能分配额度的基础上，额外增加 400 兆瓦的容量。如果该提案获得国有电力公司 PT PLN 的批准，当年的屋顶太阳能总配额将上升至约 1,400 兆瓦。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/01/28/indonesia-proposes-400-mw-boost-to-rooftop-solar-quota-for-2026/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-28|印尼|印尼能源与矿产资源部已提出一项计划，拟在 2026 年国家屋顶光伏分配额度的基础上，额外增加 400 MW的容量"},{"date":"2026-01-24","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"天合","title":"天合光能发布关于变更募集资金投资项目的公告","summary":"1 月 24 日，天合光能发布了关于变更募集资金投资项目的公告。将原“年产 35GW 直拉单晶硅项目”的二期 15GW 产能所剩的募集资金共计人民币 17 亿元（含利息收入及理财收益），将拨付给新项目。新项目即“分布式光伏智能电站建设项目”，总投资额为人民币 34 亿元，规划装机容量约 245MW。建设地点位于江苏、安徽、浙江、广东等光伏电力消纳条件良好的地区，建设期为一年。预计将于 2026 年底前完工并并网运行。经测算，新项目稳定运行后，预计年营业收入将达到约 2.84 亿元，预计净利润为 9490.87 万元，这将为公司的长期发展提供稳定的利润来源和现金流。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260126-50840.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-24|/|天合光能发布关于变更募集资金投资项目的公告"},{"date":"2026-01-21","country":"阿布扎比","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"晶科","title":"晶科科技宣布其与阿布扎比国家能源公司（TAQA）、阿布扎比未来能源公司（Masdar）及法国电力新能源公司共同持有的阿布扎比Al Dhafra光伏电站项目公司成功发行8.7075亿美元（约60.5亿元）再融资长期绿色债券","summary":"2026年1月21日，晶科科技（601778.SH）宣布其与阿布扎比国家能源公司（TAQA）、阿布扎比未来能源公司（Masdar）及法国电力新能源公司共同间接持有的阿布扎比Al Dhafra光伏电站项目公司成功发行8.7075亿美元（约合32亿阿联酋迪拉姆）再融资长期绿色债券。（1美元=6.95人民币）","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/STXwjR4MWEbL5TQECiKgYA","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-21|阿布扎比|晶科科技宣布其与阿布扎比国家能源公司（TAQA）、阿布扎比未来能源公司（Masdar）及法国电力新能源公司共同持有的阿布扎比Al Dhafra光伏电站项目公司成功发行8.7075亿美元（约60.5亿元）再融资长期绿色债券"},{"date":"2026-01-20","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"法案","title":"意大利《官方公报》2026 年 1 月 20 日第 15 号公布关于 2025 年 11 月 21 日第 175 号法令的修订及转法，该法令涉及“转型 5.0 计划”及可再生能源生产方面的紧急措施","summary":"In this respect, the full list of the various categories of suitable areas, as amended by the Conversion Law, is set out below. Such variation in area is not permitted for ground mounted photovoltaic plants installed in agricultural areas. In addition, for the newly occupied areas, compliance is required with the provisions of Legislative Decree No. 42 of 2004 concerning cultural heritage and landscape authorizations (see Article 11-bis, paragraph 1, letter a of the TU FER). Areas adjacent to the motorway network within a distance not exceeding 300 meters. As is well known, the Decree finally introduced the long-awaited definition of standard agrivoltaic plants, defined as “photovoltaic plan","sourceUrl":"https://www.advant-nctm.com/en/news/aree-idonee-arriva-la-conversione-in-legge","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-20|意大利|意大利《官方公报》2026 年 1 月 20 日第 15 号公布关于 2025 年 11 月 21 日第 175 号法令的修订及转法，该法令涉及“转型 5.0 计划”及可再生能源生产方面的紧急措施"},{"date":"2026-01-17","country":"孟加拉","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"正泰","title":"正泰新能源孟加拉分公司与当地企业BRB电缆工业有限公司签署EPC总承包协议","summary":"正泰新能源孟加拉分公司与当地企业BRB电缆工业有限公司签署EPC总承包协议。根据协议，正泰新能源将为对方建设总容量10兆瓦的建筑一体化光伏系统。该项目包含7兆瓦工业厂房屋顶和3兆瓦医院屋顶光伏设施，是正泰新能源在孟加拉国推进的首个BIPV项目。","sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/q5cQcTegjIbLUNUHgQvHhw","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-17|孟加拉|正泰新能源孟加拉分公司与当地企业BRB电缆工业有限公司签署EPC总承包协议"},{"date":"2026-01-16","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"展会","title":"2026 年泰国太阳能及储能展将于 2026 年 1 月 28 日至 29 日在曼谷国际贸易展览中心（BITEC）举办","summary":"2026 年泰国太阳能及储能展将于 2026 年 1 月 28 日至 29 日在曼谷国际贸易展览中心（BITEC）举办。会议嘉宾来自政府、公用事业部门和行业的资深领袖，包括工业部 (MIND)工业部部长顾问、泰国国家电力局 (EGAT)水电与可再生能源主管、曼谷大都会管理局 (BMA)交通运输局局长、大都会电力局 (MEA) 智能电网与电力系统规划处电气工程师、亚洲清洁能源合作伙伴 (ACEP)高级能源系统经理、泰国光伏产业协会 (TPVA) 主席等。","sourceUrl":"https://vir.com.vn/solar-storage-live-thailand-2026-opens-144776.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-16|泰国|2026 年泰国太阳能及储能展将于 2026 年 1 月 28 日至 29 日在曼谷国际贸易展览中心（BITEC）举办"},{"date":"2026-01-16","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"数据中心退出","title":"菲律宾成为数据中心枢纽的雄心正面临高昂电价和以煤炭为主的电网的挑战","summary":"The Philippines’ ambition to become a data centre hub is running up against high electricity prices and a coal-heavy grid. Analysts say data centres could grow fast, yet competitiveness will depend on how quickly renewables, grid upgrades, permitting reforms and climate-resilient infrastructure actually materialise on the ground.","sourceUrl":"https://www.eco-business.com/news/high-costs-higher-risks-can-the-philippines-power-its-data-centre-hub-ambitions/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-16|菲律宾|菲律宾成为数据中心枢纽的雄心正面临高昂电价和以煤炭为主的电网的挑战"},{"date":"2026-01-15","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"天合","title":"天合光能任命 Tako Cleantech 为其泰国业务分销商，以加速当地屋顶光伏市场发展","summary":"Trinasolar Appoints Tako Cleantech as Distributor to Accelerate the Rooftop Solar Market in Thailand 天合光能任命 Tako Cleantech 为分销商，以加速泰国屋顶太阳能市场的发展。","sourceUrl":"https://www.newswit.com/en/ievou1i7im4i1liojs3gz5oft7pqwczm","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-15|泰国|天合光能任命 Tako Cleantech 为其泰国业务分销商，以加速当地屋顶光伏市场发展"},{"date":"2026-01-15","country":"尼日利亚","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"进口第二","title":"截至 2025 年 6 月的一年里，尼日利亚进口了 1721 MW光伏组件，满足该国 5%的需求","summary":"In the year to June, Nigeria imported 1,721 megawatts of photovoltaic panels—enough to meet 5% of the country’s demand—up from less than 500MW in 2021, according to climate think tank Ember. Nigeria has become second only to South Africa for solar imports on the continent. 在截至2025年6 月的一年里，尼日利亚进口了 1721 兆瓦的光伏电池板——足以满足该国 5%的需求——高于 2021 年的不足 500 兆瓦。尼日利亚已成为非洲大陆仅次于南非的第二大太阳能进口国。","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-01-15/a-solar-boom-in-rural-nigeria-lights-up-local-economies","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-15|尼日利亚|截至 2025 年 6 月的一年里，尼日利亚进口了 1721 MW光伏组件，满足该国 5%的需求"},{"date":"2026-01-15","country":"南非","geo":"非洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"收购","company":"Energea","title":"Energea 已收购 YO Residence 太阳能项目，交易价值约 46.2 万美元，内部收益率（IRR）为 13.88%","summary":"全球可再生能源开发商和运营商 Energea 已收购 YO Residence 太阳能项目，这是一个已全面投入运营的住宅太阳能加储能电池微网。YO Residence 微网为位于桑顿（Sandton）的一个拥有 101 个单元的住宅小区供电。该项目由 281.82 kW DC 屋顶太阳能系统和 700 kWh 电池储能系统（BESS）组成。此次交易价值约 46.2 万美元，预计内部收益率（IRR）为 13.88%。根据与 YO Residence 业主委员会签署的为期 20 年的太阳能租赁协议，该项目预计每年将产生超过 423 MWh 的电力。项目收入源自每千瓦时 2.66 兰特的固定能源费用以及每月的电池服务费，这两项费用均会根据年度消费者价格指数（CPI）进行挂钩调整。该设施采用了包括晶澳太阳能（JA Solar）组件、美格沃（Megarivo）逆变器和 LUMAX 支架系统在内的一线品牌设备，并已接入约翰内斯堡城市电网（City Power of Johannesburg）的配电网。","sourceUrl":"https://theelectricityhub.com/energea-acquires-residential-solar-plus-battery-microgrid-project-in-south-africa","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-15|南非|Energea 已收购 YO Residence 太阳能项目，交易价值约 46.2 万美元，内部收益率（IRR）为 13.88%"},{"date":"2026-01-14","country":"新加坡","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"2035增长","title":"根据最新数据显示，新加坡的太阳能装机容量预计将从 2024 年的约 1.57 GW 增长至 2035 年的 5.33 GW，未来十年将迎来强劲增长","summary":"Singapore is expected to see strong growth in solar power over the next decade as new data shows the country’s installed solar capacity could rise from about 1.57 GW in 2024 to 5.33 GW by 2035. 根据最新数据显示，新加坡的太阳能装机容量预计将从 2024 年的约 1.57 GW 增长至 2035 年的 5.33 GW，未来十年将迎来强劲增长。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/01/14/singapore-set-for-strong-solar-surge-as-solar-capacity-climbs-from-1-57-gw-to-5-33-gw-by-2035-globaldata/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-14|新加坡|根据最新数据显示，新加坡的太阳能装机容量预计将从 2024 年的约 1.57 GW 增长至 2035 年的 5.33 GW，未来十年将迎来强劲增长"},{"date":"2026-01-13","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"PDP","title":"马来亚银行证券（泰国）已将其对电力行业的看法从中性上调为积极","summary":"Thailand’s power sector is heading into 2026 with a more upbeat outlook, even as broader economic challenges weigh on the country. Ahead of the release of a new Power Development Plan (PDP), Maybank Securities (Thailand) has upgraded its view on the sector from neutral to positive. A key catalyst is the long-awaited PDP, expected to be released for public hearing soon. The new plan is likely to feature a larger pipeline of new power capacity than the previous draft, reflecting rising electricity demand driven by the expansion of data centers and accelerating electric vehicle (EV) adoption. 尽管更广泛的经济挑战给泰国带来压力，泰国电力行业在迈向 2026 年时前景更加乐观。在新的电力发展规划（PDP）发布之前，马来亚银行证券（泰国）已将其对该行业的看法从中性上调为积极。一个关键催化因素是备受期","sourceUrl":"https://www.reccessary.com/en/news/thailand-power-2026","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-13|泰国|马来亚银行证券（泰国）已将其对电力行业的看法从中性上调为积极"},{"date":"2026-01-13","country":"越南","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"余电上网","title":"越南工业与贸易部《电力法》第 57 号和第 58 号法令修正案草案提议将屋顶光伏系统余电上网比例从20%调升至50%","summary":"The Ministry of Industry and Trade has proposed rooftop solar power systems to be allowed to sell up to 50 per cent of surplus electricity to the national grid at market prices, from the current cap of 20 per cent. The proposal is highlighted in the third draft amendments to Decree 57 on direct power purchase agreements and Decree 58 on renewable and new energy development, both recently submitted to the Ministry of Justice for review. The draft also sets the purchase price for surplus electricity at the average electricity market price of the previous year, as published by the market operator, but not exceeding the price ceiling for comparable ground-mounted solar power.In addition, procedu","sourceUrl":"https://vietnamnews.vn/economy/1763453/proposal-to-allow-rooftop-solar-to-sell-up-to-50-per-cent-of-surplus-power-to-grid.html","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-13|越南|越南工业与贸易部《电力法》第 57 号和第 58 号法令修正案草案提议将屋顶光伏系统余电上网比例从20%调升至50%"},{"date":"2026-01-09","country":"香港","geo":"中国","category":"同行动态","eventType":"金融","company":"正泰","title":"正泰电器宣布拟赴香港IPO上市","summary":"正泰电器宣布拟赴香港IPO上市。此次“A+H”布局的核心目标之一是加速其国际化战略，通过国际融资渠道支持全球业务扩张。","sourceUrl":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202601063610487680.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-09|香港|正泰电器宣布拟赴香港IPO上市"},{"date":"2026-01-09","country":"中国","geo":"中国","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"出口退税","title":"中国财政部和国家税务总局宣布，自2026年4月1日起，光伏产品出口增值税退税率（此前为9%）全面取消；电池产品退税率则从4月1日起从9%降至6%，并于2027年1月1日起完全取消","summary":"中国财政部和国家税务总局宣布，自2026年4月1日起，光伏产品出口增值税退税率（此前为9%）全面取消；电池产品退税率则从4月1日起从9%降至6%，并于2027年1月1日起完全取消。","sourceUrl":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/01/09/china-to-abolish-solar-export-tax-rebates-from-april/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-09|中国|中国财政部和国家税务总局宣布，自2026年4月1日起，光伏产品出口增值税退税率（此前为9%）全面取消；电池产品退税率则从4月1日起从9%降至6%，并于2027年1月1日起完全取消"},{"date":"2026-01-08","country":"/","geo":"全球","category":"同行动态","eventType":"合作","company":"晶科","title":"晶泰科技与晶科能源将共建合资公司，推动AI+光伏研发","summary":"晶泰科技与晶科能源将共建合资公司，推动AI+光伏研发。","sourceUrl":"https://www.energytrend.com/news/20260108-50721.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2026-01-08|/|晶泰科技与晶科能源将共建合资公司，推动AI+光伏研发"},{"date":"2026-01-08","country":"马来西亚","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"碳税","title":"马来西亚计划在 2026 年引入碳税，钢铁、能源等行业可能是 2026 年碳税生效时首批覆盖的行业之一","summary":"Malaysia plans to introduce a carbon tax in 2026. As the new year begins, the clock is also starting to run on how prepared Malaysian companies are for carbon pricing. While key details are still being finalized, government signals over the past year have begun to narrow the range of uncertainty. In November 2025, policymakers floated an initial carbon tax rate of RM 15 (USD 3.58) per tonne of emissions, while Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim confirmed in his October budget speech that iron, steel and energy companies would be among the first sectors covered when the tax takes effect in 2026. 马来西亚计划在 2026 年引入碳税。尽管关键细节仍在敲定中，过去一年的政府信号已开始缩小不确定范围。2025 年 11 月，政策制定者提出了每吨排放 15 令吉（约 3.58 美元）的初始碳税税率，而首相安","sourceUrl":"https://www.reccessary.com/en/news/malaysia-carbon-tax-readiness","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-08|马来西亚|马来西亚计划在 2026 年引入碳税，钢铁、能源等行业可能是 2026 年碳税生效时首批覆盖的行业之一"},{"date":"2026-01-08","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"数据","company":"UGT1","title":"受可再生能源证书价格下跌影响，光伏证书价格从 1.81 美元/兆瓦时降至 0.55 美元/兆瓦时","summary":"Thailand floats lower 2026 green utility tariff rate. The proposed 2026 premium for the Utility Green Tariff 1 (UGT1) scheme is Bt0.0375/kWh ($1.19/MWh), 37pc lower on the year, according to a consultation paper by the country's Energy Regulatory Commission released on 7 January. UGT1 matches end-users' power consumption with hydropower international renewable energy certificates (I-RECs). The premium is applied on top of corporate customers' power bills. 泰国拟下调 2026 年绿色公用事业电价。2026 年公用事业绿色电价 1（UGT1）方案的拟议溢价为 0.0375 泰铢/千瓦时（1.19 美元/兆瓦时），同比下降 37%。UGT1 将终端用户的用电量与水电国际可再生能源证书（I-RECs）进行匹配。该溢价在企业客户的电费基础上额外收取。","sourceUrl":"https://www.argusmedia.com/es/news-and-insights/latest-market-news/2773175-thailand-floats-lower-2026-green-utility-tariff-rate","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-08|泰国|受可再生能源证书价格下跌影响，光伏证书价格从 1.81 美元/兆瓦时降至 0.55 美元/兆瓦时"},{"date":"2026-01-07","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"施耐德","title":"菲律宾可再生能源公司 ACEN 将通过购电协议（PPA），向施耐德电气在菲律宾的 5 个制造基地和办公场所供应可再生电力，使其位于甲美地经济区（Cavite Economic Zone）的甲美智能工厂实现 100% 绿电","summary":"French electrical equipment maker Schneider Electric (EPA:SU) has tapped ACEN Corp (PSE:ACEN), the renewable energy arm of the Philippines' Ayala, for the supply of renewable power for five of its manufacturing sites in the Philippines.The power purchase agreement (PPA) will enable American Power Conversion (APC) by Schneider Electric to switch to 100% renewable energy at its locations in the Cavite Economic Zone, ACEN said on Tuesday. The deal was awarded to ACEN Renewable Energy Solutions (ACEN RES) under the Philippine government’s Green Energy Option Programme (GEOP).The renewable power procurement covers five plants primarily focused on semiconductor manufacturing and Schneider Electric","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/acen-to-supply-renewable-power-to-schneider-electric-philippine-ops-1287577/","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-07|菲律宾|菲律宾可再生能源公司 ACEN 将通过购电协议（PPA），向施耐德电气在菲律宾的 5 个制造基地和办公场所供应可再生电力，使其位于甲美地经济区（Cavite Economic Zone）的甲美智能工厂实现 100% 绿电"},{"date":"2026-01-07","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"TIDE","title":"意大利电力调度的新监管框架（即 TIDE）将于 2026 年 2 月 1 日进入巩固阶段，并持续至 2028 年","summary":"Italy's new regulatory framework for electricity dispatching, known as TIDE, will enter its consolidation phase on 1 February 2026 and run until 2028. Italy has also shortened its balancing timeframe to 15 minutes, from hourly intervals, to better integrate variable renewables and harmonise with other European markets. Under TIDE, non-dispatchable renewable sources such as solar and wind will be allowed to participate in the balancing market. The framework also enables the aggregation of different resources, opening participation to small-scale producers and consumers, energy communities and virtually aggregated mixed units. Aggregation can take place at either zonal or nodal level, with the","sourceUrl":"https://www.argusmedia.com/ja/news-and-insights/latest-market-news/2772776-italy-to-update-power-dispatching-rules","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-07|意大利|意大利电力调度的新监管框架（即 TIDE）将于 2026 年 2 月 1 日进入巩固阶段，并持续至 2028 年"},{"date":"2026-01-06","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"项目融资","title":"亚洲基础设施投资银行已批准为印尼东爪哇省帕苏鲁安（Pasuruan）100 MW光伏项目提供 2100 万美元（1.47亿元）的非主权融资","summary":"The Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank has approved a USD 21 million non-sovereign financing for Indonesia’s Pasuruan 100 MW solar PV project, marking another step in the country’s efforts to expand its renewable energy capacity and reduce carbon emissions. The project is being supported under the Proyek Hijaunesia Staple Financing initiative and will be developed as a greenfield, ground-mounted solar power plant in Pasuruan, East Java. The financing is being co-arranged with the Asian Development Bank acting as the lead partner. The project will follow the Asian Development Bank’s Safeguard Policy Statement along with all applicable Indonesian environmental and social regulations. The sol","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/01/06/indonesias-pasuruan-100-mw-solar-project-secures-usd-21-million-financing-for-clean-energy-expansion","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-06|印尼|亚洲基础设施投资银行已批准为印尼东爪哇省帕苏鲁安（Pasuruan）100 MW光伏项目提供 2100 万美元（1.47亿元）的非主权融资"},{"date":"2026-01-06","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"项目","company":"Constant Energy","title":"Constant Energy 为泰国最大的橱柜行业木制品制造商之一的Unicabinet 建设的 3 MW屋顶光伏项目已成功投运","summary":"亚洲领先的可再生能源供应商 Constant Energy 已成功完成并投运了为 Unicabinet Industry Co., Ltd. 建设的 3 兆瓦屋顶太阳能项目。Unicabinet 是泰国最大的橱柜行业木制品制造商之一。该太阳能设施位于巴真府（Prachin Buri）是玛哈坡县（Si Maha Phot）的 318 Hua Wa，总装机容量为 3.07 兆瓦。在为期 25 年的合同期内，该系统预计将减少约 45,711 吨二氧化碳排放，助力泰国实现国家气候和脱碳目标。","sourceUrl":"https://solarquarter.com/2026/01/06/constant-energy-commissions-3-mw-rooftop-solar-project-for-unicabinet-in-thailand/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-06|泰国|Constant Energy 为泰国最大的橱柜行业木制品制造商之一的Unicabinet 建设的 3 MW屋顶光伏项目已成功投运"},{"date":"2026-01-03","country":"美国","geo":"美洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"金融","company":"系统销售","title":"“租购”或“预付租赁”新模式：房主预先支付系统费用，安装商则将10,000 美元税收抵免优惠作为折扣返还","summary":"Walker said installers who sold systems are now switching to a new model that lets residents ultimately own their solar and battery arrays while securing the savings from leasing. Called lease-to-own or a prepaid lease, a homeowner pays for the cost of the system upfront and the installer passes on the tax credit benefits as a discount. The solar company must retain ownership for a certain number of years under the tax code but then transfers title to the homeowner. Walker 表示，过去销售系统的安装商现在正转向一种新模式，让居民最终能够拥有自己的太阳能和电池阵列，同时还能获得租赁带来的节省。这种模式被称为“租购”或“预付租赁”，房主预先支付系统费用，安装商则将税收抵免优惠作为折扣返还。根据税法，太阳能公司必须保留一定年限的所有权，之后再将所有权转让给房主。","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-01-03/tariffs-manufacturing-rules-to-raise-home-solar-prices-in-2026","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-03|美国|“租购”或“预付租赁”新模式：房主预先支付系统费用，安装商则将10,000 美元税收抵免优惠作为折扣返还"},{"date":"2026-01-02","country":"日本","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"电力","company":"东芝","title":"东芝旗下半导体制造子公司已与 Kunishitaike Mega Float (KMF) 签署了一份虚拟购电协议（vPPA），以获取日本香川县三木町7.8MW漂浮水上光伏项目的环境权益证书，项目于2025年 12 月投入商业运营","summary":"Japan Semiconductor, the chip manufacturing subsidiary of Japanese conglomerate Toshiba, has signed a virtual Power Purchase Agreement with Kunishitaike Mega Float (KMF) to acquire environmental attribute certificates from a floating solar project in Kagawa Prefecture, Japan. Under the terms of the agreement, KMF parent company OTS will supply Japan Semiconductor with environmental value derived from the 7.8MW Kunishitaike floating solar plant located in Miki Town, Kagawa Prefecture. The facility is one of the largest floating solar plants in the world, and reached commercial operations in December of last year. 日本半导体（Japan Semiconductor）是日本企业集团东芝旗下的芯片制造子公司，该公司已与 Kunishitaike Mega Float (KMF","sourceUrl":"https://www.datacenterdynamics.com/en/news/japan-semiconductor-signs-floating-solar-vppa-in-japan","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2026-01-02|日本|东芝旗下半导体制造子公司已与 Kunishitaike Mega Float (KMF) 签署了一份虚拟购电协议（vPPA），以获取日本香川县三木町7.8MW漂浮水上光伏项目的环境权益证书，项目于2025年 12 月投入商业运营"},{"date":"2025-12-31","country":"意大利","geo":"欧洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"创维","title":"创维与意大利当地合作伙伴成立的合资企业，将在意大利奥克雷镇（Ocre）建设一座 10 MW分布式光伏电站，创维负责该电站的整体建设和关键设备的供应，该项目已处于待建阶段（RTB），并已确保纳入意大利政府的上网电价补贴拍卖机制","summary":"Chinese photovoltaic solutions provider Skyworth PV, part of Skyworth Group (HKG:0751), has received a contract to implement a 10 MW distributed photovoltaic power plant in the Italian town of Ocre, expanding its European project portfolio.Skyworth will be responsible for the plant’s overall construction and supply of key equipment, the company said on Wednesday. The project will be carried out by a joint venture between the Chinese company and a local Italian partner. The solar park will be located near the border of Italy’s Lazio and Abruzzo regions. The project is now in the ready-to-build stage and has secured inclusion in the Italian government’s feed-in tariff auction mechanism. When o","sourceUrl":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/skyworth-pv-secures-contract-for-10-mw-solar-project-in-italy-1287447/","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2025-12-31|意大利|创维与意大利当地合作伙伴成立的合资企业，将在意大利奥克雷镇（Ocre）建设一座 10 MW分布式光伏电站，创维负责该电站的整体建设和关键设备的供应，该项目已处于待建阶段（RTB），并已确保纳入意大利政府的上网电价补贴拍卖机制"},{"date":"2025-12-31","country":"印尼","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"电价","title":"印尼政府通过能源与矿产资源部 (ESDM) 确定2026 年第一季度（1 月至 3 月）13 类非补贴用户群体的电价维持不变","summary":"Mengawali tahun 2026, Pemerintah melalui Kementerian Energi dan Sumber Daya Mineral (ESDM) menetapkan tarif tenaga listrik Triwulan I (Januari-Maret) tahun 2026 bagi 13 golongan pelanggan non-subsidi tetap atau tidak mengalami perubahan. Hal tersebut disampaikan oleh Pelaksana Tugas (Plt) Direktur Jenderal Ketenagalistrikan Kementerian ESDM, Tri Winarno, di Jakarta, Rabu (31/12/2025). Sesuai Peraturan Menteri ESDM Nomor 7 Tahun 2024 tentang Tarif Tenaga Listrik yang Disediakan oleh PT PLN (Persero), penyesuaian tarif tenaga listrik bagi pelanggan non-subsidi dilakukan setiap tiga bulan dengan mengacu pada perubahan realisasi parameter ekonomi makro, meliputi kurs, Indonesian Crude Price (ICP","sourceUrl":"https://www.esdm.go.id/en/media-center/news-archives/jaga-stabilitas-awal-tahun-2026-pemerintah-putuskan-tarif-listrik-tetap","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2025-12-31|印尼|印尼政府通过能源与矿产资源部 (ESDM) 确定2026 年第一季度（1 月至 3 月）13 类非补贴用户群体的电价维持不变"},{"date":"2025-12-29","country":"泰国","geo":"亚洲","category":"市场信息","eventType":"要求","company":"户用光伏要求","title":"泰国工程学会（EIT）预计到 2026 年，泰国户用光伏系统成本在 15- 40万泰铢（3.3-8.8万元），分别对应5 kWp 纯光伏系统和 10 kWp/ 14 kWh 光储系统","summary":"According to Mr Techatat Buranaaudsawakul, Chairman of the Electrical Engineering Department at the Engineering Institute of Thailand (EIT), rooftop solar should be treated as part of a home’s critical electrical infrastructure, not simply an add-on appliance. In 2026, a typical residential rooftop solar system in Thailand is expected to cost between 150,000 and 400,000 baht, depending on system capacity and whether battery energy storage system (BESS) is included. For instance, a 5 kWp system without battery will cost around 150,000 baht, while a 10 kWp system and a 14 kWh BESS could cost up to approximately 400,000 baht. While falling equipment prices have made solar more accessible, exper","sourceUrl":"https://www.bangkokpost.com/business/general/3165493/the-2026-rooftop-solar-buyers-guide-what-thai-homeowners-should-look-for","sourceSheet":"市场信息","id":"市场信息|2025-12-29|泰国|泰国工程学会（EIT）预计到 2026 年，泰国户用光伏系统成本在 15- 40万泰铢（3.3-8.8万元），分别对应5 kWp 纯光伏系统和 10 kWp/ 14 kWh 光储系统"},{"date":"2025-12-02","country":"土耳其","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"正泰","title":"正泰与土耳其烟草公司OTP合作投建的4.55MWp光伏电站宣布并网发电","summary":"正泰与土耳其烟草公司OTP合作投建的光伏电站宣布并网发电。","sourceUrl":"https://mnewenergy.in-en.com/html/newenergy-2446434.shtml","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2025-12-02|土耳其|正泰与土耳其烟草公司OTP合作投建的4.55MWp光伏电站宣布并网发电"},{"date":"2025-11-28","country":"菲律宾","geo":"亚洲","category":"同行动态","eventType":"项目","company":"正泰","title":"正泰新能源在菲律宾Butuan的100MW光伏电站正式开工","summary":"正泰新能源在菲律宾Butuan的100MW光伏电站正式开工","sourceUrl":"https://energy.chint.com/news/detail/id/1084.html","sourceSheet":"同行动态","id":"同行动态|2025-11-28|菲律宾|正泰新能源在菲律宾Butuan的100MW光伏电站正式开工"}];
